window.SPEECH_RECORDS=[{"title_en":"Start with a measurable model, before asking it to drive","zh":"最早能追溯到的工作，并不是让一个已经学会驾驶的网络继续训练。我先取得一个已有的果蝇连接组实现。它提供筛选后的神经元、连接、正负权重、神经动力学、感觉编码和人工编写的运动读出。保留下来的图有176,422个节点和6,287,749条聚合连接。项目最初保留这些计算规则，另加不依赖Minecraft身体的运行入口、刺激程序、车辆接口和记录工具。这样才能逐层问：输入送到了哪里，哪些细胞有反应，读出有没有变化。这里先采用0.5毫秒积分和50毫秒记录窗。不同于后来可训练的连续核心，此时运行的是固定的Java脉冲网络。先验证它会工作，再讨论它能否转方向。","en":"I began by separating an existing fruit-fly model from the Minecraft body that normally used it. The upstream project supplied the graph, signed connection weights, sensory encoders, spiking dynamics and an authored motor decoder. The retained graph contained 176,422 neurons and 6,287,749 aggregated connections. I added a command-line test entry point, controlled stimuli and recording tools; the vehicle adapter came later. This let me observe sensory input, neural activity and motor output separately from the upstream fallback actions. The first model used fixed Java spiking dynamics, a 0.5-millisecond integration step and 50-millisecond recording windows. Before building a trainable driving system, I needed to check that this implementation responded at all.","title_zh":"先把已有连接组程序拆成可独立测量的核心","id":"step-001","summary_en":"I separated the existing fly model from the Minecraft body so I could test its inputs and outputs before connecting it to a car.","summary_zh":"我先把已有果蝇模型从 Minecraft 身体中分离出来，单独观察输入和输出，再准备接入车辆。"},{"title_en":"Check that silence and a known sensory pathway work","zh":"如果视觉刺激没有转向，首先要排除程序根本没在工作。因此先做两个600毫秒控制。无输入时，网络记录到零个脉冲。另一个控制使用上游文档中的糖感觉刺激，共记录到59,957个脉冲，两个MN9神经元的50毫秒群体采样为30到90赫兹。它说明在这套设置下，程序可以从已有感觉入口产生可测的运动相关输出。有了这个参照，后面的视觉零输出才有明确位置：我需要查视觉接口和读出，而不是把所有零结果都归为程序失效。","en":"I first checked two known conditions, each lasting 600 milliseconds. With no input, the network produced no spikes. The sugar-sensory stimulus described by the upstream project produced 59,957 spikes, including activity in the two MN9 neurons. Their population rates, measured in 50-millisecond windows, ranged from 30 to 90 hertz. These controls established that the program could produce a measurable sensory-to-motor response under the chosen settings. When later visual tests produced no turn, I could therefore investigate the visual interface and readout rather than assume that the whole program had failed.","title_zh":"确认网络可安静，也可对已知输入响应","id":"step-002","summary_en":"Silence produced no spikes, while the known sugar pathway produced activity. This gave the later visual tests a working reference.","summary_zh":"无输入时没有脉冲，已知的糖感觉通路却能产生反应。这给后面的视觉测试提供了正常工作的参照。"},{"title_en":"A bright spot reached the visual input but produced no turn","zh":"第一个视觉问题很直接：在暗背景中放一个亮点，模型会不会给出左右转向？这最接近最初的虚拟光刺激想法。每条序列从新网络开始，内部按基线、中央、第一侧、中央、另一侧和撤除连续运行。另一条序列反转左右顺序，每段500毫秒。我没有给输出神经元强塞动作，也没有训练参数。记录显示，视网膜和早期视觉群确实接收到刺激，但所有采样窗的原始转向和解码转向都是零。因此下一步没有直接放大输出，而是先让目标动起来，检验静态刺激是否遗漏了当前接口需要的变化。","en":"The first visual test asked whether a bright spot on a dark background could produce a directional output. Each sequence started a fresh network. Within the sequence, state carried through baseline, centre, one side, centre, the other side and stimulus withdrawal. A mirrored sequence reversed the order, and each phase lasted 500 milliseconds. I neither trained the parameters nor supplied a desired action to the output cells. Retinal and early visual populations received input, but both the raw turning signal and the decoded turning signal stayed at zero in every saved window. I next tested movement before changing the input gain or output mapping.","title_zh":"亮点进入视网膜后能否形成转向","id":"step-003","summary_en":"A bright spot reached the early visual cells but produced no turning output. I next tried movement before changing the model.","summary_zh":"亮点已经进入早期视觉细胞，却没有产生转向输出。我接着先测试运动刺激，没有立即修改模型。"},{"title_en":"Motion alone did not activate the turning output","zh":"静态亮点没有转向后，我把刺激换成亮背景上的移动暗目标。核心、读出和内部参数保持原样，上游的高层对象特征仍然关闭。这一步优先只改目标运动，因为它能回答一个具体问题：前一次是不是因为没有足够的视觉变化？结果仍是两条左右镜像序列的转向读出全零。早期视觉输入有效，所以这里保留的是一个真正的负结果。下一步单独启用上游已有的对象特征入口，比较输入层级，而不是把更高层特征的效果混称为原始图像感知。","en":"After the static spot produced no turn, I presented a moving dark target on a bright background. The neural core, internal parameters and readout stayed unchanged, and the upstream object-feature channels stayed disabled. This tested whether the missing ingredient was visual movement rather than brightness at a fixed position. Both mirrored sequences again produced zero turning output despite activity in the early visual input. I then enabled the upstream higher-level object-feature channels in a separate test. Keeping those conditions separate allowed me to distinguish responses to retinal brightness from responses to explicitly supplied object features.","title_zh":"静态无转向，移动亮度能否有效","id":"step-004","summary_en":"Moving the target still produced no turn with brightness input alone. I then tested the upstream object-feature channels separately.","summary_zh":"只让目标移动，仍未从亮度输入获得转向。我随后单独开启上游的对象特征通道。"},{"title_en":"Object features produced activity without reliable left–right control","zh":"下行神经元是此处选作运动相关输出的群，我读取它们的计算活动。启用对象特征后，下行神经元和转向终于有了非零变化。但问题马上变成：这种变化能否稳定地区分左右？正常顺序中，左目标、后来的右目标和撤除末段的原始转向均值分别为−0.52、−0.64和−0.62。镜像顺序则是+0.14、+0.06和零。两个顺序不只是换了标签，中间目标的运动轨迹和网络状态也不同。尤其是撤除后仍有DNa02左侧活动，说明余波不全来自输出平滑。当前入口能影响模型，但还不能接成可信的双向方向控制。于是我让每侧刺激都从一个新网络开始，减少前面阶段留下的状态影响。","en":"Enabling the object-feature channels produced activity in the selected descending neurons and a nonzero turning output. It did not produce a reliable left–right distinction. In the original sequence, mean raw turning output near the end of each phase was −0.52 for the left target, −0.64 for the later right target and −0.62 after withdrawal. The mirrored sequence gave +0.14, +0.06 and zero. Both stimulus order and internal history differed between these sequences. In one condition, left DNa02 activity continued after the target disappeared, placing part of the persistence inside the neural output rather than only in decoder smoothing. I next tested each side from a fresh network to reduce carryover between stimuli.","title_zh":"对象特征产生了下行输出，但左右控制仍不可靠","id":"step-005","summary_en":"Object features produced a turning response, but its direction depended on stimulus order and history. I next started each side from a fresh network.","summary_zh":"对象特征带来了转向反应，但方向受刺激顺序和历史影响。我接着让每侧测试都从新网络开始。"},{"title_en":"The first vehicle connection failed before testing began","zh":"神经刺激测试之外，我也要建立课程模拟器接口。第一次连接失败时，模拟器进程还没有运行，因此没有发送驾驶动作，也没有车辆行为可解释。这是一个独立的工程停止点。我保留这次失败，然后启动并核验已有的CourseSim程序，再从场景菜单和就绪消息开始检查。","en":"The first attempt to connect to the course simulator failed because the simulator process was not running. No vehicle command was sent. I then started the existing CourseSim executable and checked the menu, readiness messages and vehicle data. This was a failure in setting up the vehicle connection, before any neural-driving experiment could begin.","title_zh":"先确认课程模拟器能连接","id":"step-006","summary_en":"The first connection failed because the simulator was not running. I started it before trying the vehicle interface again.","summary_zh":"第一次连接时模拟器没有运行。我先启动模拟器，再检查车辆接口。"},{"title_en":"Decimal commas made the simulator messages invalid JSON","zh":"模拟器启动后，遥测开始出现，但Windows环境把小数写成逗号形式。严格JSON解析因此失败。这里的修复很窄：先尝试标准解析，只对未加引号的对象数字修复小数分隔符，同时保留原始字节、原始错误和每个改动。我没有改系统区域设置或课程资产。修复后，仍需要完整验证从菜单选择场景到收到就绪消息的过程，不能因为已经读到几个坐标就跳过这个步骤。","en":"Once the simulator started, messages arrived, but its Windows number format used decimal commas. The strict JSON reader rejected those numbers. I changed the reader to try ordinary JSON first and repair only the affected unquoted numeric fields when necessary. The original message bytes, parsing error and corrections were saved. I left the operating-system locale and course assets unchanged. Receiving valid coordinates was only the first check: scene selection and the complete readiness sequence still needed testing.","title_zh":"遥测已来，但小数格式阻止解析","id":"step-007","summary_en":"The simulator wrote decimal commas that the data reader could not parse. I corrected those number fields and kept the original messages for checking.","summary_zh":"模拟器把小数写成逗号格式，接收程序无法解析。我只修正受影响的数字字段，并保存原消息供核对。"},{"title_en":"Fresh starts did not make the directional response consistent","zh":"为了减少前一个目标造成的状态影响，接下来每个单侧脉冲都使用新网络。三个技术种子各做左、右两次，共六条记录。每条先基线500毫秒，刺激500毫秒，再撤除1000毫秒。左刺激末段原始转向为+0.12、+0.08和+0.06；右侧为−0.04、−0.02和零。这与此前某条连续序列的符号不同。其中一个左侧试验撤除后又出现−0.63的持续偏置，其余五条末段为零。新起点没有带来稳定可恢复的双向行为。我保留结果，下一步检查另一个已有、文档明确的HS自转线索入口。","en":"I started a fresh network for each left or right pulse. Three technical seeds each received both sides, giving six trials. Each trial contained 500 milliseconds of baseline, 500 milliseconds of stimulation and 1,000 milliseconds after withdrawal. The left-stimulus tail means were +0.12, +0.08 and +0.06; the right-stimulus means were −0.04, −0.02 and zero. These signs differed from the earlier continuous sequence. One left trial developed a persistent −0.63 withdrawal tail, while the other five ended at zero. Fresh starts therefore did not establish consistent turning in both directions or consistent release after withdrawal. I next tested the upstream HS self-rotation input.","title_zh":"输出偏置是否只是前一个目标留下的状态","id":"step-008","summary_en":"Fresh starts did not make the left and right responses consistent, and one withdrawal tail persisted. I next tested the documented self-rotation input.","summary_zh":"重新初始化仍未使左右反应一致，一次撤除后还持续输出。我随后测试已有的自转线索入口。"},{"title_en":"A scene already open could not test whether scene loading worked","zh":"后续连接碰到另一个状态问题：模拟器已经在场景里。虽然能读到遥测，但原本要核验的菜单选择和加载顺序没有实际发生，因此这次没有通过完整验收。我没有把收到数据改写成成功加载，而是保留该记录，将实验拥有的模拟器重新启动到菜单，再执行同一场景请求。","en":"A later connection received vehicle data from a scene that was already open. It had not exercised menu selection or scene loading, so it did not verify the complete startup sequence. I restarted the simulator used by the experiment at its menu and repeated the explicit scene request. This separated connection lifecycle checks from questions about neural control and driving quality.","title_zh":"已经进入场景的连接不能当成完整加载验证","id":"step-009","summary_en":"Receiving data from an already open scene did not test scene loading. I restarted from the menu and repeated the full loading sequence.","summary_zh":"已经打开场景时能收到数据，还不足以确认加载流程。我回到菜单，重新检查选场景和等待车辆就绪的全过程。"},{"title_en":"The self-rotation cue reached the intended side but left a lasting bias","zh":"这一轮输入不再是相机或移动目标，而是上游已有的解析HS自转线索。我使用均匀亮度、没有对象，给出±300度每秒的输入。三个种子各测两个方向。正输入驱动左侧HS，负输入驱动右侧，入口侧别按预期工作。可是正刺激的转向尾均值为−0.08、−0.32和−0.32，负刺激为+0.02、−0.04和−0.20。负刺激撤除后，三个种子仍分别保留−0.50、−0.50和−0.46的偏置。我现在看到的是具体输入关联的持续状态，需要用同背景、零自转线索的控制进一步区分。","en":"I supplied an analytic self-rotation cue through the upstream HS input, with uniform brightness and no objects. This cue was provided directly; it was not calculated from a camera image. Three seeds each received +300 and −300 source degrees per second. Positive input activated left HS and negative input activated right HS, confirming the intended side of entry. Turning remained asymmetric. The positive-stimulus tail means were −0.08, −0.32 and −0.32; the negative-stimulus means were +0.02, −0.04 and −0.20. After negative stimulation ended, the tails remained at −0.50, −0.50 and −0.46. I next ran matched zero-cue controls.","title_zh":"直接提供自转线索后能否双向输出","id":"step-010","summary_en":"The self-rotation cue activated the intended HS side, but turning stayed asymmetric and sometimes persisted after withdrawal.","summary_zh":"自转线索激活了预期一侧的HS细胞，但转向仍不对称，撤除后有时还会持续。"},{"title_en":"The matched no-input test stayed at zero","zh":"三个匹配控制保持相同亮度、种子和流程，只让HS自转线索恒为零。它们的HS和转向尾部都为零。这个比较把问题收窄了：先前的持续偏置与被测非零输入有关，不能直接归为任何时候都会出现的同一种输出。但内部为什么保留这种状态仍未查明。下一步我更严格地清除外部驱动，观察内部状态保留后输出是否还能持续。","en":"The three controls used the same brightness, seeds and timing as the self-rotation trials, but kept the HS cue at zero. Both HS activity and the raw turning tail stayed at zero. The persistent bias was therefore associated with the tested nonzero cue, rather than appearing in every condition. Its internal cause was still unknown. In the next diagnostic, I removed all external drive after stimulation while keeping the network state, to test whether the remaining background input was needed to sustain the response.","title_zh":"持续输出是否在没有HS输入时也出现","id":"step-011","summary_en":"Matched zero-cue controls stayed at zero. I next removed all external drive to see whether the earlier residual required continuing input.","summary_zh":"匹配的零线索对照始终为零。我接着撤去全部外部驱动，检查残余活动是否需要持续输入。"},{"title_en":"Scene loading and stationary telemetry passed their checks","zh":"模拟器重新回到菜单后，我明确请求Warren，等到车辆就绪，再发送零转向、零油门和全制动。最终记录到390条有限位置和朝向遥测，时间从0.0351增加到19.4851秒，末速度约为9.27×10⁻⁸。另有六条短非协议消息单独保留，没有混入遥测计数。这一步证明连接、场景请求、就绪和数据记录可用。它还没有测转向符号、反复重置或神经驾驶，因此后面单独安排动作响应测试。","en":"From the simulator menu, I requested Warren, waited for vehicle readiness and sent zero steering, zero throttle and full brake. The run saved 390 vehicle-data packets with finite position and orientation values. Simulator time increased from 0.0351 to 19.4851 seconds, and final speed was approximately 9.27 × 10⁻⁸ simulator units. Six short lines outside the data protocol were kept separately. The scene-request, readiness and stationary-data sequence now worked. I could next measure steering direction, braking and repeatable resets before coupling the model to the car.","title_zh":"车辆场景、遥测和静止命令终于贯通","id":"step-012","summary_en":"Scene loading and stationary data collection worked. I could next measure steering, braking and repeatable starts.","summary_zh":"场景加载和静止数据采集终于连通了。接下来才有条件分别测转向、刹车和重复起点。"},{"title_en":"Neural output persisted after external input was removed","zh":"前一次所谓撤除，只是把自转线索归零，普通亮度背景还在。因此这次专门问：持续输出是否依赖这个外部背景？三个种子各做正常撤除和严格外部清零，共六次。刺激前记录逐项匹配；严格组在编码后把外部脉冲发生器和注入电流都清零，但保留细胞状态、待发突触事件和解码器状态。撤除最后500毫秒，左DNa02仍为28到40赫兹，原始转向仍为负。持续外部输入不是这段1000毫秒残余的必要条件。这里已经能解释为什么只调输出平滑不够，但还不能指定是哪条内部回路造成。因此下一步保留状态，直接给反向刺激。","en":"Earlier withdrawal tests had removed the self-rotation cue while leaving ordinary brightness input active. I compared that procedure with removal of all external drive. Three seeds received both conditions, giving six trials with matching records before the intervention. In the removal condition, I cleared external Poisson drive and injected current after encoding, but kept cell state, pending synaptic events and decoder state. During the final 500 milliseconds, left DNa02 still fired at 28–40 hertz and raw turning output remained negative. External input was therefore unnecessary for the observed 1,000-millisecond residual, although its internal source remained unknown. I next tested whether an opposite stimulus could reverse it.","title_zh":"撤掉所有外部驱动后，偏置是否仍存在","id":"step-013","summary_en":"Turning-related activity continued after all external drive was removed. I then tested whether opposite stimulation could reverse it.","summary_zh":"全部外部驱动撤去后，转向相关活动仍持续。我随后测试反向刺激能否改变输出。"},{"title_en":"A Python import error stopped the action test before any command","zh":"独立的车辆动作测试第一次没有进入实验。项目使用的隔离式Python没有自动把脚本目录加到导入路径，旁边的模块因此找不到。修正只显式加入当前脚本的绝对目录，不改运行时配置。这里没有神经计算结果，也没有发送给车的动作。两个新进程检查通过后，才启动真正的短动作序列。","en":"The first independent vehicle-response test stopped while importing a neighbouring Python module. The isolated runtime had not added the script directory to its search path. I explicitly added the resolved directory in the entry point, without changing the runtime configuration. The failed attempt created no experiment and sent no vehicle command. After import and host checks passed in a fresh process, I ran the short action sequence.","title_zh":"动作响应测试在导入模块时停止","id":"step-014","summary_en":"The action test stopped at a Python import error before sending a command. I repaired how the script found its neighbouring module.","summary_zh":"动作测试尚未发送命令，就因 Python 找不到相邻模块而停止。我修正了脚本的模块搜索路径。"},{"title_en":"Centring the wheel did not restore the earlier heading","zh":"这一轮不接神经网络，只测车辆本身。固定油门0.1，分别给−0.15和+0.15转向，中间回到中性轮角，最后制动。144条遥测显示，两个有符号阶段车头分别变化约−2.607和+4.498；中间直轮阶段只变化+0.0125，车头保持在已经转过的方向附近。末速度降到约1.36×10⁻⁷。两个方向开始时速度不同，不能据此比较左右增益。这个结果提醒我：轮角、角速度和车头方向是不同量。接神经模型之前，必须说明输入代表什么、输出对应哪一个车辆量，而不是把所有正负号直接当成同一个方向标签。","en":"With the neural model disconnected, I held throttle at 0.1 and applied steering −0.15 and +0.15, returning the wheels to neutral between pulses and braking at the end. Across 144 packets, the steering phases changed reported yaw by approximately −2.607 and +4.498 degrees. During the neutral-wheel interval, yaw changed by only +0.0125 and stayed near the heading already reached. Final speed fell to about 1.36 × 10⁻⁷. The pulses began at different speeds, so they did not measure a matched left–right gain. They did show why the adapter had to distinguish wheel command, turning rate and heading: centring the wheels did not undo the earlier turn.","title_zh":"转向命令怎样改变车头方向","id":"step-015","summary_en":"Returning the wheels to neutral did not restore the car's previous heading. The controller therefore needed to distinguish wheel angle from turning and heading.","summary_zh":"方向盘回正后，车头仍保持已经转过的方向。因此控制器必须分清转向命令、转动速度和车头朝向。"},{"title_en":"Opposite input did not reliably reverse the output","zh":"接下来直接检验反向刺激。三个新种子各做负后正、正后负两种顺序，共六条连续状态序列，每段500毫秒。两侧HS在全部有符号阶段都按预期切换，所以输入侧没有卡住。原始下行神经元读出却仍不一致：只有两条序列的两个刺激尾均值为相反非零符号，没有任何种子在两种顺序下都出现这个结果。我还能把每个原始转向值由实际记录的六个下降群贡献重建出来，误差仅约10⁻¹⁶，偏置位于平滑之前。因此下一次只降低HS输入幅度，保留核心、读出和序列，检查是不是驱动过强使方向差被持续状态覆盖。","en":"Three new seeds received both negative-then-positive and positive-then-negative stimulation, giving six sequences with continuous state and 500-millisecond phases. HS activity switched sides in every signed phase, so the input itself was not stuck on one side. The descending readout was less consistent: only two sequences had opposite nonzero tail signs, and no seed did so in both orders. I reconstructed raw turning output from the six descending-population terms to roughly 10⁻¹⁶ error, locating the bias before decoder smoothing. I next reduced only the HS input magnitude to test whether weaker drive would reduce persistence while preserving direction sensitivity.","title_zh":"内部状态保留时，反向刺激能否反向读出","id":"step-016","summary_en":"The input switched sides correctly, but the readout did not reliably reverse. I tested weaker input to reduce the persistent bias.","summary_zh":"输入能正常换侧，读出却没有可靠反向。我接着减弱输入，检查能否降低持续偏置。"},{"title_en":"Weaker input reduced lingering activity without solving steering","zh":"输入从±300降到±150度每秒，其他设置和六种种子顺序保持不变。上游公式使规定的HS发生率从100降到约66.7赫兹，而不是简单减半。匹配检查确认前1000毫秒的初始记录一致。新结果中，六条有五条在撤除末段的十个窗里原始转向完全为零，参考组只有两条。但两个刺激尾部有相反非零符号的序列反而从两条变成一条，仍有一个顺序保留明显负偏置。因此减弱输入改善了安静程度，没有建立可用双向控制。原建议是先审计另一实现；随后我决定先把当前核心接到车上，进入探索性耦合。","en":"I reduced the cue from ±300 to ±150 source degrees per second, keeping seeds, stimulus orders, core and decoder unchanged. The upstream nonlinear formula reduced the specified HS generator rate from 100 to about 66.7 hertz. Matched records were identical over the first 1,000 milliseconds. Five of six new trials had zero raw turning output in all ten final withdrawal windows, compared with two reference trials. However, sequences with opposite nonzero stimulus-tail signs decreased from two to one, and one order kept a strong negative bias. Weaker input quieted the tail without establishing dependable bidirectional control. Although the recorded recommendation was to inspect another implementation, I chose next to connect the current core to a car and observe the loop.","title_zh":"减弱驱动能否减少持续偏置又保留左右差异","id":"step-017","summary_en":"Weaker input made withdrawal quieter but did not establish dependable left–right control. I then connected the current core to the car for observation.","summary_zh":"减弱输入让撤除阶段更安静，却没有建立可靠双向控制。我接着把现有核心接到车辆上观察。"},{"title_en":"The first closed driving loop turned away from its target","zh":"第一次耦合把真实车辆反馈送入神经模型，再把模型输出发回同一辆车。此时相机只负责记录。输入是目标车头方向减去当前方向，再乘15并限制到±150；它被送进上游代表自转的HS入口。解码后的神经转向乘0.15控制轮角，油门固定0.1。每帧保留输入遥测、神经窗口、实际命令和后来收到的车辆遥测。109帧中有10帧制动预热和99帧运动控制。但95次输入正好顶在+150，主要在测几乎恒定的饱和线索。实际转向为负，车头误差从约10度增到14.43度，最后因碰撞停止记录。最终制动发出了，却没有后续遥测确认静止。完整链条已执行，方向语义、饱和和异步时钟则成为下一步具体问题。","en":"The first coupled run fed vehicle information into the model and returned its output to the same car. Camera images were saved but did not control the model. Input was target heading minus measured heading, multiplied by 15 and clipped to ±150, supplied through the HS field originally intended for perceived self-rotation. Neural turning output, scaled by 0.15, controlled steering; throttle was fixed at 0.1. Each complete frame linked incoming vehicle data, a neural window, the command and later vehicle data. The run saved 109 frames: ten braked warmup frames and 99 moving frames. Of the moving inputs, 95 saturated at +150. Steering was negative, heading error grew from about 10 to 14.43 degrees, and a collision ended the run. Braking was requested, but no later packet confirmed a stop. The connection worked; its input meaning and timing needed diagnosis.","title_zh":"把测得车头误差接到模型，再把输出接回车","id":"step-018","summary_en":"The first model–car loop sent and recorded real actions, but steering increased the heading error and the run ended in collision.","summary_zh":"第一次车脑闭环确实发送并记录了动作，但转向使朝向误差增大，最后发生碰撞。"},{"title_en":"A restarted driving loop saved no complete frames","zh":"重开耦合时，一次运行在等待新鲜车辆遥测处停止。记录包含“No fresh vehicle telemetry before 截止时间”，完整帧数为零，最后制动请求有记录。仅凭清单不能进一步指定网络或模拟器调度根因。这次失败保留为工程停止点，不能拿前后其他运行的画面填成它的数据。随后修正入口版本，另开一个短5秒运行检查记录链是否恢复。","en":"A restarted coupled run stopped while waiting for fresh vehicle data. Its manifest reported “No fresh vehicle telemetry before deadline”, zero complete frames and a final brake request. The available record did not identify whether network or simulator scheduling caused the timeout. I kept this attempt separate and used a new entry-point revision for a five-second follow-up, to check whether complete recording could resume.","title_zh":"耦合重开时没有新鲜车辆遥测","id":"step-019","summary_en":"The restarted driving loop received no fresh vehicle data and saved no complete decision. The cause was unknown, so I kept it as a separate failed attempt.","summary_zh":"重启后的驾驶循环等不到新车辆数据，没有保存完整决策。原因未查明，这次失败单独记录。"},{"title_en":"A five-second follow-up restored complete recording","zh":"短运行使用新的入口版本，继续原来固定油门、目标车头线索和神经转向映射。它实际得到44个完整帧和143条遥测，场景请求与就绪都已发生，状态为探索性运行完成。这只验证短时接口又能形成记录，没有为这次运行另算驾驶性能表，也不借用首次运行的误差数值。之后同一方案被带到第二台Windows主机，检查实际可见行为。","en":"The follow-up used the revised entry point with the same fixed throttle, target-heading cue and neural steering mapping. It produced 44 complete frames and 143 vehicle-data packets. Scene selection and readiness completed, and the manifest marked the short exploratory run complete. This established that the recording chain worked again; it supplied no separate driving-performance result. I then checked the same approach on another Windows computer.","title_zh":"用短运行检查耦合记录是否恢复","id":"step-020","summary_en":"A short follow-up restored complete camera–model–action recording. I then checked the same connection on another computer.","summary_zh":"短时补验重新保存了完整的相机、模型和动作记录。随后我在另一台计算机上检查同一接口。"},{"title_en":"A second computer also showed weak steering and increasing error","zh":"第二主机这一轮仍使用目标车头线索，不使用相机控制。83个完整帧中，73个属于运动阶段；另有一个末尾命令没来得及形成完整帧。模型只有7个运动窗给出非零原始转向，都是−0.4；但平滑把负命令延续到72个窗。目标误差从9.992增到14.464度，最后碰撞。模型50毫秒窗的名义神经时间和车辆实际实际耗时也不同步：4.15秒神经过程对应约16.84秒记录时间。这里可以看见神经输出确实被发给车辆，同时也看见其幅度弱、方向不利和时钟差异。后来只取回76张图像，七张缺失应直接显示缺图。下一步转向真实相机输入与全部运动通道观察。","en":"On the second Windows computer, the controller still used the target-heading cue rather than camera input. It saved 83 complete frames, including 73 moving frames, and one final command without a complete following frame. Only seven moving neural windows produced nonzero raw turning output, all at −0.4. Smoothing carried negative steering into 72 windows. Heading error rose from 9.992 to 14.464 degrees before a collision. Neural time and elapsed real time also differed: 4.15 seconds of neural evolution corresponded to about 16.84 seconds on the wall-time record. Only 76 of the 83 images were retrieved. The next version used live camera images and measured the full motor readout to investigate the weak, unfavourably directed response and timing mismatch.","title_zh":"另一台计算机也出现弱转向和碰撞","id":"step-021","summary_en":"The second computer showed the same weak, unfavourably directed steering and a timing mismatch. The next version used live camera input.","summary_zh":"另一台计算机也出现弱而方向不利的转向，并暴露时钟不一致。下一版开始使用实时相机输入。"},{"title_en":"Live camera images activated the network, but the car did not move","zh":"真实相机输入第一次接入时，我把160×120的RGB图像转换成连续亮度，再按模型眼柱方向做投影采样。这一视野覆盖335个方向，占模型1769列的18.94%。未看见的方向保持原编码器历史，不被伪造成黑色。动作改为由神经的转向、前进、后退和停止通道决定，不再强加固定前进。83个50毫秒窗口中，网络产生1,112,088个全网脉冲，但21个原始与解码运动通道全零。预热后的73帧动作全零，位置也不变。这个结果不是相机没接上：每窗都有实际亮度。它说明当前配置的被选运动读出没有形成驱动车辆的信号。下一步加中间视觉群测量，看看活动在哪些层存在。","en":"Live camera images entered the model for the first time in this run. I converted each 160×120 RGB image to continuous brightness values and sampled them along the model's eye-column directions. The view covered 335 of 1,769 columns, or 18.94%. Directions outside the view kept the encoder's history rather than receiving invented black pixels. Neural turning, forward, backward and stopping channels supplied the vehicle commands, with no imposed forward throttle. Across 83 windows of 50 milliseconds, the network produced 1,112,088 spikes. All 21 raw and decoded motor channels nevertheless stayed at zero, as did all 73 post-warmup command frames; the car remained stationary. Since every window contained camera samples, I next added intermediate visual-population measurements to locate where activity ceased to reach the motor output.","title_zh":"第一次让真实画面进模型，但车没有动作","id":"step-022","summary_en":"Live images activated the model, but every motor channel stayed zero and the car did not move. I added measurements between visual input and output.","summary_zh":"实时图像使网络产生活动，但所有运动通道仍为零，车辆没有移动。我在视觉入口与输出之间增加测量。"},{"title_en":"Intermediate measurements located activity before the silent motor output","zh":"第二次相机观察主要增加测量，没有训练或调增益。84个窗里，全网仍有1,125,568个脉冲，但21个运动通道和74个预热后命令仍为零。新记录让我看得更具体：感光与L1、L2、L3群有活动；Mi1的2225个脉冲和T4的521个脉冲只出现在最初一两个窗，T5与选定LC/LPLC群为零。L3还呈左静右动的不对称。大量感光脉冲来自与未采样历史列关联的成员，所以不能把全网总数都算成这张相机造成的反应。单纯再等实际耗时不会教会固定模型开车。下一阶段因此使用明确的感觉条件、足够的神经时间和对照组，系统测响应与撤除。","en":"I added measurements to the live-camera loop without training the network or increasing its gain. Across 84 windows, the network produced 1,125,568 spikes, but all 21 motor channels and 74 post-warmup commands stayed at zero. Photoreceptors and L1, L2 and L3 were active. The 2,225 Mi1 spikes and 521 T4 spikes appeared only in the first one or two windows; T5 and the selected LC/LPLC groups stayed silent. L3 activity differed between sides. Many photoreceptor spikes came from columns outside the sampled view that still held encoder history, so the total spike count was not entirely a camera response. I moved to controlled sensory tests with explicit neural durations and matched controls.","title_zh":"加入中间测量后，活动在哪里停止","id":"step-023","summary_en":"Early visual activity was present, while selected later visual and motor outputs remained silent. I moved to controlled sensory tests.","summary_zh":"早期视觉细胞已有活动，选中的后续视觉和运动输出仍沉默。我转向条件明确的感觉测试。"},{"title_en":"The long sensory tests stopped with resource failures","zh":"相机观察没有运动输出后，我扩大到已有感觉入口的系统筛查。原计划31种条件、三个种子，共93次；每次用新Java进程，内部连续跑30秒基线、60秒刺激和90秒恢复，时间都是神经时间。这个长设计是为了看慢响应、方向差和撤除后的持续状态。实际只完成42次，49次记录失败，一条旧状态仍写运行中，另一条未开始。主机重启后已经没有实验进程；旧运行条目也有明确内存错误。49次失败中31次能确认Windows提交内存不足，另18次的有限日志不支持统一归因。完成结果保留，失败和未完成不当作零响应。后来新增资源错误停止队列的保护，而不是重启整个93次计划。","en":"I planned a longer sensory screen: 31 conditions with three seeds each, or 93 trials. Each fresh Java process used 30 seconds of baseline, 60 seconds of stimulation and 90 seconds of recovery in neural time. The longer phases were intended to expose slow responses and persistent activity. Only 42 trials completed. Forty-nine were marked failed, one stale entry remained labelled running and one never started. After the computer rebooted, no experiment process remained. Thirty-one of the 49 failures explicitly reported Windows memory-commit errors; the retained excerpts did not explain the other 18. I kept incomplete outcomes separate from completed responses, added a stop on resource errors and did not restart the entire matrix.","title_zh":"延长神经时间并系统检查可用感觉入口","id":"step-024","summary_en":"The long sensory screen partly completed and then suffered resource failures. I kept unfinished trials separate from zero responses.","summary_zh":"长时感觉筛查只完成一部分，并出现资源故障。我把未完成试验与真正的零反应分开记录。"},{"title_en":"Separate CPU runs completed the priority sensory tests","zh":"为了更快覆盖优先条件，我在内存更充足的远程计算机上启动四个独立CPU队列。每个试验仍只有一个神经积分线程，GPU虽在机器里，却没有用于这套Java计算。12种条件各三个原种子，共36次，保持30/60/90秒阶段。它们全部完成，没有记录失败。倾斜标量刺激时，brake读出的均值约0.201到0.203，撤除后降到约0.006，但腿和翼读出在90秒恢复末端仍有活动。这里的倾斜是双侧共享标量，不是带符号的姿态角。结果提供了具体输入和输出关联，也暴露长尾状态。下一步缩小到膨胀刺激强度、倾斜幅度和接地，做更有针对性的比较。","en":"I moved priority conditions to a workstation with more available memory and ran four independent CPU queues. Each Java trial still used one integration thread; this backend did not use the installed GPUs. Twelve conditions with the same three technical seeds produced 36 trials, retaining the 30/60/90-second phases. All completed without recorded failures. During the tilt-scalar stimulus, mean brake readout was about 0.201–0.203, falling to roughly 0.006 in recovery. Leg and wing outputs could remain active at the end of the 90-second recovery. The tilt input was a shared bilateral scalar, not a signed posture angle. These results guided a narrower screen of contrast, tilt amplitude and ground contact.","title_zh":"用更充足内存并行测量优先感觉条件","id":"step-025","summary_en":"Parallel CPU queues completed the priority long trials. Their persistent and uneven responses guided a smaller, more targeted screen.","summary_zh":"并行CPU队列完成了优先长时试验。持续和不均衡的反应促使我进一步缩小测试问题。"},{"title_en":"A small CPU test batch was only partly completed","zh":"当时我在笔记本电脑上另做六个无车辆、无训练的CPU感觉试验：恒亮对照及左右小对象，各两个新种子，两队列运行。三次完整有效，两次流分别停在118.4和124.4秒神经时间，另一次没有开始。稍后的进程检查已没有Java或筛查程序，但两个中断记录的错误文件都为空，原因未确定。我没有把它们算成无反应，也没有仅凭机器内存猜成同一种资源错误。它和其他主机种子、负载不同，不能据此给CPU排速度名次。随后终止这个不完整批次，后续集中到远程计算机的定点短比较。","en":"I also ran six sensory trials on my laptop CPU, without a vehicle or learning: a constant-vision control and small objects on the left and right, each with two new seeds. Three trials completed validly. Two streams stopped at 118.4 and 124.4 neural seconds, and one trial never started. A later process check found no Java or screening process, while the interrupted trials' error files were empty. Their cause remained unknown, so I did not count them as zero responses or assign the memory-error explanation from another batch. The seeds and workloads also differed between computers. I ended this incomplete batch and used the remote workstation for the next focused comparison.","title_zh":"笔记本CPU上的小批次只完成一部分","id":"step-026","summary_en":"The laptop batch completed only half its trials; the interruptions had no established cause. I continued the focused comparison on the workstation.","summary_zh":"笔记本批次只完成一半，另几次中断原因未查明。我在工作站继续定点比较。"},{"title_en":"Short targeted tests exposed asymmetric and saturated outputs","zh":"长筛查已有响应后，我不再把所有感觉模态重做一遍，而是挑出三个具体问题。膨胀刺激左右在弱刺激时是否对称？强刺激为何到平台？倾斜幅度与制动是否单调？新设计12种条件、三个新种子，每次10秒基线、10秒刺激、20秒恢复，36次在约25分钟内全部完成。弱膨胀刺激明显左右不对称，高对比的flightYaw到平台，倾斜的brake变化并不单调，恢复还有种子差。继续只读原流发现，平台可以定位到单个DNp03神经元的50赫兹归一化上限；底层rate仍在变化。因此下一步补低强度和更长恢复，并保留原读出与共同300赫兹尺度的离线候选。","en":"The long screen had identified responsive inputs, so I narrowed the next test to left–right differences at weak looming contrast, saturation at strong stimulation and the nonmonotonic tilt–brake relationship. Twelve conditions with three new seeds used 10 seconds of baseline, 10 seconds of stimulation and 20 seconds of recovery. All 36 trials completed in about 25 minutes. Weak looming responses differed markedly between sides; strong flight-yaw output plateaued; and tilt-dependent braking varied with amplitude and seed, sometimes persisting into recovery. Later inspection traced the yaw plateau to the decoder's 50-hertz normalization of one DNp03 neuron, while its underlying rates still varied. I next added lower contrasts and longer recovery, keeping both the original readout and a common-scale offline comparison.","title_zh":"比较目标对比度、倾斜幅度和接地输入","id":"step-027","summary_en":"The short screen exposed left–right differences, a decoder plateau and nonmonotonic braking. I added lower contrasts and longer recovery.","summary_zh":"短时筛查发现左右差异、读出平台和不单调的制动反应。我接着降低对比度并延长恢复时间。"},{"title_en":"Lower contrast and longer recovery separated lingering responses","zh":"这一轮只补前一轮留下的缺口。左右膨胀刺激增加0.05和0.20对比度，保留部分原条件与倾斜组，把恢复从20延到60秒，共13条件、三种子，39次全部完成。重复的27条记录在共同前40秒逐项一致，说明这次延长有真实可比前缀。不同输出不能混在一起说：某些制动、翼或转向通道到60秒末仍有活动，而共同尺度DNp03候选在18个有响应的膨胀刺激试验中，13个撤除后完全为零，另外五个只在头50毫秒非零。这不是把整个模型宣布恢复，而是分开识别了读出长尾。随后重点转到短事件、换侧和重复事件的时序。","en":"I added looming contrasts of 0.05 and 0.20 on both sides, retained selected earlier and tilt conditions, and extended recovery from 20 to 60 seconds. All 39 trials completed. The 27 repeated recordings matched over their common first 40 seconds. Some brake, wing or yaw outputs remained active at the 60-second endpoint. The common-scale DNp03 readout behaved differently: among 18 looming trials with an active response, 13 stayed at zero throughout recovery and five had only one nonzero 50-millisecond window immediately after withdrawal. Thus persistence depended on the output being measured. I next tested whether the responsive turning path could follow brief pulses, repeated events and reversals.","title_zh":"低强度到饱和之间怎样过渡，60秒后是否恢复","id":"step-028","summary_en":"Longer recovery showed that some outputs persisted while the selected turning readout often released quickly. I next tested brief and reversed events.","summary_zh":"延长恢复后，部分输出仍持续，选中的转向读出却通常很快归零。我接着测试短脉冲与反向事件。"},{"title_en":"The flight-yaw calculation followed short and reversed pulses","zh":"十秒恒刺激不能说明模型能跟随短事件。因此这一轮使用九种事件安排和三个新种子：单个1秒或250毫秒脉冲、同侧两次，以及左右反转，每次从新网络开始，事件之间保留状态。27次全部完成，共36个脉冲。原始flightYaw与共同尺度DNp03候选在每个被记录的脉冲窗都给出规定侧别的符号，首个连续三个正确符号窗落在0到150毫秒。撤除后的连续三个零窗，26次立即出现，10次延50毫秒，观察间隙没有后续反弹。不过brake和wing仍可能在末端持续。这里证明的是解析特征入口到特定读出的时序能力。下一步要查真实图像亮度能不能进入同样有效的路径。","en":"I tested nine schedules with three new seeds: one-second or 250-millisecond pulses, repeated same-side pulses and left–right reversals. Each of the 27 trials started a fresh network, with state continuing through its events and gaps. Across 36 pulses, raw flight yaw and the common-scale DNp03 readout had the expected sign in every saved pulse window. The first block of three correctly signed windows began within 0–150 neural milliseconds. A block of three zero windows began immediately after 26 events and after 50 milliseconds in the other ten, with no later rebound during the observed gaps. Brake and wing outputs could still persist. I next asked whether retinal brightness images could reach a similarly useful turning response.","title_zh":"短事件和反向事件能否被逐次追随","id":"step-029","summary_en":"The analytic turning pathway followed brief and reversed pulses. The next question was whether retinal brightness could reach a similarly useful response.","summary_zh":"直接提供线索的转向通路能跟随短脉冲和反向事件。接下来检查图像亮度能否带来同样可用的反应。"},{"title_en":"An empty protocol message stopped camera capture","zh":"为了核对视野，我先抓不同相机方向的真实图像。第一回模拟器已在场景内，探针收到一个精确的空JSON对象后停止，3.26秒内没有发送相机配置，也没有接受图像。修复只把这种精确空对象作为保留字节的未知空操作，其余缺消息类型的对象仍报错。这个窄改动经过离线检查后，另开一次拍摄，不把失败轮当成已经验证视角。","en":"Before choosing a wider visual field, I attempted to capture views from the live simulator. The first attempt reached an already loaded scene but stopped on an empty JSON object. During its 3.26 seconds, it sent no camera configuration and accepted no image. I changed the reader to ignore exact empty objects while still rejecting other messages without the required type. After offline checks, I started a separate capture attempt. The first failure itself yielded no camera-geometry evidence.","title_zh":"相机视角抓取先被空协议对象挡住","id":"step-030","summary_en":"An empty message stopped image capture before camera setup. I allowed that empty message to pass without treating other malformed messages as valid.","summary_zh":"一条空消息使程序在相机配置前停止。我让这种空消息直接略过，同时继续拒绝其他格式错误。"},{"title_en":"Wider, side and rear camera views were saved","zh":"第二次拍摄完成八组请求，每组三张160×120图像：前方60、100、120度视野，左右侧、后方A、后方B，以及回到前方。车辆位置只有极小漂移，图像却随配置明显改变；后方A和B相同，不能由此编造立体深度。最后旧前视帧与首张回前方帧逐字节一致，也有更早前帧的细小差异。后视下部可见车体遮挡。它说明协议确实送来不同视图，但没有独立标定准确角度或投影。后续只使用已知前视的真实帧和明确投影假设，做图像与均值亮度控制，不把多视角拼成一次不存在的全景输入。","en":"The next capture completed eight configurations, with three 160×120 images each: front views at vertical fields of view of 60, 100 and 120 degrees; both sides; rear cameras A and B; and a return to the front. The car barely moved, while the images changed substantially with camera configuration. Rear A and B matched. The last initial front image and first return image were byte-identical, although earlier front frames differed slightly. Part of the car occluded the rear view. I now had evidence that different camera settings delivered different views, but no independent angular calibration. The next comparison used verified front images and explicit projection assumptions rather than a stitched panoramic input.","title_zh":"记录前、侧、后视角与更宽视野","id":"step-031","summary_en":"The simulator delivered front, side and rear images. I used these saved views to plan input coverage without inventing a panoramic camera.","summary_zh":"模拟器确实送来了前方、侧方和后方画面。我据此检查视觉覆盖，没有把这些画面拼成一次并不存在的全景输入。"},{"title_en":"Image brightness and calculated visual features produced different responses","zh":"现在把两种输入层真正分开比较。99次试验包含完整、当前335列和宽817列覆盖下的扩张、静态、收缩亮度图案，以及解析特征和匹配静态对照。每个事件实际持续两秒，之后观察22秒。60次扩张和9次静态事件的21个原始运动通道都为零。收缩只给出少量起飞读出。扩张撤除后，19次出现稀疏运动通道瞬态；全部图像亮度试验的flightYaw仍为零。相反，12次解析特征试验都在事件内产生运动输出。扩大视野没有自动解决转向，输入层级差异也不能略过。下一步读取已有早期视觉时间窗，区分刺激出现与亮度恢复，再进行真实相机对照。","en":"I directly compared retinal-brightness stimulation with analytic feature inputs in 99 trials. The brightness conditions included expanding, static and contracting patterns under full coverage, the current 335-column mask and the wider 817-column mask. Matched quiet controls and analytic-feature conditions were included. Each event lasted two seconds, followed by 22 seconds of observation. All 60 expansion and nine static events produced zero output on all 21 original raw motor channels. Contraction produced only sparse takeoff output; 19 trials showed brief motor-channel events after expansion ended. Retinal flight yaw stayed at zero throughout. In contrast, all 12 analytic-feature trials produced motor output during the event. Wider retinal coverage alone had not solved turning. I next examined response timing before comparing real images with mean-brightness controls.","title_zh":"图像亮度与直接提供的视觉特征反应不同","id":"step-032","summary_en":"Retinal brightness and analytic features gave very different motor responses. Wider brightness coverage alone did not solve turning.","summary_zh":"图像亮度与直接提供的特征产生了明显不同的运动反应。单独扩大亮度覆盖仍未解决转向。"},{"title_en":"Restoring brightness showed why whole-event averages could mislead","zh":"这一步不再运行模型，只读前面36条已选记录的更细时间窗。原先四秒刺激阶段里，前两秒是图案，后两秒已经恢复亮度，直接平均会混淆两种事件。按实际起始与恢复重新对齐后，扩张时L1和感光群已变化，但Mi1和T4主要在亮度恢复后短暂出现。例如中央扩张恢复后的头250毫秒，三个种子的Mi1脉冲约2147到2215，T4约527到570。T5在导出的全部时间窗仍为零。这个时序与现有工程化ON输入相容，却还没有证明一条完整生物串行通路。接下来才用真实held相机图与同均值亮度比较。","en":"I reanalysed existing records without rerunning the model. The earlier four-second stimulus phase contained a two-second image event followed by two seconds of restored brightness, so its average mixed two different conditions. I aligned 36 selected recordings to stimulus onset and brightness restoration. Photoreceptor and L1 activity changed during expansion, but much of the Mi1 and T4 response appeared just after brightness returned. For central expansion, the first 250 milliseconds after restoration contained about 2,147–2,215 Mi1 spikes and 527–570 T4 spikes across seeds. T5 remained silent in the exported bins. This clarified which part of the stimulus sequence caused the measured response and supported the planned comparison of real images with uniform fields of the same mean brightness.","title_zh":"把视觉起始和恢复亮度分开，避免把撤除反应说成事件反应","id":"step-033","summary_en":"Averaging over the whole stimulus phase had mixed stimulation with brightness restoration. Aligning the saved records showed when the visual responses occurred.","summary_zh":"原来的整段平均值混合了刺激和恢复亮度两个阶段。我重新对齐保存记录，才看清视觉反应发生在何时。"},{"title_en":"A camera image changed neural activity beyond its mean brightness","zh":"真实相机比较选择两个前视覆盖，每个分别给中性亮度、固定真实图像和该图像采样列的平均亮度，共六条件、三个新种子。没有车辆，也没有自转或对象特征。18次都完成，108个记录文件的哈希和重新生成摘要得到检查。真实图像与同均值均匀输入产生不同的视觉活动，而原始运动输出主要是出现或撤除时的稀疏瞬态。它确认图像分布携带的变化进入了被测视觉记录，但原运动接口仍没有稳定转向。于是主方向从等待原生动作反射，转为保留固定核心、学习一个明确的外部动作读出；在拟合之前先检查车辆时间、动作和重置。","en":"For each of two front-view coverage masks, I presented neutral brightness, a held real camera image, or a uniform field matching that image's sampled mean. Six conditions with three new seeds gave 18 trials. No vehicle, self-rotation cue or analytic object feature was involved. All trials completed, and I checked 108 record hashes and regenerated summaries. Held images produced visual activity different from the matched uniform fields. The original motor output remained sparse, mostly around presentation or removal. Image structure therefore reached the measured visual populations, but the original motor interface still did not provide sustained useful turning. I moved toward a learned external action readout, first checking vehicle actions, timing and resets.","title_zh":"一张真实图像与同均值均匀亮度有什么差别","id":"step-034","summary_en":"Real image structure changed visual activity beyond the effect of mean brightness, but useful sustained motor output was still missing.","summary_zh":"真实图像结构带来的视觉活动不同于平均亮度对照，但仍缺少持续可用的运动输出。"},{"title_en":"Acceleration and braking worked, but reset verification rejected a valid return","zh":"学习环境不能只接收图像，还要可靠开始下一局。第一组动作探针先完成正油门、滑行和制动：速度从约0.000394升到0.210886，中性后仍有0.173192，全制动后降到约3×10⁻⁷。但重置验收要求位置跳动至少0.5，实际返回只有0.30713，所以后面的反向油门和转向没执行。记录还显示返回后的姿态与前次重置位置相同。这里暴露的是过大的工程门槛。我保留失败，改成用同次运行实际观察到的参考起点、前后低速和新鲜遥测共同验证返回。","en":"The first action test completed acceleration, coasting and braking. Speed rose from about 0.000394 to 0.210886, remained at 0.173192 after neutral throttle and fell to roughly 3 × 10⁻⁷ after braking. The reset check then rejected a return of 0.30713 units because it required a displacement of at least 0.5 units. The reverse and steering groups never ran. Since the returned pose matched the earlier reset pose, I replaced the overly large jump requirement with a comparison against a measured same-run reference, using fresh low-speed vehicle data.","title_zh":"正油门、滑行、制动有效，但重置验收条件太大","id":"step-035","summary_en":"Acceleration and braking worked, but the reset test rejected a real return because it required too large a position jump. I revised that test.","summary_zh":"加速和刹车正常，重置检查却因要求的位置跳变过大，拒绝了一次真实返回。我随后修改检查方法。"},{"title_en":"Revised reset checks allowed action directions to be measured","zh":"修订后的起点规则不猜服务器是否收到重置，而是检查可见结果：车先离参考点至少0.05，重置后在新鲜低速遥测中回到0.01以内，朝向误差不超过1度。新运行完成三组动作和两次组间重置，总计约10.6秒。负油门−0.08产生沿初始车头反向的位移，中性后继续反向滑行；负转向使车头变化约−0.491度，轮角回零后方向不必恢复。动作和起点返回现已可测。下一步把两个动作轴连续变化，与真实相机和神经测量共同记录。","en":"The revised reset check required a measured displacement of at least 0.05 units, followed by a return within 0.01 units of the same-run reference, fresh low-speed data and at most one degree of yaw error. The new run completed all three action groups and both intervening resets in about 10.6 seconds. Negative throttle moved the car backwards, followed by further reverse coasting. Negative steering changed yaw by approximately −0.491 degrees; centring the wheels did not restore heading. With observable returns and action directions established, I could next test continuous steering and throttle together with camera and neural recording.","title_zh":"用实际参考起点核对重置，并测负油门与转向","id":"step-036","summary_en":"The revised reset test confirmed returns to the measured start and completed the action-sign checks. I could next test continuous actions.","summary_zh":"修改后的检查确认车辆回到实测起点，也完成了动作方向测试。下一步开始检查连续动作。"},{"title_en":"Continuous steering and throttle exposed a route-measurement error","zh":"这一轮让转向和油门按明确时间表连续变化，同时记录相机、固定核心输出和车辆遥测。神经输出只是旁路观察，不负责发命令；规定动作也不当老师标签。正先和负先两局分别完成74和72个状态转移，所有动作阶段走完，最后都观测到低速。完整接收间隔平均约209毫秒，也就是每秒4.8次决策，而神经窗仍代表50毫秒，二者异步。新的问题出在路线字段：CTE大幅变化、节点索引跳跃，与位置位移不在同一个直观尺度。如果直接拿这些字段奖励学习，可能把错误跳跃当进步。因此先审计模拟器的路线定义，再设计几何老师和奖励。","en":"I varied steering and forward throttle continuously while saving camera images, fixed-core output and vehicle data. A prescribed schedule drove the car; the neural model only observed it, and the schedule was not used as expert labels. Positive-first and negative-first episodes completed 74 and 72 transitions. All phases finished, with low final speeds. The full interval between received observations averaged about 209 milliseconds, or 4.8 decisions per second, while each neural window represented 50 milliseconds. Reported cross-track error (CTE) and route-node indices also jumped in ways that did not match the small position changes. I audited the simulator's geometry and measurement rules before using those fields for rewards or teacher targets.","title_zh":"相机、神经测量与两个动作轴能否持续同步记录","id":"step-037","summary_en":"Continuous actions exposed jumps in the reported route measurements. I checked how the simulator measured the route before using those values as rewards.","summary_zh":"连续动作测试暴露了路线读数的跳变。我先检查模拟器怎样测量路线，再决定能否把这些值用于奖励。"},{"title_en":"Export the route geometry before rewarding progress","zh":"源码审计解释了尺度差：车辆位置、速度已除以8，导出节点和CTE没有；CTE还使用前一个跟踪跨度的无限直线，节点索引可能已到下一段。随后在制动状态逐个读取259个实际路径节点，不重试请求，得到42.929个未标定单位的开放折线。用旧轨迹重算时，原CTE可以精确重建，但全局最近段会在很小位移时跳出约4或6个弧长单位。新的局部关联因此保留上一个有效弧位置，限制可达位移、时间和方向。相邻平缓连接的并列投影可明确处理，真正远段跳跃仍拒绝。这样定义的几何进度才能用来做老师和奖励，不能简单奖励节点增加。","en":"Source inspection explained the scale mismatch: vehicle position and speed were divided by eight, whereas path nodes and CTE were not. CTE used the previously tracked infinite line even when the packet already contained the next node index. While braking, I queried all 259 path nodes and obtained an open polyline 42.929 units long. Reanalysis reproduced CTE, but unrestricted nearest-segment matching could jump four or six units along the route after a tiny movement. I therefore matched near the previous valid route position, using elapsed time, reachable movement and heading to reject distant jumps. Explicit handling of adjacent gentle joins made this local route measurement usable for teacher targets and progress rewards.","title_zh":"先弄清路线坐标，再定义老师和奖励","id":"step-038","summary_en":"Position and route measurements used different scales, and the nearest route segment could jump. I built a local route match that followed the car's recent position.","summary_zh":"车辆位置和路线读数使用不同尺度，最近路段还会突然跳变。我改为结合车辆上一位置，在附近寻找连续匹配的路段。"},{"title_en":"A geometry-based teacher supplied recorded driving examples","zh":"有了实际路线，才能建立一个公开说明的老师。它查看车辆位置和路线，取前方0.6单位目标，按车头误差产生转向，再按弯曲程度和速度调整油门，必要时制动。相机被保存，但老师不用相机认路。这个有界试验实际运动25.04秒，101次老师决策都有唯一有效的局部路线关联，转向两个方向都用到。实际命令可由记录精确重建，制动后的末速度约6.58×10⁻⁷。这里建立的是数据生成器和工程参照。下一步先把同一轨迹的命令前图像按序送进固定神经核心，核对特征与标签时间，之后才扩大数据和拟合。","en":"I built a geometric teacher from the measured route. It used vehicle pose and route geometry, aimed 0.6 units ahead, converted heading error to steering and adjusted throttle for speed and turning demand. It could also brake. Images were saved but did not determine its actions. The short pilot moved for 25.04 seconds and saved 101 teacher decisions, each with a unique valid local route match. Both steering directions occurred, the commands could be reconstructed exactly, and braking reduced final speed to about 6.58 × 10⁻⁷. This supplied example actions and an engineering reference. I next replayed the images taken before those commands through the fixed neural core to check feature–label alignment.","title_zh":"用几何教师生成可核对的动作示例","id":"step-039","summary_en":"A controller using route geometry supplied steering examples and completed a short collection run. These actions came from the geometric teacher, before neural driving.","summary_zh":"我用读取路线几何的控制器采集转向示例，完成了短时采集。此时开车的是几何教师，还不是神经模型。"},{"title_en":"The first neural feature cache used images with compressed model time","zh":"先做小规模缓存检查，是为了避免大批拟合后才发现时间或标签泄漏。我只回放既有的104张命令前图像，固定核心每张推进50毫秒，老师动作另放标签文件。生成38项下降/运动测量或62项视觉加下降测量，并保留四窗历史。全部回放闭合，但这里5.2秒神经时间对应原轨迹约25秒运动，是明确的时间压缩试验。符合标签条件的窗口中，运动的32项rate都为零，只有三项膜电位变化；更广视觉集合有21项变化。因此下一轮选明确的密集50毫秒时间关系，采整段独立轨迹，不把这次压缩缓存直接包装成正式训练集。","en":"I first checked a small feature cache for timing and label leakage. I replayed 104 saved images, each taken before its command, through the fixed core for 50 neural milliseconds per image. Teacher actions were kept in a separate label file. Each window contained either 38 descending/motor measurements or 62 visual-plus-descending measurements, combined into four-window histories. All images and protocol-closing records were retained. However, 5.2 seconds of neural evolution represented roughly 25 seconds of vehicle movement, so this cache compressed time. At usable label windows, all 32 motor-rate terms were zero and only three membrane features varied; the broader set had 21 varying features. The next round aligned neural and recorded time explicitly and used complete independent trajectories.","title_zh":"按顺序回放教师驾驶图像，检查特征与标签","id":"step-040","summary_en":"The first feature cache matched images to teacher actions, but advanced neural time faster than recorded driving time. The next cache needed an explicit time match.","summary_zh":"首批特征缓存对齐了图像和教师动作，但神经时间比原驾驶时间压缩得多。下一轮需要明确两者的时间关系。"},{"title_en":"Steering prediction differed greatly between the two representations","zh":"正式离线读出轮采集12条完整老师轨迹，按整段分成8训练、2验证和2测试，避免把相邻帧随机分到两边。固定神经核心密集回放25,968个真实相机窗，只有外部线性读出学习转向和油门。总共5108个有效标签。两个独立测试轨迹上，恒定均值的转向误差为0.287869，下降/运动历史为0.288148，视觉加下降为0.235526，直接视网膜历史为0.012348。视觉神经表示比常数好，运动-only没有改善，直接相机采样强得多。这还是同一路线上的动作预测，车尚未由新读出驾驶。下一步优先查已记录的信息到底在哪些特征里变化，而不是立即再扫刺激或扩大训练。","en":"I collected 12 teacher trajectories and split them by whole trajectory: eight for training, two for validation and two for testing. The fixed core replayed 25,968 camera windows. Only a linear output model learned steering and throttle, using 5,108 eligible labels. On the two held-out trajectories, steering mean absolute error (MAE, the average size of the prediction error) was 0.287869 for a constant mean, 0.288148 for descending/motor history, 0.235526 for visual-plus-descending history and 0.012348 for direct retinal-brightness history. The broader neural features improved on a constant, while motor-only features did not; the direct image values were much more predictive. This tested action prediction on one route. I next inspected the representation before collecting more data.","title_zh":"神经特征能否预测教师的连续动作","id":"step-041","summary_en":"A learned external readout predicted teacher actions better with broader neural features, but direct image values were far more accurate. Driving still needed testing.","summary_zh":"使用更广泛神经特征的外部读出更能预测教师动作，但直接图像值准确得多。预测结果仍需用驾驶检验。"},{"title_en":"Find which measured neural channels varied","zh":"信息审计只读取原训练与验证记录，没有新神经运行，也不打开测试轨迹。21,633个密集窗和4258个候选动作历史显示，运动集合的128项赫兹历史列全部为零，原来留下的五项其实是DNa02膜电位。另一方面T4有大量脉冲，只是当时的空间注释无法把这些成员分配到眼柱。未关联不等于没活动。视网膜线性读出的较强贡献集中在前下方向，但这也只是固定权重模型的项分解，不是因果重要性。这些具体结果决定下一步：保留原有62个测量，追加固定方位分区，不删掉那些有活动却没有空间注释的群。","en":"I examined only existing training and validation files, leaving the test trajectories closed and running no neural simulation. Across 21,633 windows and 4,258 action histories, all 128 motor-rate history columns were zero. The five retained motor features were actually histories of DNa02 membrane voltage. T4 had substantial spikes, but the available annotations could not assign its cells to retinal sectors; missing spatial assignments did not mean inactivity. In the direct-image model, stronger fitted terms clustered in front and lower directions, although that decomposition did not measure causal importance. I decided to keep the original 62 measurements and append fixed spatial sectors rather than discard active populations without location labels.","title_zh":"到底哪些特征有变化，空间信息在哪里丢失","id":"step-042","summary_en":"Most motor-rate features stayed zero, while some visual signals varied but lacked spatial labels. I added measurements instead of treating missing labels as silence.","summary_zh":"多数运动放电率特征始终为零；部分视觉信号有变化，只是缺少位置注释。我增加测量，没有把位置缺失当成神经元沉默。"},{"title_en":"Spatial neural features improved prediction on validation data","zh":"追加空间测量后，每窗由62项变成190项，四窗历史共760槽位。每次回放都核对原输入和旧观测逐窗不变，十条训练与验证轨迹全部通过。这样可以把新增信息与意外改动核心分开。三个固定ridge候选只在原验证轨迹上选参数，旧测试不再打开。新增读出转向误差为0.180148，比原聚合神经表示0.233993低约23%，但直接视网膜比较仍为0.013581。760个名义槽位里还有404项不可用，因此维度也不能当活跃神经元数。结果支持扩展测量接口，仍需要真实闭环驾驶。接下来先完成奖励、时间和重置验收，进入固定核心的外部强化学习。","en":"I expanded each window from 62 to 190 measurements, giving 760 feature slots over four windows. All ten training and validation replays reproduced the original inputs and measurements after the specified timing exclusions. I selected among three ridge-regression fits, which are linear fits with a penalty on large coefficients, using validation data only. The old test set remained closed. With spatial neural features, steering MAE reached 0.180148, about 23% below 0.233993 for the aggregate neural representation. Direct image values still performed better, at 0.013581. Of the 760 slots, 404 were unavailable. The next task was a real learning environment with checked reward, timing, resets and driving evaluation.","title_zh":"增加按方向分区的神经读出能否减少预测误差","id":"step-043","summary_en":"Spatial neural measurements improved validation prediction without changing the underlying core. Direct image inputs remained the stronger comparator.","summary_zh":"增加空间神经测量改善了验证预测，底层核心未改。直接图像输入仍是更强的对照。"},{"title_en":"The first reinforcement-learning check failed on a scene already loaded","zh":"开始外部强化学习前，先用短运行验收实际采样、重置、运动和优化器。神经特征条件已经通过这些检查，也完成16次不计入正式训练的更新，但第二个新客户端连接同一个已加载模拟器时，没有获得可接受的相机帧。正式主训练还没开始。我把问题限定为生命周期依赖，改成每个验收臂和评估案例拥有独立模拟器，再验证整个入口。","en":"Before the main reinforcement-learning run, I used short tests to check sampling, motion, reset and parameter updates. The neural-input test passed and performed 16 diagnostic updates, excluded from main training. The next client then connected to the same already loaded simulator but received no usable camera frames. Main training never started. I treated this as a simulator-lifecycle failure and gave each subsequent acceptance test and evaluation case its own simulator process before testing the complete startup path again.","title_zh":"首项学习检查通过，第二次连接却收不到画面","id":"step-044","summary_en":"The first learning check passed, but a second client could not collect images from the already loaded scene. I gave each test its own simulator process.","summary_zh":"第一个学习检查通过后，第二个客户端无法从已加载场景采图。我让每个测试分别启动模拟器进程。"},{"title_en":"Building the policy left its first camera observation stale","zh":"独立模拟器修正后，两种输入的验收都通过，但正式训练的第一步又被严格时钟拒绝。原因是策略构建用了3.49秒，缓存观测跨过了这个阶段，来源序号从10跳到24。我没有放宽有效动作时钟，而是把发现输入形状的客户端在构建前关闭，模型建好后再进行新学习重置。这使初始化耗时不会被伪装成一条正常训练状态转移。","en":"With separate simulator processes, both input conditions passed their short startup checks. The first main-training step nevertheless failed the timing check. Building the policy took 3.49 seconds, leaving an old observation whose source sequence jumped from 10 to 24. I kept the action-clock limits and changed the order of initialization: close the preliminary observation used to discover input dimensions, construct the policy, then reset the learning environment for a fresh observation. That kept model-construction time out of the first training transition.","title_zh":"构建策略花费的时间使缓存相机过期","id":"step-045","summary_en":"Constructing the policy took long enough to make the first image stale. I reset the environment after construction and kept the timing limits unchanged.","summary_zh":"构建策略花费的时间使首张图像过期。我改为在构建完成后重置环境，保留原来的时钟限制。"},{"title_en":"SAC training saved a checkpoint before a naming error stopped it","zh":"修复初始化后，第一次真实采样确实推进到1002步，1000步检查点保存了487次优化器更新。检查点在这里是一份可回到的训练快照，包含策略参数等状态，而不是一张表现截图。失败出现在第一个回合结束：我的整数回合编号与SB3保留的回合统计字典撞名。旧批次和权重保留，没有续写成成功。修复把审计编号改名，并让短验收真正走过Monitor、向量重置和日志记账，再启动新的正式批次。","en":"After that repair, soft actor-critic (SAC) learning reached 1,002 vehicle interactions. SAC reuses past driving experience to update an action policy and estimates of future reward. The saved 1,000-step checkpoint contained 487 optimizer updates. The run then failed at the first episode ending because my integer episode identifier used the same field name as the learning library SB3's episode-statistics dictionary. I kept the failed run and its weights, renamed the audit field, and expanded acceptance testing to exercise the library's episode monitor, automatic reset and logging before starting a fresh batch.","title_zh":"实际学习开始后，回合日志字段冲突使程序停止","id":"step-046","summary_en":"Real SAC learning reached a saved checkpoint, then an episode-field naming conflict stopped the run. I repaired logging before starting a fresh batch.","summary_zh":"SAC已完成实际学习并保存检查点，随后回合字段重名使程序停止。我修复日志后另开新批次。"},{"title_en":"Neural-feature SAC completed 20,000 steps; its comparison remained partial","zh":"新的修正批次终于让固定核心神经特征条件完成20,000次交互和19,488次SAC更新。后面的直接视网膜臂只到1000次交互、488次更新，下一步因密集相机时钟错误停止；其余种子和计划评估没有执行。神经特征条件25个学习回合中，23个触发工程离允许的路线范围，一个到时间限制，最后一个在样本预算结束时未完。训练早晚的前进量增加了，但末1000步仍有五次包络终止，不能把更快离开路线称为车道保持改善。这是实际训练成果加一项不完整比较。后续要用固定权重独立评估，并解决时钟，而不是把20,000对1000直接排成绩。","en":"The corrected neural-input SAC run completed 20,000 interactions and 19,488 updates while the neural core stayed fixed. The direct-image condition then stopped after 1,000 interactions and 488 updates when an action interval failed the dense-camera timing check. The remaining seeds and planned evaluations never ran. In the neural condition, 23 of 25 observed episodes ended at the route-distance stopping limit, one reached a time limit and the final episode was incomplete when collection ended. Later training made more forward progress, but the last 1,000 steps still included five route-distance terminations. I therefore needed independent driving tests and a timing diagnosis before comparing the conditions, whose completed training amounts were very different.","title_zh":"神经特征条件完成两万步，直接图像条件提前停止","id":"step-047","summary_en":"The neural learner completed its budget, but the direct-image comparison stopped early on timing. Unequal completed runs could not give a matched ranking.","summary_zh":"神经学习条件完成预算，直接图像条件却因时钟问题提前停止。两者完成量不同，需要分开解释。"},{"title_en":"Roihu starts with a CPU portability check","zh":"迁移到Roihu先不启动驾驶和学习，而是单独检验原Java核心在Linux上能不能加载、交换数据并正常关闭。作业2049510在CPU节点运行六秒，两个全新Java进程各走16个合成亮度窗，除计算耗时外的稳定输出字段完全一致。这个结果解决了数据、运行时和协议移植问题。合成输入没有真实相机，也没有证明Windows与Linux驾驶等价。下一步才申请适合现有Linux模拟器的x86 L40图形节点；主计算节点的ARM架构不能直接替代它。","en":"Roihu migration began with CPU job 2049510, without driving or learning. Two fresh Java processes each completed 16 synthetic-brightness windows during a six-second allocation. The Linux core loaded, exchanged data and closed its protocol correctly. Stable step and closing fields matched exactly after computation time was excluded. This established basic software and data portability. The next requirement was an x86 L40 graphics allocation capable of running the Linux simulator.","title_zh":"先在Linux CPU上检查已有模型的运行接口","id":"step-048","summary_en":"The existing Java model ran on Roihu's Linux CPU and exchanged data correctly. The next step was preparing graphics for the simulator.","summary_zh":"已有 Java 模型在 Roihu 的 Linux CPU 上成功运行并交换数据。下一步是为模拟器准备图形环境。"},{"title_en":"The first GPU job confused scheduler indices with CUDA device indices","zh":"第一次GPU验收只运行一秒，还没有开模拟器。作业2049789里，调度器记录分配编号1，但作业内可见的NVML设备编号是0，CUDA可见编号也是0。入口拿1去查，得到找不到设备就停止。图形依赖还有缺项，但首个实际触发点是编号映射。修复优先用UUID和PCI识别真实分配设备，再准备图形环境，不能把它说成模型或驾驶失败。","en":"GPU job 2049789 stopped after one allocated second, before launching the simulator. Slurm reported global device index 1, whereas the job's CUDA and device-monitoring environment exposed that GPU as index 0. A lookup of index 1 found no device and stopped startup. Graphics tools were also absent, but device identification was the first failing check. I changed identification to use the hardware UUID and PCI information before preparing rendering.","title_zh":"GPU编号不一致，模拟器尚未启动","id":"step-049","summary_en":"The first GPU check used the scheduler's device number inside a differently numbered environment. I changed the check to identify the allocated hardware directly.","summary_zh":"首次 GPU 检查把调度器编号当成运行环境内编号，因而找不到设备。我改为直接核对所分配硬件的身份。"},{"title_en":"The device check passed, but graphics startup still failed","zh":"第二次作业2050459已能确认GPU身份，也启动Xvfb，但VirtualGL和glxinfo在EGL设备处失败，留下Mesa、DRM权限等错误。五秒后作业结束，Unity和学习都没启动。此时尚不能指定唯一driver或权限根因。后续只读审计找到路径比较的具体问题，并检查CSC官方图形容器；下一轮把这些修正作为单独版本验证。","en":"Job 2050459 passed the revised GPU identity check and started the virtual display server Xvfb. The rendering tools VirtualGL and glxinfo then failed during EGL initialization, leaving Mesa warnings and device-access errors. The allocation ended after five seconds, before Unity or learning started. The records did not establish a driver or permissions cause. A later source inspection identified a path-comparison problem and examined CSC's official graphics container. I tested those changes together in the next revision rather than attributing success to either one separately.","title_zh":"找到了设备，渲染检查仍未通过","id":"step-050","summary_en":"The corrected device check passed, but graphics initialization failed. I inspected the rendering path and official container before another attempt.","summary_zh":"设备身份检查修好后，图形初始化仍失败。我检查渲染路径和官方容器，再进行下一次尝试。"},{"title_en":"The official graphics container delivered camera frames","zh":"第三次使用实际DRM规范路径和CSC已有的图形容器。作业2051461运行十秒，glxinfo和Unity都报告NVIDIA L40，场景请求后收到21条遥测，其中末20张连续160×120图像满足低速要求。真实图像有纹理与道路标记，说明渲染和相机链可用。两项修正一起成功，不能分别断定哪一项单独解决了前次问题。所有命令仍为制动状态。接着要测真实转向、滑行、制动和返回起点，而不是直接跳到学习。","en":"Job 2051461 used the corrected device path and CSC's existing graphics container. During the ten-second allocation, both the graphics diagnostic and Unity identified the renderer as NVIDIA L40. The scene request was followed by 21 vehicle-data messages; the final twenty consecutive 160×120 images met the low-speed condition. Their textures and road markings confirmed image rendering and delivery. The car remained fully braked. With this combination working, I next tested motion, braking, both steering directions and reset on Linux.","title_zh":"官方图形容器与正确设备路径送来真实图像","id":"step-051","summary_en":"The official graphics container produced real camera frames on the allocated GPU. I could next test vehicle motion and reset on Linux.","summary_zh":"官方图形容器终于在分配的 GPU 上生成真实相机帧。接下来可以在 Linux 上测量车辆动作和重置。"},{"title_en":"Linux motion and reset behavior are measured separately","zh":"作业2052727沿用已验证图形环境，测直行后滑行、直行后制动和两个符号的转向。两个转向窗的车头变化约−6.49和+6.39度；相近初速下，滑行末速度0.3625，制动接近零。四次从已位移处重置均回到固定容差内，最大位置误差约0.000738。495条遥测和34张真实图像保留了过程。它给Linux端建立了独立动作与重置依据，而不是假设Windows参数全部等价。随后测真实相机到固定核心的完整处理延迟。","en":"In job 2052727, I measured straight coasting, braking and left and right steering in the accepted Linux graphics environment. The turning windows changed yaw by about −6.49 and +6.39 degrees. From closely matched starting speeds, coasting ended at 0.3625 while braking brought speed close to zero. All four resets returned from displaced positions within the required pose tolerance; maximum error was about 0.000738. The run saved 495 vehicle-data samples and 34 images. Having measured Linux action and reset behaviour, I next timed the live camera-to-core processing path.","title_zh":"同Linux环境测转向符号、滑行、制动和返回起点","id":"step-052","summary_en":"Linux tests confirmed both steering directions, braking and returns to the start. I then measured the camera-to-model processing time.","summary_zh":"Linux 测试确认了左右转向、刹车和回到起点。随后我测量相机图像进入模型需要多长时间。"},{"title_en":"A forty-frame camera-to-core test recovered from startup delays","zh":"Roihu当时拿不到远程计算机上的旧ridge系数，因此明确选择只测核心，不放假权重或偷偷重训。作业2055503把40张真实相机帧按序经过采样、固定神经核心和特征历史，车辆全程制动。接收到特征完成的中位延迟约28毫秒，前六帧超过50毫秒相机间隔，到第七帧队列恢复；末20帧约27到28毫秒。冷解码和核心计算都参与前段耗时。这是短静止场景的吞吐证据。下一步在Roihu重新采真实老师轨迹并拟合读出，免去依赖关机的旧主机。","en":"The earlier workstation's fitted ridge coefficients were unavailable, so job 2055503 tested the neural core without those external readouts. With the car braked and weights fixed, it processed forty live camera frames through sampling, neural computation and feature history. Median time from reception to features was about 28 milliseconds. The first six frames exceeded the 50-millisecond camera interval, but the queue caught up by frame seven; the final twenty took roughly 27–28 milliseconds. Both initial image decoding and core execution contributed to the delay. I next collected fresh Roihu teacher data and fitted new external readouts.","title_zh":"真实相机到固定核心的冷启动和稳定延迟","id":"step-053","summary_en":"The first image-processing steps were slow, but the queue caught up. I then collected fresh training images on Roihu.","summary_zh":"最初几个图像处理步骤较慢，随后队列追上了采集速度。我接着在 Roihu 采集新的训练图像。"},{"title_en":"Fresh Linux teacher drives replaced dependence on the earlier computer","zh":"我选择在Roihu从新数据学习，不继续等旧主机。GPU作业2058849先用几何老师采四条训练和两条验证轨迹，共14,289张真实相机帧和3446个有效动作标签。六段都完成，训练与验证按整段分开。第一段到达导出路线末端，净进度48.42，标签位置平均路线偏差0.0223；这些都是老师行为，不是神经控制。老师轨迹和原图随后交给依赖该作业成功的CPU作业，密集回放固定核心并拟合小读出。两个作业分担采集与离线计算，属于同一个G2科学目的。","en":"Rather than wait for unavailable parameters from the earlier computer, I collected fresh data on Roihu. GPU job 2058849 used the geometric teacher for four training and two validation trajectories. All six completed, producing 14,289 camera frames and 3,446 eligible action labels, split by whole trajectory. The first reached the exported route end, with net progress 48.42 and mean route distance 0.0223 at labelled positions. These were teacher results. A dependent CPU job then replayed the images through the fixed core and fitted small output models. The collection and fitting jobs were separate stages of the same G2 experiment.","title_zh":"在新环境重新采集教师驾驶图像","id":"step-054","summary_en":"I collected new teacher trajectories on Roihu because the earlier fitted parameters were unavailable. A separate CPU job then used those images for fitting.","summary_zh":"早期拟合参数已不可用，我便在 Roihu 重新采集教师轨迹，再由独立 CPU 作业利用这些图像拟合读出。"},{"title_en":"Neural prediction beat a constant but missed strong left corrections","zh":"CPU作业2059323等待采集成功后开始，六条固定核心回放和六个ridge候选全部完成。2298个训练标签、1148个验证标签上，神经转向误差0.082109，比恒定均值0.142451小，但直接视网膜为0.010723。神经模型不是只学截距，760项历史中194项被保留。不过平均误差掩盖方向弱项：验证集强左标签很少，神经强左误差0.353337，而直接视网膜约0.0144。先不靠平均表格宣布成功，下一作业把选定读出权重固定，给老师、神经和直接视网膜相同的四种起点，看实际车怎样走。","en":"CPU job 2059323 replayed all six trajectories through the fixed core and fitted six ridge candidates, using 2,298 training and 1,148 validation labels. Neural steering MAE was 0.082109, below the constant mean's 0.142451, while direct retinal-brightness history achieved 0.010723. The neural fit retained 194 of 760 history features, so it used more than a constant intercept. However, large left corrections were rare in validation: neural MAE on those labels was 0.353337, versus about 0.0144 for the direct-image comparator. I held the selected weights fixed and compared teacher, neural and direct-image driving from four matched starts.","title_zh":"同批新轨迹先回放固定核心，再拟合外部读出","id":"step-055","summary_en":"The neural readout predicted actions better than a constant, but missed large left corrections. I tested its driving with weights held fixed.","summary_zh":"神经读出的动作预测优于常量，但对大幅左纠偏误差较大。我接着固定权重，直接测试驾驶。"},{"title_en":"The neural-feature controller failed early; the image-based comparison finished","zh":"固定权重的读出真正接车后，离线预测与驾驶的差距显现。作业2062867在同四起点依次跑老师、神经和直接视网膜，共12个有效记录，路线几何一致。神经四次只运行8.8到12.6秒，在前段直道碰到0.5路线距离保护；没有走到后面的左右弯。直接视网膜四次都到路线末端。原60秒门槛只记3/4，其中一例是时间边界多出约0.717微秒，实际后续驾驶完成，原门槛记录仍保留。神经失败不是延迟保护触发，末动作方向还与同帧几何纠偏相反。因此下一轮优先补它真正访问到的偏离状态，而不是扩大相同正常轨迹数据。","en":"Job 2062867 ran the teacher, neural and direct-image controllers from the same four starts, giving twelve accepted drives on matched geometry. All neural cases reached the 0.5-unit route-distance stopping limit after 8.8–12.6 seconds, still on the early straight. Their final commands opposed the geometric correction for the same frame. All direct-image cases reached the endpoint. The original 60-second check counted only three of four direct-image passes because one checkpoint exceeded its timing boundary by about 0.717 microseconds; that classification and endpoint arrival were kept separate. The neural failures were driving terminations, not latency stops. I next added corrective labels at positions visited by the failing policies.","title_zh":"离线预测有所改善，神经控制器接车却很快失败","id":"step-056","summary_en":"The neural controller left the allowed route band early; the direct-image comparator reached the endpoint. I collected corrective labels from the failed paths.","summary_zh":"神经控制器很早就离开允许的路线范围，直接图像对照却到达终点。我转向采集失败轨迹上的纠偏标签。"},{"title_en":"Corrective replays finished, but duplicate episode references blocked fitting","zh":"纠偏轮复用八条既有策略轨迹的2364个同帧老师标签，原六段老师数据也保留。CPU作业2064884先把八段相机完整重放，四条神经轨迹的现场和重放特征在1184个窗、419,368个数值上完全一致。可是组装数据时，一个列表引用被重复追加，使应有的14条独立回合出现22项引用。拟合器正确拒绝重复身份，尚未估计参数。这是数据组装失败，成功的神经回放不用重跑。下一次仅验证重复对确实相同，重建14个唯一回合，再做fit-only恢复。","en":"The corrective round added 2,364 same-frame teacher labels from eight saved policy trajectories to the original six teacher episodes. CPU job 2064884 replayed all eight image sequences successfully. Live and replayed neural features matched exactly over 1,184 windows and 419,368 values. Fitting stopped before estimating parameters because a list-aliasing bug duplicated episode references, producing 22 entries instead of fourteen unique episodes. The fitter rejected the duplicates. After confirming that each duplicated pair was identical, I kept the completed replay files and repaired data assembly in a separate fit-only job.","title_zh":"纠偏数据的回放完成，组装重复使拟合拒绝","id":"step-057","summary_en":"Replaying the images worked, but duplicated trajectory references stopped fitting. I kept the completed replay and repaired data assembly separately.","summary_zh":"图像回放成功，重复的轨迹引用却使拟合停止。我保留已经完成的回放，单独修复数据组装。"},{"title_en":"Repairing the fitting step reused the successful replays","zh":"作业2065069只处理文件组装和拟合，不重新运行已经成功的核心回放。它在14秒内完成六个候选，训练3492行、验证2318行。扩大数据后的神经转向误差为0.243121，直接视网膜0.073924，常数0.301092；而在原来的两段验证上，新模型反而比原模型误差高。这提示纠偏与正常状态拟合存在权衡。选定权重被固定，再安排新的实际驾驶评估，不能把这轮验证误差与旧数据表横比当作整车改善。","en":"Job 2065069 assembled the data and fitted the models without repeating the successful neural replays. In fourteen allocated seconds, six candidates used 3,492 training and 2,318 validation rows. On the expanded validation set, steering MAE was 0.243121 for neural features, 0.073924 for direct image features and 0.301092 for the constant baseline. Both new fits had higher error on the original two validation episodes than their predecessors. The added correction data therefore introduced a tradeoff rather than a clear overall gain. I saved the selected fixed weights for another driving comparison.","title_zh":"修复重复引用后，只重新拟合","id":"step-058","summary_en":"Fitting resumed without repeating the image replay. The expanded data improved some corrections but worsened the earlier validation cases, so driving needed another test.","summary_zh":"拟合恢复时没有重复图像回放。扩充数据改善部分纠偏，却使原验证案例变差，因此还需要直接检查驾驶。"},{"title_en":"Old test names blocked evaluation before the car moved","zh":"纠偏评估的第一份GPU作业2065101九秒就停止，还没有车辆轨迹。旧入口只允许dev01到dev04，新的明确配置使用correct01到correct04，所以被白名单拒绝。模型和配置并没有完成实际比较。修复只允许这两组已声明的标识，并用全部24个新旧运行名检查接口。原失败版本不覆盖，另开作业运行相同的固定权重科学比较。","en":"Job 2065101 stopped after nine seconds, before the car moved. The old evaluator accepted test names dev01–dev04, but the new cases were named correct01–correct04, so its name check rejected them. I changed the check to accept both sets and verified all 24 old and new run names. The model comparison itself had not begun. I kept this failed startup and used a separate job to rerun the unchanged comparison with fixed weights.","title_zh":"旧名称检查在车辆移动前挡住评估","id":"step-059","summary_en":"The job stopped before the car moved because old code rejected the new test names. I allowed both name sets and reran the unchanged comparison separately.","summary_zh":"作业在车辆移动前停止，原因是旧程序不接受新测试名称。我允许两组名称后，另开作业重新运行原比较。"},{"title_en":"Corrective fitting changed the bias without producing reliable driving","zh":"修正入口后的作业2065170完成全部12条记录，老师四条都到路线末端。神经特征条件仍在7.2到13.2秒触发路线距离保护，60秒标准0/4。直接视网膜四条都到120秒上限，60秒标准4/4，但没有一条走到路线末端，某些案例明显变慢。神经末段现在偏到与上一代相反的一侧，同帧老师要求的方向仍与实际弱命令不一致。新起点和旧评估不同，因此不把这个差异当孤立重训因果。结果说明增加纠偏数据尚未形成可靠神经控制。下一步用已保存参数和命令，具体审计基线偏置为什么改变。","en":"After the name-check repair, job 2065170 completed all twelve drives. All four teacher cases reached the route end. Neural cases still hit the route-distance limit after 7.2–13.2 seconds and passed none of the four 60-second checks. All direct-image cases reached the 120-second cap and passed the 60-second criterion, but none reached the endpoint; some moved much more slowly. The neural trajectories drifted to the opposite side from the earlier generation, and weak commands still disagreed with the geometric correction for the same frame. The starts also differed from the earlier evaluation. I next inspected the fitted parameters and data weighting behind this changed bias.","title_zh":"纠偏拟合仍未带来可靠神经驾驶","id":"step-060","summary_en":"Corrective fitting changed the steering bias but still did not produce reliable neural driving. I checked how the training episodes had been weighted.","summary_zh":"纠偏数据改变了转向偏置，却仍未带来可靠驾驶。我随后检查不同训练回合在拟合中占了多大权重。"},{"title_en":"Episode weighting helped explain the reversed baseline predictions","zh":"这次审计只读旧、新ridge参数及已经执行的命令。发现两个很短的神经失败轨迹只有99行，占训练行的2.84%，但按整回合等权后占总目标权重25%。它们的老师纠偏均值为负，足以和其他轨迹均值一起把截距从+0.102742变为−0.044694，重建误差小于10⁻¹²。其他特征均值、尺度和系数也变了，所以截距不是整段驾驶的全部原因。这个精确联系比“果蝇转向偏好反转”更具体。它促使后续学习方案认真区分数据分布、目标权重与闭环行为，而不是手工把输出符号翻回来。","en":"I compared the old and new ridge parameters with the commands already executed. Two short neural-failure trajectories contained only 99 rows, or 2.84% of training rows, but equal weighting by episode gave them 25% of the fitting objective. Their mean teacher corrections were negative. Combining the episode means reconstructed the intercept change from +0.102742 to −0.044694 within 10⁻¹². Feature means, scales and coefficients also changed, so the intercept alone did not explain driving. The audit nevertheless identified a direct link between data weighting and baseline bias. I paid closer attention to the data distribution instead of manually reversing steering signs.","title_zh":"为什么修正后偏转方向反了","id":"step-061","summary_en":"Two short failed trajectories received a disproportionately large share of the fitting objective. That helped explain the changed baseline bias and guided later data balancing.","summary_zh":"两段很短的失败轨迹在拟合目标中占比过大。这与基础转向偏置的变化有关，也促使后面更重视数据分配。"},{"title_en":"Pause the simulator while learning, then verify action duration","zh":"外部强化学习会在采样后计算更新。若车仍继续跑，优化器耗时就会混进动作持续时间。作业2066309先单独测试拥有的Unity进程暂停0.5、2和5秒，检查前后50毫秒相机时钟连续，并验证最终停止与清理。21秒作业完成后，才进入有真实优化器、重置和存档的短cell验收。这里的暂停是保持接口时间的工程机制，不是神经网络的能力。","en":"The learner needed to compute between samples without letting that delay extend a vehicle action. Job 2066309 tested pausing the experiment's Unity process for 0.5, 2 and 5 seconds. It checked consecutive 50-millisecond camera timestamps before and after each pause, then verified final stopping and process cleanup. The 21-second job completed. This timing mechanism allowed subsequent short learning tests to include real updates, resets and saved policies while controlling when the simulator advanced.","title_zh":"先确认学习器计算时可以暂停模拟器","id":"step-062","summary_en":"I verified that the simulator could pause while the learner updated. Otherwise, computation time would become uncontrolled driving time.","summary_zh":"我验证了学习器更新时可以暂停模拟器。否则，计算耗时也会变成车辆继续运动的时间。"},{"title_en":"An optimizer check incorrectly treated a timestamp as unchangeable","zh":"作业2066439进入真实SAC采样，已有52条有效状态转移和19次更新，随后因ready比较失败停止。审计把启动时间戳也放进不可变身份字段，重新连接时它当然会变。这里已经有真实学习量，不能写成零；但也没有完整比较。下一版只修正稳定身份比较，保留原核心、奖励和学习设置，继续检查完整入口。","en":"Job 2066439 reached 52 valid SAC transitions and nineteen optimizer calls before a startup-identity comparison failed. The comparison incorrectly treated the readiness timestamp as a field that had to stay constant, although it changed on reconnection. The learning already completed remained part of the record. I corrected the comparison to use stable identity fields and kept the core, reward and learning settings unchanged before testing the full startup path again.","title_zh":"身份检查误把启动时间戳当成固定字段","id":"step-063","summary_en":"Learning started, but a check wrongly required a startup timestamp to stay constant. I corrected the identity check and kept the completed learning records.","summary_zh":"学习已经开始，检查程序却错误地要求启动时间戳保持不变。我修正身份检查，并保留已完成的学习记录。"},{"title_en":"An episode-information name collision stopped the next check","zh":"ready比较修正后，作业2066450又推进到53条有效状态转移和20次更新。新的停止点是审计中的整数回合字段碰到SB3期待的回合统计字典。这个重复出现的接口问题说明只测单次step不够，必须真的走到回合结束、重置和日志记账。我保留50秒失败作业，只改命名空间，再做下一轮短验收。","en":"After that correction, job 2066450 reached 53 valid transitions and twenty updates. It stopped when my integer episode field collided with SB3's episode-statistics dictionary. The 50-second failure showed that a startup test had to reach episode termination, reset and logging, not merely execute one step. I renamed the audit field and ran another short check, keeping this integration failure separate from algorithm performance.","title_zh":"回合编号与学习库的统计字段重名","id":"step-064","summary_en":"The next test reached episode completion and exposed a field-name conflict with the learning library. I renamed the field before testing again.","summary_zh":"下一次测试运行到回合结束，暴露了记录字段与学习库重名的问题。我先改字段名，再重新测试。"},{"title_en":"One short training test passed; the next could not reconnect","zh":"第三次作业2066460的SAC神经cell完成128条状态转移、96次更新，权重有限且已改变，重新载入给出的确定性预测一致，最终静止通过。接着第二cell尝试连接同一个已经加载的场景失败。因此一整个作业没完成四种组合，但首cell的成功也不抹掉。下一次明确给每个cell单独的Unity生命周期，避免把场景连接状态与算法差异混在一起。","en":"In job 2066460, the neural-input SAC test completed 128 transitions and 96 updates. Its weights stayed finite and changed, saved deterministic predictions reloaded exactly, and stationary stopping passed. The next test could not reconnect to the already loaded scene, leaving the four-combination job incomplete. I kept the successful first result and gave every subsequent test its own Unity process so scene lifecycle differences would not masquerade as algorithm differences.","title_zh":"首项学习成功，下一项却无法重新连接","id":"step-065","summary_en":"One short learning test completed, but the next could not reconnect to the scene. I separated simulator lifetimes for the following tests.","summary_zh":"一项短时学习测试完成，下一项却无法重新连接场景。我让后续测试分别管理各自的模拟器。"},{"title_en":"All four short learning tests completed","zh":"每cell独立模拟器后，作业2066512完成SAC、PPO与神经、直接视网膜四个组合，每个128条有效状态转移。权重变化、数值有限、确定性重载和最终静止都通过。它解决的是能否运行完整学习流程，参数还是短诊断配置，不能据此选最佳驾驶算法。之后优先实际测一个完整工作进程与四个工作进程的吞吐，决定是否值得并行，而不是因为有GPU就假定加模拟器一定更高效。这里PPO先保存所执行动作、当时概率和奖励，收完一段后重算并限制策略变化；SAC则重复利用已接纳的经验。两者的动作与观测契约在这次短验收中一致。","en":"Job 2066512 completed all four combinations of SAC or PPO with neural or direct-image input, each in a separate simulator. Every combination collected 128 valid transitions, updated finite weights, reproduced deterministic predictions after reload and stopped the vehicle. These were short checks of the learning pipeline. PPO stored actions, their collection-time probabilities and rewards, then limited policy change during updates; SAC reused accepted experience from its buffer. Both used the same action and observation interfaces. With the mechanics working, I next compared one and four complete workers to measure whether parallel collection was worthwhile.","title_zh":"四种算法与输入组合的短验收全部执行","id":"step-066","summary_en":"All algorithm-and-input combinations completed short learning and reload checks. I then measured whether running complete copies in parallel would help.","summary_zh":"各算法与输入组合都完成了短时学习和重新加载检查。随后我测量并行运行完整副本是否能提高效率。"},{"title_en":"One parallel worker started with a stale image","zh":"作业2066603先测单工作进程，128条状态转移用73.00秒；再开四工作进程，其中三条各完成128，另一条在首条有效样本前因相机已经超过端到端延迟界限而停。四工作进程波次约80.15秒，幸存者总吞吐虽更高，预先要求却是全部工作进程有效，并且单位GPU预算吞吐改善至少10%。因此没有采纳四工作进程配置。这个早期负结果很重要：后来的32模拟器并不是一开始就自然可用。当前科学筛查按已声明的单工作进程顺序回退继续。","en":"Job 2066603 measured one complete worker first: 128 transitions took 73.00 seconds. In the four-worker wave, three workers each completed 128 transitions, but the fourth failed before its first valid sample because its initial image was already too old. The wave lasted about 80.15 seconds. Aggregate throughput from the survivors increased, but the planned criterion required every worker to pass and at least a 10% improvement in valid transitions per GPU budget. The configuration failed that criterion. I used the planned sequential fallback for the next scientific screen; reliable large-scale parallel collection came later.","title_zh":"一个并行副本以过期图像开始","id":"step-067","summary_en":"Three parallel workers completed, but the fourth began with a stale image. The configuration failed its all-workers requirement, so the next screen ran sequentially.","summary_zh":"三个并行副本完成，第四个却以过期图像开始。该配置未满足全部通过的要求，后面的比较先按顺序运行。"},{"title_en":"A float32 timing boundary interrupted the first comparison","zh":"短验收通过后，正式四组合筛查的第一项SAC神经特征条件跑到772条有效状态转移和260次更新。作业2066647随后因下一动作过长失败，其余三cell没有开始。实际第四张相机时间比计算目标早18.31微秒，超过旧容差，于是等第五张，再加排队帧，动作变成约300毫秒。有效772条保留；摘要误报零是失败路径统计缺项，原文件不改。这是明确时钟边界问题，因此下一版按已验证的50毫秒密集窗计数暂停，奖励和学习率不变。","en":"Job 2066647 reached 772 valid neural-input SAC transitions and 260 updates before an action lasted too long. The other three combinations never started. The fourth camera timestamp fell 18.31 microseconds short of the computed target, beyond the old tolerance. The client waited for a fifth frame and then drained another queued frame, extending the action to about 300 milliseconds. The failure summary had incorrectly reported zero interaction; the 772 valid transitions were retained. I changed the receiver to count verified 50-millisecond camera windows before pausing, leaving reward and learning rate unchanged.","title_zh":"相机时钟边界使一次动作持续过长","id":"step-068","summary_en":"A tiny timestamp difference made the program wait for an extra frame and hold an action too long. I changed how it counted valid camera intervals.","summary_zh":"很小的时间戳差异使程序多等一帧，导致动作持续过久。我修改了有效相机时间段的计数方式。"},{"title_en":"Pausing at the fourth frame still left camera frames queued","zh":"第二次正式作业2067259保留803条有效状态转移和291次更新。虽然已按第四帧暂停，仍有两张排队画面跟来，把一个动作延长，下一间隔被拒绝，其余三cell仍未运行。失败策略也保存，最终停止通过。可见只修浮点目标还不够，神经表示本身处理每帧约花一个相机周期，排队会累积。下一版在每张帧做神经表示之前暂停生产者，暂停中排空，再只为剩余窗口恢复运行；原动作时长界限和所有真实帧都保留。","en":"The next job, 2067259, saved 803 valid transitions and 291 updates. Pausing on the fourth frame still left two camera frames queued, and reading them extended an action beyond its allowed duration. The other three combinations again never ran. A policy snapshot was saved and stationary cleanup passed. The neural representation took about one camera period to compute per frame, allowing a backlog; the earlier floating-point boundary was therefore not the only problem. I next paused the producer before processing each frame, drained the queue while paused and resumed only for the remaining required windows, keeping the original duration limit.","title_zh":"暂停后排队的画面仍延长了动作","id":"step-069","summary_en":"Pausing at the intended frame still left queued images. I moved the pause earlier and processed the queue while the simulator was stopped.","summary_zh":"在目标帧暂停后，队列里仍有旧图像。我把暂停提前，并在模拟器停止时处理队列。"},{"title_en":"A longer test exposed a stale command echo","zh":"逐帧暂停版越过前两次的失败位置，最终收1610条有效状态转移、1098次更新，保存1024步检查点。但作业2067563仍在第一cell停止。它发出新转向0.12029和油门0.03445，随后四张相机却一直回显上一命令0.22865和0.04859。这是明显旧动作，不是小数精度差。无效间隔在奖励和replay之前排除，具体命令传递或Unity调度根因仍未查明。最终静止判据未通过，虽所有拥有进程已退出，也必须分别记录。下一步先做有限传输诊断，不直接重跑长训练。","en":"The per-frame pause version passed both earlier failure points and reached 1,610 valid transitions and 1,098 updates, including a 1,024-step checkpoint. Job 2067563 still stopped in its first learning condition. New steering 0.12029 and throttle 0.03445 were sent, but all four following camera messages reported the previous values, 0.22865 and 0.04859. The difference was much larger than rounding error. I excluded that interval before reward calculation or replay-buffer insertion. The command-delivery or Unity-scheduling cause remained unknown. Final stationarity was not verified, although the tracked processes exited. I next ran a finite transport diagnostic rather than repeat long training immediately.","title_zh":"新动作期间仍报告上一条命令","id":"step-070","summary_en":"The camera messages reported the previous command throughout a new action. I excluded that interval and investigated command transport before longer training.","summary_zh":"新动作期间，相机消息始终报告上一条命令。我排除这段数据，先调查命令传输，再考虑长时间训练。"},{"title_en":"The transport test stopped because the action lasted too long","zh":"有限传输候选启用TCP_NODELAY、暂停时不刷新控制，并用有界等待确认末端静止。作业2067982不做学习，目标2048次规定制动动作，实际787次有效。第788次用了七张密集相机帧，共0.34999秒，超过动作界限。第一张仍回显旧命令，后六张及终点已是新命令，所以这次不是先前四帧全旧的同一症状。排队和暂停的精确调度原因仍未解开。全部真实帧保留，最终静止与进程退出通过。后续改成声明的有限变时长交互，并在真实学习中验证拒绝后恢复，避免普通无效间隔结束整个学习器。","en":"The transport diagnostic enabled TCP_NODELAY, stopped refreshing controls while the simulator was paused and used bounded waiting to verify final stationarity. Job 2067982 performed no learning. Of 2,048 planned braked actions, 787 were valid. The next action used seven camera windows, lasting 0.34999 seconds, and exceeded the duration limit. Its first frame reported the old command, but the next six and the endpoint reported the new one—a different pattern from the previous all-four-stale failure. The detailed scheduling cause remained unresolved. All frames were saved, and final stopping and process exit passed. I next tested bounded variable-duration interaction and recovery during learning.","title_zh":"终点命令报告正确，动作持续仍过长","id":"step-071","summary_en":"The transport test stopped on an action that lasted too long, with a different echo pattern from the earlier failure. I next tested bounded recovery during learning.","summary_zh":"传输测试因一次动作过长而停止，但命令回传模式与上次不同。我接着测试学习过程中能否有界恢复。"},{"title_en":"An injected interruption tested recovery during training","zh":"反复因为接口中断退出整作业，会把已有学习进度一起截断。这一轮明确允许有效动作在一秒内有限变时长，但无法用的间隔不给奖励、不进经验库。作业2068257还在第768个有效样本后故意注入一次中断，验证不是口头说能恢复。它保住同一学习器、优化器和已经接纳的经验内容，6.59秒重置恢复，之后又完成1018次更新。最终因动作前wall预算保护正常停止，目标2048步实际完成1786步、1274次SAC更新、38个回合，末端静止和进程清理通过。恢复机制已经实测；驾驶质量仍需要独立固定权重评估。","en":"I allowed valid action intervals of up to one second and kept unusable intervals out of reward calculation and the replay buffer. Job 2068257 deliberately interrupted collection after 768 valid samples, testing recovery during SAC learning. The same learner, optimizer and accepted replay data survived the interruption. Reset recovery took 6.59 seconds and was followed by 1,018 further updates. A time-budget check ended collection normally at 1,786 of the intended 2,048 samples, with 1,274 SAC updates and 38 episodes. Final stationary stopping and cleanup passed. The next step evaluated driving with the saved policies held fixed.","title_zh":"在真实学习中故意中断一次，验证保住学习器与有效经验","id":"step-072","summary_en":"A deliberately interrupted run resumed learning after a reset. I then evaluated the saved policy separately to see whether driving had improved.","summary_zh":"一次人为中断后，程序通过重置恢复了学习。我再单独评估保存的策略，检查驾驶是否改善。"},{"title_en":"The learned bias helped one start and harmed the other","zh":"独立作业2068846固定恢复试验的初始和最终策略权重，再用左右两种初始化及几何老师做六个案例，不做更新。左案例最后有效进度从2.21增到3.19，持续5.6到7.4秒；右案例从2.97降到2.42，持续7.0到6.0秒。四次策略驾驶全部触发允许的路线距离范围，两个老师完成路线。策略的确定性转向几乎恒定，主要变化是均值由约−0.0916翻为+0.0862。因此结果是混合改善和偏置改变，不能只挑左案例作成功视频。接下来我选择更长神经学习，并要求保留共同样本检查点与直接视网膜比较。","en":"Job 2068846 evaluated the recovery experiment's initial and final policies without further updates, using two starts and geometric-teacher references for six cases. On the left case, last valid progress rose from 2.21 to 3.19 and duration from 5.6 to 7.4 seconds. On the right, progress fell from 2.97 to 2.42 and duration from 7 to 6 seconds. All four policy drives reached the route-distance stopping limit; both teachers completed the route. Deterministic steering was nearly constant, with mean bias changing from about −0.0916 to +0.0862. Since one start improved and the other worsened, I kept both outcomes and chose longer neural learning with intermediate checkpoints and a planned direct-image comparison.","title_zh":"恢复试验学到的策略：一个起点进步，另一个退步","id":"step-073","summary_en":"The learned change helped one start and harmed the other. I kept both outcomes and moved to longer learning with saved intermediate models.","summary_zh":"学习后的变化帮助了一个起点，却损害了另一个。我保留两种结果，并在更长学习中保存中间模型。"},{"title_en":"Neural training finished, but archive export blocked the second condition","zh":"长作业2068970计划神经特征条件三小时、直接视网膜臂一小时，同一固定核心和SAC设置，保存1024至16384步等共同检查点。神经学习实际完成19,233个有效经验、18,721次更新，479个完整回合全在工程允许的路线范围终止，最后还有一次无动作重置。学习客户端和清理已经成功，随后旧运行层试图把庞大的逐帧记录全压缩，外层超时终止导出，整个batch失败，视网膜臂根本没启动。独立紧凑导出保住权重、经验库、随机状态和日志。训练前后100局的均值进度反而下降，原因未定。这里要同时讲完成的学习、失败的打包和缺失的比较，不能用一个completed或failed概括全部。","en":"Job 2068970 planned three hours for the neural-input SAC learner and one for the direct-image comparator, keeping the neural core fixed and saving checkpoints at common sample counts. Neural learning completed 19,233 valid transitions and 18,721 updates. All 479 completed episodes ended at the route-distance limit; one final reset received no action. The client and cleanup finished, but compression of the enormous per-frame archive exceeded the outer timeout. The batch failed and the comparator never started. A separate compact export preserved weights, replay data, random state and logs. Mean progress also declined between the first and last hundred training episodes, for an unresolved reason. Completed learning, failed export and the absent comparison were recorded separately.","title_zh":"神经学习完成，导出超时使直接图像条件未启动","id":"step-074","summary_en":"The neural training finished, but exporting the huge image archive timed out before the comparison arm started. I kept training and export outcomes separate.","summary_zh":"神经训练完成了，但导出庞大图像档案超时，对照条件尚未启动。我分别记录训练完成和导出失败。"},{"title_en":"The Windows demonstration failed before loading the model","zh":"拿已有Roihu最终策略回Windows做固定权重演示，最初两次都停在依赖入口。一次脚本找不到旁边模块；修正后，复制来的运行时锁文件因换行字节不同，选中了不存在的哈希目录，又报找不到NumPy。解析后的依赖内容其实相同。恢复原锁字节后使用已经安装的运行时。两次没有新学习，也没有车辆数据。它们解释了为什么“演示已发起”不能直接写成“看见策略开车”。","en":"The Windows demonstration encountered two setup failures before model execution. The first could not import a neighbouring script. After that repair, different newline bytes in the copied dependency-lock file selected a nonexistent hash-named package directory and caused a NumPy import error, although the parsed requirements were identical. Restoring the original lock-file bytes selected the installed runtime. Neither attempt trained a model or produced a vehicle trajectory. I then proceeded to a separate demonstration run.","title_zh":"跨系统演示先遇到两个依赖入口错误","id":"step-075","summary_en":"The Windows demonstration first failed at imports and dependency lookup. Neither attempt reached the model or the vehicle.","summary_zh":"Windows 演示首先被模块导入和依赖查找挡住，两次尝试都尚未进入模型或车辆运行。"},{"title_en":"The policy loaded, but the Windows scene-message parser failed","zh":"第一次正式固定权重演示确实载入19,233步策略，前后数字权重哈希相同，历史更新数保持18,721。随后场景握手里一个timeStamp使用小数逗号，JSON解析停止，驾驶状态转移为零。直接回放六条已存原始消息就能定位需要的窄修复，无需重跑模拟器猜原因。Windows适配器随后复用既有数字修复并保留原字节，另开第二次演示。","en":"The first demonstration loaded the saved 19,233-step policy, with matching numerical weight hashes before and after and an unchanged historical count of 18,721 updates. A decimal-comma timestamp during the Windows scene handshake then broke JSON parsing, leaving zero driving transitions. I replayed the six saved messages to identify the needed parsing correction. The Windows adapter reused the narrow numeric repair, kept the original bytes and started a separate second demonstration.","title_zh":"策略已加载，场景消息中的小数格式又使程序停止","id":"step-076","summary_en":"The saved policy loaded unchanged, but a decimal-comma message stopped scene parsing. I repaired the reader using the saved messages.","summary_zh":"保存的策略原样加载成功，但逗号小数消息使场景解析停止。我用已有消息检查并修复接收程序。"},{"title_en":"A short Windows drive produced constant commands","zh":"第二次演示真正运行了11个有效决策、44张策略相机窗，共约2.2秒模拟时间。每个动作都完全相同：转向−0.56745，油门0.09420，最终在0.5路线距离保护之外结束。车辆没有完成路线，末端静止通过，权重和更新计数始终不变。展示共有161帧时必须说明包含预热和停止，不是161次驾驶决策。这还是Windows转移案例：导出路线长42.929，Linux训练路长49.219，环境和二进制也不同。于是下一步先审计这11个决策实际接收到的输入是否同样没变。","en":"The second demonstration produced eleven valid decisions and 44 policy camera windows over about 2.2 simulated seconds. Every command was identical: steering −0.56745 and throttle 0.09420. The car crossed the 0.5-unit route-distance limit without completing the route. Stationary stopping passed; the weights and historical update count stayed unchanged. The 161 frames in the viewer included warmup and cleanup, not 161 driving decisions. This Windows transfer also used a different binary and a 42.929-unit route, compared with 49.219 in Linux training. I inspected the eleven preceding input vectors before attributing the constant commands to any cause.","title_zh":"短时迁移演示中，每个转向命令都相同","id":"step-077","summary_en":"The transferred policy produced exactly the same command for every decision and left the route band. I checked whether its inputs were actually changing.","summary_zh":"迁移后的策略每次都输出完全相同的命令，并离开允许路线范围。我随后检查输入是否真的在变化。"},{"title_en":"Changing camera inputs still produced constant commands","zh":"只读输入审计逐个匹配reset终点和前十个动作终点，它们才是11次决策真正使用的前置观测。按实际除100、float32和可用性mask重建后，11个1520维输入向量都不同。760项神经数值中179项变化，404项不可用；817个相机亮度列也都变化。因此相机画面保持不变或缓存同一输入不能解释这段恒动作。策略对这段差异不敏感，但原因仍未知。这个诊断把下一阶段的目标拉回内部可训练路径：不再只调原固定Java模型或外部读出，先用C1查参数路径，再构建能训练连接的连续循环核心。","en":"The file audit matched every action to its preceding observation: the reset endpoint followed by the previous ten action endpoints. After the policy's division by 100, float32 conversion and availability masks, all eleven 1,520-value input vectors were distinct. Of 760 neural-value columns, 179 varied and 404 were unavailable. All 817 sampled brightness columns varied too. A camera image frozen in time or an identical cached input therefore did not explain the constant commands. The policy did not respond to those observed differences, but the cause remained unknown. I next returned to internal learning: first checking C1's exposed parameters, then building C2's trainable continuous core.","title_zh":"输入确实在变化，恒动作不能归于缓存同一画面","id":"step-078","summary_en":"The recorded inputs were different even though every action was identical. I therefore investigated the policy's response rather than blaming a unchanging camera feed.","summary_zh":"虽然动作完全相同，记录的输入却各不相同。我因此检查策略对输入的反应，没有把原因归为相机卡住。"},{"title_en":"A manually increased gain reached the model before warmup timed out","zh":"C1仍使用原Java神经模型，只开放五个全局或共享参数，不做优化器学习。这一轮对原增益和提高25%的增益，各计划两个起点。原增益两例都完成15秒，神经转向和油门全零；少量前进来自初始化油门后的滑行。提高增益的第一例在33个预热窗后撞到10秒整段wall预算，另一个没启动。每张帧延迟都未越界，支持先修整段计算预算，而不是放宽有效数据标准。原结果保留，接着只补缺失的增益条件，不重跑已经完成的基线。","en":"C1 retained the original Java model and exposed only five global or shared parameters, without optimizer learning. I planned two starts at the original gain and two with a 25% increase. Both original-gain cases completed 15 seconds with zero neural steering and throttle; initialization coasting accounted for their small progress. The first increased-gain case timed out after 33 warmup windows under the ten-second whole-phase limit, and the other never started. Individual frame delays stayed within bounds. I adjusted only the processing allowance, kept the completed baselines and ran the two missing changed-gain cases separately.","title_zh":"调整增益可到达模型，预热却超时","id":"step-079","summary_en":"The changed gain reached the model, but the warmup time limit stopped the test. I adjusted that processing allowance and ran only the missing cases.","summary_zh":"修改后的增益已进入模型，但预热耗时超限使测试停止。我只调整处理时限，再补跑缺失案例。"},{"title_en":"Stronger activity produced one-sided steering","zh":"补验只改变C1整段预热预算，神经时间、单帧时钟和总截止时间不变。提高增益的左案例75动作到15秒，右案例70动作到14秒因无进度结束。两例油门都为零，非零转向分别64和60次，全部为负；车头变化约−18.9和−18.6度。更多下行神经元活动确实变成车辆命令，但没有学出方向选择或推进。膜电位还出现约−190毫伏极值，不能把更多脉冲直接称为健康计算。于是我决定超出五个全局量，允许学习独立连接、感觉注入与外部输出，进入C2。","en":"The follow-up changed C1's whole-phase processing allowance while retaining neural duration, per-frame checks and the global deadline. The increased-gain cases completed 75 actions over 15 seconds and 70 over 14 seconds; the latter ended for lack of progress. Throttle stayed zero. They produced 64 and 60 nonzero steering commands, all negative, with heading changes around −18.9 and −18.6 degrees. More descending activity reached the car but supplied neither bidirectional control nor propulsion. Membrane minima near −190 millivolts also raised a numerical concern. I decided to move beyond five global settings: C2 introduced trainable individual connections, an input mapping and an output layer.","title_zh":"C1补验：增益改变引起单向转向，油门仍为零","id":"step-080","summary_en":"More neural activity produced one-sided steering and no throttle. I decided to make individual connections learnable instead of tuning only global gains.","summary_zh":"神经活动增加后，只有单向转向，油门仍为零。我决定让独立连接参与学习，而不再只调全局增益。"},{"title_en":"Replace fixed spiking dynamics with a trainable continuous recurrent core","zh":"C2是计算实现的重要改变，不是给原Java程序装一个优化器。连接图、边的正负号和已有连接关系保留，动力学换成可求梯度的有界连续计算。每个神经元保存一个带符号的数；下一轮把邻居状态按连接加权，加上当前输入和偏置，再与旧状态混合。一次驾驶决策做四轮，所得数继续带到下一决策，这就是本项目的循环状态。输入先是8×8灰度的64个值，加四项公开路线或车辆辅助量，这68个数共同经过68到3324的可学习全连接层和tanh，注入3324个选定R1–R6细胞。1314个下行神经元读出再接小动作头。C2让每条已有边有自己的有界增益，也开放神经元泄漏和偏置。CUDA小图与稀疏求导检查相同，真实大图有615万余边参数改变，才开始车辆PPO。","en":"C2 replaced the fixed spiking calculation with a continuous, differentiable recurrent core, while keeping the connectome's existing edges and their signs. Each neuron held a signed number. Each calculation round combined connected activity, bias and current input, then mixed that result with the previous state. Four rounds ran per driving decision, and their final values carried into the next decision. The initial input contained 64 grayscale values from an 8×8 image and four declared route or vehicle cues. A learned 68-to-3,324 map and tanh supplied 3,324 R1–R6 cells; 1,314 descending features fed small action heads. Existing edges gained bounded trainable multipliers, alongside trainable leak and bias. CUDA tests checked sparse and dense derivatives and changed over 6.15 million edge coordinates before vehicle training.","title_zh":"C2：把连接组变成可求梯度的连续循环核心","id":"step-081","summary_en":"I replaced the fixed spiking calculation with a continuous recurrent core whose connection gains could learn from recorded driving.","summary_zh":"我把固定脉冲计算改为连续循环核心，让连接增益能够根据驾驶记录学习。"},{"title_en":"The first PPO run updated the internal connection gains","zh":"内部可训练后，第一项要证明实际驾驶经验能更新这些参数。C2先完成128个有效动作、32次优化器更新，约618万边的增益坐标改变。这里的PPO操作是：采样时保存观测、实际动作、当时动作概率和环境奖励；收完一小段后，重算当前策略对相同动作的概率，再限制新旧变化来更新。环境普通离路线会结束一局并重置，不能用的接口间隔则不进训练。图像还是8×8，四个公开辅助量也进入核心，没有直接绕到动作的捷径。四次固定权重驾驶都在约五秒离开保护带，初末持续时间相同。学习链可用，驾驶改善还没出现，因此显式继续短预算。","en":"The first integrated C2 run tested whether live driving experience could update internal connections. It completed 128 valid actions and 32 updates, changing about 6.18 million edge-gain coordinates. The project implementation of proximal policy optimization (PPO) saved inputs, executed actions, their probabilities and rewards. It then recomputed those action probabilities during updates while limiting how far the policy changed. Input still consisted of the 8×8 image and four auxiliary cues, all passing through the core. Route-distance terminations reset the car; invalid interface intervals stayed out of training. Four driving tests with fixed weights ended near five seconds, with no survival gain from initial to final policy. I next continued from the saved training state with a larger budget.","title_zh":"短时驾驶经验确实更新了内部连接","id":"step-082","summary_en":"Driving experience changed internal connection gains, but the short evaluation did not improve. I next continued from the saved training state.","summary_zh":"驾驶经验确实改变了内部连接增益，短时评估却未改善。我接着从保存的训练状态继续。"},{"title_en":"Continue from saved weights and optimizer state","zh":"续学不是随意打开一个文件就算继承。C2第二轮读取第一轮参数和Adam状态，包括优化器的历史一阶、二阶数值与步数；车辆、循环状态和采样种子重新开始，所以不说是同一段物理轨迹接着开。它增加1024个有效动作、256次更新，累计1152动作、288更新，30个完整回合，约615秒实际耗时，没有接口恢复。内部参数继续改变，训练完成。这里记录新量与累计量、参数与优化器继承，为后来多轮检查点谱系建立了基本做法。接下来固定训练结果的权重，独立看初始和末策略驾驶。 Adam 会利用此前梯度的累积统计调整后续更新幅度，因此续训时也恢复这些数值。","en":"C2's second run restored the first run's parameters and Adam optimizer state, including its running gradient statistics and update count. Those statistics affect later parameter changes. The car, recurrent state and sampling seed started fresh. The continuation added 1,024 valid actions and 256 updates, reaching cumulative totals of 1,152 actions and 288 updates. Thirty complete episodes ran in about 615 seconds of real time, with no interface recoveries. Internal parameters continued changing and the run completed. I kept new and cumulative counts separate, saved both weights and optimizer state, and next evaluated the initial and trained policies without further learning.","title_zh":"从保存权重和优化器状态继续","id":"step-083","summary_en":"Continuation restored both weights and optimizer memory and completed more learning. I then evaluated behaviour without updating the model.","summary_zh":"续训同时恢复了权重和优化器历史，并完成更多学习。我随后固定模型评估行为。"},{"title_en":"A PowerShell warning handler interrupted evaluation","zh":"训练已完成，第一次后续评估却被启动方式中断。PowerShell把标准错误合并送入Tee-Object，在终止式错误处理下把PyTorch的CSR警告当成失败，Python因此停止。完整训练检查点没有受影响。后续核对精确拥有的模拟器进程已退出，时间倍率原字节恢复，但没有观测到最终静止，不能把强制退出写成成功制动。修复改为隐藏启动、标准输出和错误分别存文件，另开新评估，旧失败记录不覆盖。","en":"After training completed, its first evaluation was interrupted by the launcher. PowerShell combined standard error with the Tee-Object pipeline under terminating-error handling, causing a PyTorch sparse-matrix warning to abort Python. The completed checkpoint was unaffected. Later process checks confirmed that the simulator had exited and the original time-scale file was restored. No final vehicle-data packet confirmed stationarity. I kept the interrupted evaluation and changed to a hidden process launch with separate standard-output and error files before running a fresh evaluation.","title_zh":"训练后的评估被启动器的警告处理打断","id":"step-084","summary_en":"A launcher treated a library warning as a fatal error and interrupted evaluation. The completed checkpoint was intact; I changed the launcher and evaluated again.","summary_zh":"启动器把库警告当作致命错误，打断了评估。已完成的检查点完好，我修改启动方式后重新评估。"},{"title_en":"The trained controller lasted slightly longer, then left the route band","zh":"新评估四个案例完整运行。初始策略两例24、25动作，最终策略28、27动作，分别约5.6和5.4秒，全部在允许的路线距离范围结束。最终均值转向约+0.423，两例都只向正侧输出；多两到四个动作不是可靠驾驶。记录还显示，叫“左”“右”的初始化脉冲并没有保证第一观测需要相反纠正，实际姿态必须另看。最后有效进度与没有终点投影的终止记录也分开。于是下一步用固定权重、相同初始状态的输入干预，问这条计算链到底对什么敏感。","en":"The fresh evaluation completed all four cases. Initial policies lasted 24 and 25 actions; final policies lasted 28 and 27, or about 5.6 and 5.4 seconds. All reached the route-distance stopping limit. Final mean steering was about +0.423, and both final drives used only positive commands. The gain was therefore only two to four actions. The initial “left” and “right” pulses did not guarantee opposite required corrections in the first observations, so the measured starting poses mattered. I also kept last valid progress separate from the unavailable terminal projection. I next held weights and starting states fixed and changed the inputs to measure their effect on the calculation.","title_zh":"训练后稍微多开了一段，仍离开允许路线范围","id":"step-085","summary_en":"The trained model survived only a few actions longer and retained one-sided steering. I next changed inputs while holding the model fixed.","summary_zh":"训练后只多开了几个动作，仍保持单向转向。我接着固定模型，改变输入来检查响应。"},{"title_en":"Self-generated activity dominated the visual response","zh":"输入诊断让模型从同一状态重放合成左右亮图和已有左右记录，不让车再次运行。合成图像在注入端产生0.431的RMS差，到下行神经元读出只有约2.13×10⁻⁵，转向差约5.95×10⁻⁵。更直接的是，零外部注入仍给+0.42373转向，和有合成图的+0.42482很接近；强制下行神经元读出为零则降到+0.04453。模型有活跃计算，却有很强的共同自主背景。既然随便放大可能把背景一起放大，下一步改为让同一个核心同时推进有输入和无外部输入两份状态，再减去共同轨迹。这个改变进入C3。","en":"Without running a car, I replayed synthetic left/right brightness patterns and saved sequences from matching states. The synthetic difference had input-injection RMS amplitude 0.431, but the descending-readout difference was only about 2.13 × 10⁻⁵ and the steering difference about 5.95 × 10⁻⁵. Zero external injection still produced steering +0.42373, close to +0.42482 with the synthetic image. Forcing the descending readout to zero reduced steering to +0.04453. A common internally generated trajectory dominated the measured visual differences. Increasing gain could have amplified that background too. C3 therefore added a parallel no-input state and subtracted its descending output from the input-driven output.","title_zh":"C2为什么像恒定右转：输入差异远小于核心背景输出","id":"step-086","summary_en":"The model produced almost the same steering with no input. I added a parallel no-input calculation to separate image-related activity from that background.","summary_zh":"模型在无输入时也产生了几乎相同的转向。我增加同步无输入计算，把图像相关变化与自身背景活动分开。"},{"title_en":"A paired no-input state removed shared background activity","zh":"C3的无输入参考不是把原状态清零，也不是另一个网络。每个环境有两份数值状态，共用同一组当前连接和偏置：信号分支把64个图像值和四项辅助量共同经过可学68到3324全连接层、tanh，注入3324个R1–R6细胞，参考分支不接外部注入。两份状态都在四轮计算中推进，下行神经元读出相减，再归一化后给动作头。它针对前轮测到的自主背景，让动作头更容易看到由输入造成的差异；偏置本身仍可训练，两条梯度也都保留。先在Desktop做源码匹配的数值和求导检查，记录增加的状态与反向计算开销，合格后才新开车辆学习。图上这是一种工程测量构造，不把相减动画画成已证实的生物机制。","en":"In C3, each environment carried two recurrent states through the same connections and biases. The signal state received all 64 image values and four auxiliary cues through the learned 68-to-3,324 map and tanh into R1–R6. The reference state received no external injection. Both advanced together, and the steering head received their descending-output difference after normalization. This targeted the common background observed in C2. The reference was neither a reset of the signal state nor a separately trained network. Biases stayed trainable and gradients passed through both states. I first checked numerical results and derivatives locally, including the added state and backward-computation costs, before testing the architecture in fresh vehicle learning.","title_zh":"C3先检验无输入参考分支的数值行为","id":"step-087","summary_en":"Both calculations used the same network, but only one received the image. Their output difference became the input to the steering readout.","summary_zh":"两路计算使用同一网络，只有一路接收图像。两路输出之差随后送入转向读出。"},{"title_en":"The paired-state model trained on recorded driving experience","zh":"新架构数值检查后，C3重新训练，不把C2权重原样解释为同一实验。它保留连接图、68项带辅助观测、奖励和动作时间，新增差分归一化读出，仍没有直接辅助动作捷径。1024个有效动作形成256次更新，41个完整回合，没有接口恢复或丢弃rollout，训练和最终停止均完成。它证明两分支梯度可以在实际车辆数据上运行。接着必须固定参数看控制效果；更清楚的数值信号不会自动变成合适的驾驶动作。","en":"C3 began fresh vehicle training after the numerical checks. It retained the graph, 68-value assisted observation, reward and action timing, but used the normalized difference between signal and reference states for its readout. There was still no direct auxiliary-input shortcut to the action. The run completed 1,024 valid actions, 256 updates and 41 complete episodes, with no interface recoveries or discarded rollouts. Training and final stopping finished normally. The paired-state learning path now worked with live vehicle experience. I then held parameters fixed to test whether its behaviour had improved.","title_zh":"C3差分读出可以训练，但仍需实际驾驶验证","id":"step-088","summary_en":"The paired signal/reference architecture learned successfully from live driving. Its behavioural benefit was then tested separately.","summary_zh":"输入状态与无输入参考状态的双路结构顺利完成真实驾驶学习。行为是否改善随后单独检验。"},{"title_en":"Reference subtraction did not improve matched fixed-weight driving","zh":"固定权重比较初始和最终策略后，C3四例都在23到25动作离开保护带。初始两例约4.8、5.0秒，最终4.8、4.6秒，持续时间没有改善。末策略均值转向约+0.47，虽然范围有变化，仍是强正偏。某些最后有效进度较大，但速度和油门也变了，不能把它单独说成路线跟随变好。四例的静止和进程退出都得到核验。我保留这次失败，继续用权重固定的模型诊断输入差异，而不是再给同一PPO配置更多预算。","en":"All four initial-versus-final C3 drives reached the route-distance stopping limit after 23–25 actions. Initial durations were about 4.8 and 5 seconds; final durations were 4.8 and 4.6 seconds. The trained policy kept a strong positive steering bias, with a mean around +0.47. Some last valid progress values increased, but throttle and speed also changed, and survival did not improve. Stationary stopping and process exit passed in every case. I next examined how the fixed model responded to different inputs rather than extend the same PPO training immediately.","title_zh":"减去参考后，末策略还是过早离开路线","id":"step-089","summary_en":"Reference subtraction did not improve the matched driving tests. I next examined the remaining common steering bias.","summary_zh":"参考状态相减没有改善匹配驾驶测试。我随后检查仍然存在的共同转向偏置。"},{"title_en":"The model responded to input but kept a strong steering bias","zh":"固定C3最终权重重放不同输入，确实改变特征和动作。第16次决策，合成左、右亮图分别转0.48679和0.49574，两条真实记录约0.50036和0.49987。它不是完全没视觉响应，但差异围绕共同正偏。全部68观测为零仍转0.11528，因为可学输入层有偏置，零观测不等于零注入；强制归一化读出为零才接近0.00107。这个诊断没有开车，也没有更新参数。短PPO继续没有直接回答怎样学到纠偏，所以后面C4改用公开的几何老师转向目标，固定速度，分别测拟合和真正驾驶。","en":"The fixed C3 model did respond numerically to input changes. At decision 16, synthetic left and right brightness produced steering 0.48679 and 0.49574; two saved sequences produced about 0.50036 and 0.49987. These differences sat around a large positive bias. Setting all 68 observation values to zero still produced 0.11528 because the learned input map had a bias: a zero observation did not mean zero injection. Setting the normalized readout itself to zero produced about 0.00107. No vehicle or optimizer ran in this diagnostic. I next introduced explicit geometric steering supervision in C4, fixed throttle and assessed label fitting separately from driving.","title_zh":"差分输入不是完全无效，但变化仍围绕共同偏置","id":"step-090","summary_en":"The new path responded to images but still had a large common steering bias. I next supplied explicit steering examples for supervised learning.","summary_zh":"新路径会随图像变化，但仍带有很大的共同转向偏置。我接着提供明确转向示例，改做监督学习。"},{"title_en":"C4 used steering examples instead of extending the same PPO trial","zh":"前三轮已经验证能求梯度、能在线更新，但固定权重驾驶仍很差。C4因此改变学习信号：用明确的几何老师转向目标教同一类核心，不再只延长原PPO。物理油门固定0.05，让初末策略不因速度不同掩盖比较。六段采集实际得到354个有效动作，四段用于训练，两段整个保留做验证。标签包含正、负和近零方向，记录实际起点；相反脉冲并不产生对称车头误差。老师要求制动时，该段保留前面的转向例子后结束。这个数据集是带公开路线和姿态辅助的监督学习资料，接下来先看拟合，再看固定权重神经控制。","en":"C4 changed the learning signal after the earlier runs had established gradients and updates but poor driving. A geometric teacher supplied steering targets to the trainable core, with physical throttle fixed at 0.05. Six collected episodes produced 354 valid actions: four whole episodes for training and two for validation. Targets covered negative, near-zero and positive steering, and the starting poses were recorded. Opposite initialization pulses had not created symmetric heading errors. A segment ended when the teacher requested braking, while its earlier steering examples remained usable. I next fitted the model on these assisted examples and then tested neural driving with the resulting weights held fixed.","title_zh":"C4：先明确教转向，不再仅靠短PPO探索","id":"step-091","summary_en":"I changed from extending the same reward-learning run to supplying explicit geometric steering examples. Fitting and actual driving were tested separately.","summary_zh":"我不再只延长同一奖励学习，而是提供明确的几何转向示例。标签拟合与真实驾驶分开检验。"},{"title_en":"Supervised core learning fits both steering signs","zh":"训练读取这批既有轨迹，让连接增益、感觉注入和输出层共同学习转向。每次只对一小段16步计算梯度；前面的输入仍从局首按当前参数重算，避免改了权重却沿用旧状态。这种限制反传长度的做法就是这里使用的TBPTT。128次更新约256秒完成，最佳验证点也是第128次。验证平衡误差从0.1544降到0.0713，方向符号准确率93.6%，内部约618万边坐标改变。负目标虽然能判负，幅度仍偏小。这里先证明老师标签可以学进去，下一项才让这份权重自己驾驶，老师不接管转向。","en":"I trained connection gains, sensory injection and the steering output layer on the saved trajectories. Before each selected 16-step learning chunk, earlier inputs from the episode were replayed with the current weights. Gradients were kept only through the chunk, avoiding a hidden state left over from older weights. This was truncated backpropagation through time (TBPTT). All 128 updates completed in about 256 seconds, and validation selected update 128. Balanced validation MAE fell from 0.1544 to 0.0713, direction-sign accuracy reached 93.6%, and about 6.18 million edge coordinates changed. Negative targets had the correct sign but insufficient magnitude. I next tested these fixed weights in the car without teacher steering.","title_zh":"C4学会双符号标签，先确认这不是只学会固定顺序","id":"step-092","summary_en":"Supervised learning fitted both steering signs substantially better. I then tested the selected weights in the car without teacher steering.","summary_zh":"监督学习明显改善了两种转向符号的拟合。我随后固定选中权重，让车辆在无教师转向干预下驾驶。"},{"title_en":"Driving lasts longer after supervision, but still ends off course","zh":"固定初始和128次更新的最佳策略权重，用相同0.05油门与两种保留起点驾驶。初始只到5.2和5.6秒，学习后到14.4和13.6秒，最后有效进度也明显增加，而且两种转向都实际出现。这是真实改善，同时四条都在路线保护带处结束，没有完成路线。读旧数据还发现，单按动作序号平均的标签预测比神经策略更好：负转向集中在共同的后半段，数据没有充分区分“记住一套转向顺序”和“根据偏离纠正”。所以下一步不是手工加转向增益，而是采集学习器自己访问到的错误状态，补对应纠偏目标。","en":"I tested the initial and selected update-128 policies from two held-out initialization cases, both at throttle 0.05. Initial drives lasted 5.2 and 5.6 seconds; trained drives lasted 14.4 and 13.6 seconds. Last valid progress increased and the trained controller used both steering signs, although all four drives still reached the route-distance limit without completing the route. A saved-data check found that mean steering indexed only by action number predicted validation labels better than the neural model. Negative labels tended to occur later in a common sequence, leaving timing memorization and deviation-sensitive correction unresolved. I next collected corrective labels at states visited by the learner itself.","title_zh":"监督学习延长模拟驾驶，仍未完成路线","id":"step-093","summary_en":"Supervision extended both drives but did not complete the route. Possible reliance on action timing motivated corrective data from learner-visited states.","summary_zh":"监督学习延长了两次驾驶，但未完成路线。模型可能依赖动作顺序，因此我采集它实际访问状态上的纠偏标签。"},{"title_en":"Corrective data cover states reached by the learner","zh":"C5从C4最佳128次权重出发，把物理油门降到0.03，并在新旧固定权重评估都使用这个速度。六段采集里，较大初始化脉冲用学习器自己开车，另两段明确混合一半老师、一半学习器，验证段仍由学习器控制。共639条有效观测和老师标签，训练467条，验证172条，300个混合动作单独标记。纯学习器段会离开保护带，混合段达到150动作上限。这样补到了原策略真正走偏的状态，而不是只重复理想老师轨迹。下一步从原权重开始、使用新的Adam状态拟合这些纠偏标签。","en":"C5 started from C4's selected update-128 weights. I set throttle to 0.03 and later tested both generations at that same value. Six collection episodes used learner-only steering after larger initialization pulses; two other training episodes mixed teacher and learner actions equally. Validation episodes remained learner-controlled. The collection yielded 639 observations with teacher labels: 467 for training and 172 for validation. The 300 mixed actions were identified separately. Learner-only segments reached the route-distance limit, while mixed segments reached the 150-action horizon. This added states where the learner went wrong. The next fit reused the weights but started a fresh Adam optimizer.","title_zh":"C5把老师标签带到学习器自己走偏的位置","id":"step-094","summary_en":"Corrective collection added states reached by the learner when it went wrong, alongside separately labelled teacher-mixed actions.","summary_zh":"纠偏采集加入了学习器偏离时真正到达的状态，也单独标记了混合教师动作的数据。"},{"title_en":"The best corrective fit was at update 224; training stopped at 227","zh":"C5监督训练仍从局首按当前权重重算历史，在16步片段反传。它计划最多256次更新，实际因预留保存时间的wall预算在227次停止，最佳验证权重是224次，最终权重是227次，二者分别保存。平衡验证误差从0.5013降到0.4346。这里三个符号类别被等权处理，只有14条近零训练目标却获得三分之一目标权重，这可能影响更新波动，但还没有因果证据。误差改善不能代替驾驶结果。后面使用选定224次模型，与C4在相同0.03油门和新起点固定权重比较。","en":"C5 replayed episode histories with current weights and trained through 16-step chunks. It allowed 256 updates, but the real-time budget stopped training at 227 to leave time for saving. Validation selected update 224; the final checkpoint was update 227. Balanced validation MAE fell from 0.5013 to 0.4346. Equal weighting of the three steering-sign classes gave fourteen near-zero training labels one third of the objective. That could affect update variability, but its effect was not established by this run. I next compared the selected update-224 model with C4 in actual driving, using new initialization cases and matched throttle 0.03.","title_zh":"C5监督误差下降，但最佳与最终检查点要分开","id":"step-095","summary_en":"The corrective fit improved validation error and selected an intermediate model. I next checked whether that lower error improved driving.","summary_zh":"纠偏拟合降低验证误差，并选出中间模型。我接着检查误差降低是否带来更好驾驶。"},{"title_en":"The corrective policy regresses under matched driving conditions","zh":"同样0.03油门下，C4两例持续14.6和18.6秒，C5最佳224次权重只持续14.0和14.8秒，全部触发允许的路线范围。最后有效进度也从4.118、5.558降到3.873、4.272，C5负转向更少且更弱。两组命令起点匹配，实际位置和朝向的小差异另记。这个结果必须与标签误差改善同时讲：监督fit变好，固定权重驾驶没有变好。暂时也没有唯一的优化或生物原因。中断一段时间后，我优先把核心权重固定，只让小输出头学习，检查特征是否有纠偏信息。","en":"At throttle 0.03, C4's two drives lasted 14.6 and 18.6 seconds. C5's selected update-224 policy lasted only 14.0 and 14.8 seconds. Every case reached the route-distance limit. Last valid progress fell from 4.118 and 5.558 to 3.873 and 4.272, with fewer and weaker negative commands from C5. The requested starts matched, and small differences in measured starting pose were saved. The better supervised fit had therefore accompanied worse driving. After a pause, I held the cores fixed and trained only small output heads to test whether their features already contained useful correction information.","title_zh":"C5反而比相同速度的C4更早离开保护带","id":"step-096","summary_en":"The better-fitting corrective model drove worse under matched throttle. I held the core fixed and tested new output heads.","summary_zh":"纠偏模型拟合更好，却在相同油门下开得更差。我固定核心，单独测试新的输出读出。"},{"title_en":"Fixed neural representations supported better steering readouts","zh":"C6是一项保存数据诊断，不再采新车轨迹。分别固定C4和C5核心权重，把同639条观测按原局内顺序重放，取归一化下行神经元特征；另有原68项观测的诊断比较。每种表示都用均匀和符号平衡两种损失，共六个小头，各512次更新。C4回放重建原动作误差约6×10⁻⁸，原核心哈希不变。C5均匀头的平衡验证误差为0.0998，方向准确率98.77%，比此前共同优化明显更容易拟合。它显示当前神经读出里有可用区分，不能把问题概括成核心没信息。选定头单独保存，再与C5核心组合做真实驾驶。","en":"C6 used saved data rather than new drives. I held C4 and C5 cores fixed separately and replayed the same 639 observations in episode order to extract normalized descending features. Raw 68-value observations supplied a diagnostic comparison. Uniform and sign-balanced objectives produced six small heads, each trained for 512 updates. C4 replay reproduced collector actions within about 6 × 10⁻⁸, and core hashes stayed unchanged. The uniformly weighted C5 head reached balanced validation MAE 0.0998 and direction accuracy 98.77%. A much better steering fit was therefore possible without changing the core. I saved that head separately and combined it with the C5 core for a driving test.","title_zh":"固定核心后，小读出能否提取纠偏信息","id":"step-097","summary_en":"The fixed core's features supported a much better steering fit with a new small head. I tested that composition in driving.","summary_zh":"固定核心的特征配合新小读出，可以明显改善转向拟合。我接着测试这个组合的驾驶。"},{"title_en":"Changing only the selected readout extended both drives to thirty seconds","zh":"组合前先核对算术一致，并确认输入层、核心和未用油门行没变。C5核心加C6均匀下行神经元读出在相同0.03油门、±0.65脉冲下，两例都到150动作、30秒上限，没有触发允许的路线范围。进度约9.84，明显超过C4和C5先前失败段。实际双符号转向始终由组合策略输出，老师混合为零，参数固定。不过方向幅度接近全负、正向也很大，明显摆动依旧。它是当前最强的短时带路线辅助控制，不是一次重新训练核心的改善。下一步先不改参数，延长时间并增加起点，看看优势能保持多久。","en":"I verified the composed model and confirmed that its input map, core and unused throttle row were unchanged. The C5 core with the C6 uniformly fitted descending-neuron head completed 150 actions and 30 seconds in both matched cases at throttle 0.03, without route-distance termination. Progress reached about 9.84, beyond the earlier C4 and C5 failure sections. The model supplied both steering signs, with no teacher mixing or parameter updates. Commands sometimes approached full negative steering and also included large positive values, so oscillation remained clear. Selecting a new output head had improved this short assisted test. I next extended the unchanged controller's duration and starting conditions.","title_zh":"只重新学读出后，两次驾驶都到30秒，但转向明显摆动","id":"step-098","summary_en":"Changing only the selected output head extended both drives to the short horizon, although strong oscillation remained.","summary_zh":"只换选中的输出读出，两次驾驶都达到短时上限，但明显摆动仍在。"},{"title_en":"The assisted policy reached five ninety-second limits","zh":"C7不训练，保持C5核心加C6头的完整参数，重复原两脉冲再加零和±0.90，共五种起点。每例450动作、约90秒，五例都到上限，没有无效间隔或老师动作。路线进度约31.06到31.41，相当于42.929单位开放路线的72%到73%，route_finished全部为假。转向每局在近零带外翻向39到46次，并接近正负极值。这个记录扩展了多弯和长时跟随的证据，却仍有摆动，也没有足够时间看路线末端。依据后段速度估算，走完约需123秒，因此C8只把本轮独立环境上限明确延到150秒，其余不变。","en":"C7 kept the complete C5-core/C6-head model fixed and added zero and ±0.90 initialization pulses to the previous two starts, giving five cases. Every case reached 450 actions and approximately 90 seconds, with no invalid intervals or teacher actions. Progress ranged from 31.06 to 31.41, about 72–73% of the 42.929-unit open route; no case reached the end. Steering changed sign outside the near-zero band 39–46 times per case and approached both extremes. The policy could follow multiple bends for longer, but still oscillated. Late-run speed suggested about 123 seconds to traverse the route, so C8 extended its driving horizon to 150 seconds.","title_zh":"C7：同一策略到90秒，仍没走完整路线","id":"step-099","summary_en":"The unchanged assisted controller passed several bends in longer drives but had not reached the endpoint. I extended its time limit.","summary_zh":"未改的辅助控制器在长时驾驶中通过多处弯道，却尚未到达终点。我继续延长时限。"},{"title_en":"Five repeated starts reached the exported open-route endpoint","zh":"这时64个灰度值和四项路线/车辆辅助量仍共同经过68到3324的可学习全连接映射、tanh，送入3324个R1–R6细胞；本轮映射权重固定。C8的改变很窄：沿用同一固定权重策略、同五起点、同0.03油门，把内部120秒限制明确延长到150秒。最终五例分别609到612动作、约121.8到122.4秒，全到导出开放路线末端。这个结论还用连续局部弧长、最后第257段和端点余量独立核对，不只信一个完成标记。平均路线距离约0.071到0.073，最大约0.21；老师动作和新更新都是零。这里可以完整展示真实路线完成，也要保留显著转向摆动和公开的路线辅助。下一步不先庆祝分辨率，而是在这些保存记录上干预图像与辅助量，查哪些输入实际影响动作。","en":"C8 retained the same fixed model, five starts and throttle 0.03, extending the environment horizon from 120 to 150 seconds. Its 64 grayscale values and four route/vehicle cues still passed through the learned 68-to-3,324 map and tanh into 3,324 R1–R6 cells. All five cases reached the open-route endpoint after 609–612 actions, or about 121.8–122.4 seconds. Separate checks confirmed continuous local progress, final segment 257 and the endpoint margin. Mean route distance was about 0.071–0.073, with maxima near 0.21. No teacher actions or new updates occurred. This was route completion with declared auxiliary inputs and visible steering oscillation. I next changed saved inputs to examine what influenced the action.","title_zh":"C8：有路线辅助的固定权重策略五次到达导出路线末端","id":"step-100","summary_en":"All five assisted starts reached the open-route endpoint with the same fixed model. I next tested the roles of camera and auxiliary inputs using saved sequences.","summary_zh":"同一固定模型从五个辅助起点都到达开放路线末端。我接着用保存序列分别改变相机和辅助输入。"},{"title_en":"Changing saved inputs tested visual dependence without running alternative drives","zh":"C9从C8的3056个真实动作历史重放，原动作复现误差小于预先容差。每局五个锚点复制同一对循环状态，再各自运行固定画面、水平镜像、车头误差、横向误差和速度改动，共200分支、3200行。仅镜像图像，第一步平均绝对转向差约0.0525；往后15步约0.5526，保持画面不变也改变后续动作。相机差异确实经过注入、下行神经元差值和归一化传到转向。但这些分支继续读取原来未来画面，车没有随改后命令重新走，所以是保存输入干预，不是反事实驾驶视频。辅助量改动尺度也不同，不能算视觉贡献百分比。接下来查看原图压成8×8到底丢了什么。","en":"C9 replayed all 3,056 saved C8 action histories and reproduced the original actions within tolerance. At five points in each episode, I copied the same paired recurrent state and changed one input: held camera image, horizontal mirror, heading, lateral error or speed. The 200 branches produced 3,200 rows. Mirroring only the image changed immediate steering by mean absolute 0.0525; the difference grew to about 0.5526 over the next fifteen saved decisions. Holding the image also changed later actions. Thus the image affected the complete input-to-steering calculation. The branches still used the original future images, not new drives under changed commands. Different auxiliary perturbation sizes also prevented contribution percentages. I next examined the coarse 8×8 input itself.","title_zh":"C9：8×8图像和辅助路线线索各自会改变输出吗","id":"step-101","summary_en":"Changing the saved image changed steering immediately and over later decisions. These tests showed input dependence, without generating new alternative driving trajectories.","summary_zh":"改变保存图像会立即改变转向，也会影响后续决策。这些测试显示输入作用，但没有产生改变命令后的新驾驶轨迹。"},{"title_en":"Image compression and eye-column coverage were separate choices","zh":"我从C8原始字节流恢复12张160×120图像，按时间和哈希对应，再重新计算历史8×8观测，数值匹配。把原图、8×8和32×24并排，可以直接看见低分辨率怎样丢掉车道边缘与标记细节。这是已有图像分析，没有运行新驾驶策略。8×8最初是工程简化，并不是已证明的生物或算力上限。进一步审计模型眼柱发现，3324个R1到R6输入细胞只占819列，在前方可见817列中只有216列含这些输入。提高像素数还不够，必须决定亮度送到哪些真实模型位置。于是C10保留原图，直接采817可见方向，并明确补充到L1/L2。","en":"I recovered twelve original 160×120 C8 images from the saved message stream, matched their times and hashes, and reproduced the historical 8×8 observations. Comparing originals, 8×8 and 32×24 versions showed lost lane-edge and marking detail. A separate annotation audit found that the 3,324 selected R1–R6 cells occupied only 819 model columns, with just 216 of the 817 visible front columns containing those cells. Image resolution and cell coverage were therefore separate problems. C10 used the original images, sampled all 817 visible directions and supplied the wider input through L1/L2. This step analysed existing images; it did not test a new driving policy.","title_zh":"8×8只是工程简化；保留原相机再对齐真实模型方向","id":"step-102","summary_en":"Saved images showed what the coarse grid lost, while cell annotations exposed a separate coverage gap. The next input used spatial samples and L1/L2 cells.","summary_zh":"原图展示了粗网格丢失的细节，细胞注释则暴露了另一个覆盖缺口。下一种输入采用空间采样和 L1/L2 细胞。"},{"title_en":"Recover the saved camera images before changing visual input","zh":"C10先做数据准备，不另采新驾驶来混淆变化。此前C5保存的相机原始流恢复出639张不同JPEG，整局训练和验证划分保持原样。重新生成旧8×8值的最大差约3×10⁻⁸，确认这批原图确实对应旧输入。646个导出文件逐项核验后，才把这些图像按817个实际可见方向采样。这样新输入不是把8×8放大，也不是借用其他案例的画面；它来自当初同一批观测。接着从C5核心和C6读出建立新的空间适配器试验。","en":"Before changing the input path, I recovered 639 distinct original JPEGs from the C5 camera stream, retaining the whole-episode training/validation split. Recreated 8×8 observations differed from the historical values by at most about 3 × 10⁻⁸. I verified all 646 exported files before sampling their images along 817 visible model directions. This reused the original trajectories rather than collect new drives or enlarge the old coarse grid. The next pilot started with the C5 core and C6 head, adding a new spatial input adapter.","title_zh":"C10先从旧C5数据恢复真实原图，保持整段划分","id":"step-103","summary_en":"I recovered the original training images so the input change could use the same trajectories and data split.","summary_zh":"我恢复原训练图像，让新的输入方式继续使用同一批轨迹和训练、验证划分。"},{"title_en":"Map visible eye-column brightness directly to L1 and L2","zh":"C10每次从原图提取817个0到1亮度，按眼柱映射送到L1/L2目标。选择它们的具体理由是R1到R6在当前前视缺很多列，而L1/L2可为全部可见列提供声明的工程入口；这不是重建完整生物视网膜。四个路线或速度辅助量仍经独立分支存在。256次监督更新约442秒，内部边、神经元参数和输入层都改变，但转移来的动作头几乎负向饱和，验证误差只从1.1793变1.1415。更细输入能运算并不保证旧头兼容。下一步因此保留新核心与输入不变，只训练新的小输出头，而不是将此误差直接说成817输入没有信息。","en":"C10 sampled 817 brightness values between 0 and 1 from each original image and mapped them to L1/L2 cells. I chose those targets because their annotations covered all visible columns, whereas R1–R6 cells were absent from many. Four route or speed cues remained in a separate disclosed input branch. The pilot completed 256 supervised updates in about 442 seconds, changing connection gains, neuron parameters and input mapping. The transferred action head stayed strongly saturated toward negative steering, and validation MAE improved only from 1.1793 to 1.1415. The new representation needed a new readout. I held the revised core and input fixed and fitted a small replacement output head.","title_zh":"C10：用817个方向把可见亮度直接送到L1/L2","id":"step-104","summary_en":"Spatial sampling covered visible columns through L1/L2, but the old action head saturated. I kept the new representation and refitted the head.","summary_zh":"空间采样通过L1/L2覆盖了可见眼柱，但原动作读出饱和。我保留新表征，重新拟合读出。"},{"title_en":"A new readout learned the new spatial representation","zh":"独立读出校准把C10核心、空间输入和辅助分支的权重固定，先提取神经特征，再训练新头512次，验证选择第480次。误差从1.1415降到0.1220，训练均值常数为0.5921，定义好的非零标签子集方向准确率95.1%。安装时核对所有非头参数未变。这一步清楚区分256次核心训练与512次外部头训练，不能把它们说成同一批新驾驶经验。组合检查点SHA以5e837开头，后来C11、C14与C15的谱系都必须追到这个具体C10表示。下一步先固定组合模型的权重，做两次真实30秒驾驶。","en":"With C10's core, spatial input and auxiliary branch fixed, I extracted features and trained a new head for 512 updates. Validation selected update 480. MAE fell from 1.1415 to 0.1220, compared with 0.5921 for a constant predictor based on the training mean. Direction accuracy was 95.1% on the defined nonzero-target subset. Installation checks confirmed unchanged parameters outside the head. These 512 head updates were separate from the earlier 256 core updates and used no new driving collection. The composed checkpoint hash began 5e837. C11 and the later C14/C15 studies started from this C10 representation. I next tested it in two 30-second drives with weights fixed.","title_zh":"单独拟合新读出，适应改变后的空间输入","id":"step-105","summary_en":"A new head fitted the spatial representation much better while the core stayed fixed. I then checked the composed controller in driving.","summary_zh":"固定核心后，新读出对空间表征的拟合明显改善。我随后直接检查组合控制器的驾驶。"},{"title_en":"Spatial input enabled driving but increased oscillation","zh":"组合C10自己驾驶两例，各150动作、30秒，没有老师动作或直接绕路，参数不变。两种转向都出现，说明817路径和动作链可以运行。但相对C6，同样起点与0.03油门，平均路线距离从约0.043、0.046变成0.118、0.121，最大距离接近0.5工程界限，动作摆动也更大，进度略低。输入、核心和头都改变，因此不能只归因于分辨率。旧C6/C8完整路线辅助基线继续保留。之后C11单独从C10出发关辅助做可训练核心PPO；另一条后来主线则回到C10固定权重核心，让C14重新学习纯视觉外部读出。","en":"The composed C10 model completed 150 actions and 30 seconds in both cases, with no teacher steering, direct shortcut or parameter updates. Both steering signs occurred, showing that the 817-sample control path worked. At matched throttle 0.03 and reused starts, however, mean route distance increased from about 0.043 and 0.046 with C6 to 0.118 and 0.121 with C10. Maxima approached the 0.5 limit, oscillation increased and progress was slightly lower. The input map, core and head had all changed, so this did not isolate image resolution as the cause. I kept the stronger C6/C8 assisted baseline. C11 then formed a separate camera-only PPO branch; the later main line returned to C10 for new C14 heads.","title_zh":"C10两次到30秒，却比旧辅助策略摆得更大","id":"step-106","summary_en":"The spatial-input controller drove, but deviated and oscillated more than the older assisted baseline. C11 and the later main line then took separate paths.","summary_zh":"空间输入控制器能开车，但偏离和摆动比旧辅助基线更大。随后C11与后来的主线分别展开。"},{"title_en":"C11 separately tested camera-only learning inside the core","zh":"C11明确关掉四个辅助输入，辅助注入权重置零并保持不变。运行时只有817相机采样和循环历史进入动作计算，路线几何只在外部算奖励与评估；油门固定0.03，PPO只学一个转向动作。它从已有辅助训练历史的C10组合权重开始，但本轮是纯相机运行。实际1024个新状态转移、128次更新、29个完整离路线回合，样本复用两轮共2048次，没有无效间隔或丢弃。内部约618万边坐标改变，每次当前参数重算历史的概率校验通过。这是一条独立内部学习分支。它的最终权重没有成为后续C14/C15主策略祖先，接着先看它自己的固定权重的初末比较。","en":"C11 started from the C10 model but set all four auxiliary values to zero and also zeroed and fixed the assistance-injection weights. Only 817 camera samples and recurrent history entered action selection. Route geometry remained outside the policy, supplying reward and evaluation. Throttle was fixed at 0.03, and PPO learned steering. The run completed 1,024 new transitions, 128 updates and 29 complete route-departure episodes. Two training passes produced 2,048 sample uses, with no invalid intervals or discarded rollouts. About 6.18 million edge coordinates changed, and history-based action-probability checks passed. I evaluated C11's own initial and final policies next; its trained core was not inherited by the later C14/C15 main line.","title_zh":"C11独立分支：关掉路线辅助，第一次让视觉核心在线PPO学习","id":"step-107","summary_en":"C11 removed route hints and trained the core from camera-only experience. Its final weights stayed a separate branch from C14/C15.","summary_zh":"C11撤去路线提示，用纯视觉驾驶经验训练核心。最终权重保留为独立分支，没有传入C14/C15。"},{"title_en":"C11 learned internally but did not improve driving","zh":"同样两脉冲的固定权重比较里，初始策略持续6.8和7.8秒，最终策略6.2和7.0秒，最后有效进度也下降，四例全部触发路线保护。训练时随机探索两个转向都有，最终确定性策略却只给负向，约−0.1225到−0.0227。这个差别应在回放中直观看见，不能选训练里一个好瞬间当最终表现。C11证明相机在线经验确实更新核心，没有在这次小样本中改善控制。原因没有唯一诊断。后面探索保存图像预测和信息读出时，仍回到C10表示做新的独立对照，不把C11末权重悄悄接成主线。","en":"The matched C11 comparison used fixed weights. Initial policies lasted 6.8 and 7.8 seconds; final policies lasted 6.2 and 7 seconds. Last valid progress also fell, and all four drives reached the route-distance stopping limit. Stochastic training had used both steering signs, but the final deterministic policy used only negative steering, approximately −0.1225 to −0.0227. The run established that online camera experience could update internal parameters, without improving driving at this budget. The following saved-image prediction and readout studies returned to C10 for their separate comparisons rather than continue from C11's final core.","title_zh":"C11完成内部学习，但驾驶没有改善","id":"step-108","summary_en":"C11 updated internal parameters but its final deterministic drives were shorter. The next comparisons returned to the C10 representation.","summary_zh":"C11确实更新内部参数，但最终确定性驾驶更短。后续比较重新使用C10表征。"},{"title_en":"The first visual-prediction test failed while loading dependencies","zh":"C12第一启动0.216秒就因找不到Torch退出，没有构造模型、训练或车辆。新入口误把依赖包当成直接位于工具目录，实际在锁版本的子目录。修复改用已经核验过的统一运行时加载器，原试验参数不动，旧失败文件也保留。第二次另开空目录执行同一个预测对照。这个小失败说明依赖准备和科学结果必须分开，不能把启动失败算作一个预测负结果。","en":"The first C12 launch stopped after 0.216 seconds because it could not find Torch. Its entry point expected packages directly in a tools directory, but the installed runtime used a subdirectory identified by the dependency-lock version. No model was constructed, and no learning or vehicle operation occurred. I reused the verified runtime loader, kept the scientific settings unchanged, saved the failure and launched the comparison in a new directory.","title_zh":"预测测试在依赖加载阶段停止","id":"step-109","summary_en":"The prediction test stopped because its entry point could not find Torch. I fixed dependency loading before running the comparison.","summary_zh":"预测测试因入口找不到 Torch 而停止。我先修正依赖加载，再运行比较。"},{"title_en":"The limited prediction trial did not beat repeating the last image","zh":"C12比较同一起点的固定权重核心与可训练核心，都只读已有639张原相机图派生的817采样，不开模拟器，不使用老师转向或路线输入。各臂64次更新，495次重复相邻对呈现来自463个独立训练对；验证有170对。138秒后，可训练条件651万余参数元素改变，固定权重条件没变，但验证MAE几乎相同：0.043653对0.043651。直接把当前帧复制成下一帧反而为0.031857。它没有建立这个一步预测任务的实用优势，也没有测驾驶。下一步不立即扩大同配置，先固定C10权重，比较视觉神经元、下行神经元读出和直接图像控制里还能读出什么信息。","en":"C12 compared fixed and trainable C10 cores from the same starting point, using 817 samples from saved camera images. It ran no simulator and used neither steering labels nor route inputs. Each condition completed 64 updates and 495 adjacent-pair presentations, drawn from 463 unique training pairs, with 170 validation pairs. In about 138 seconds, more than 6.51 million parameter elements changed in the trainable condition and none in the fixed condition. Validation MAEs were almost identical, 0.043653 and 0.043651; copying the current image as the next prediction performed better, at 0.031857. I next examined information at different C10 readouts before expanding this prediction approach.","title_zh":"C12：训练核心预测下一帧，并没有胜过复制当前帧","id":"step-110","summary_en":"Learning to predict the next saved image did not beat simply repeating the current image. I next inspected different neural readouts.","summary_zh":"学习预测下一张保存图像没有胜过直接重复当前图像。我随后检查不同神经读出中的信息。"},{"title_en":"Both tested neural readouts carry visual information","zh":"C13用相同C10核心、关闭辅助，对639个原观测重放。下行神经元和T4/T5各取1314项，另有原视网膜、动作加时长两个诊断对照。八个相同容量小头各更新256次，分别学当前画面重建或下一帧变化。当前画面的验证误差，T4/T5为0.08134，DN为0.09539，都比动作控制与训练均值好；把图像固定为第一帧后误差升高，说明读出确有相机依赖信息。下一帧指标则混合，神经改善很小，直接相机RMSE改善却MAE变差。较早读出更会重建不代表更会开车，因此C14在真实相机在线PPO中用相同预算比较DN和T4/T5。","en":"C13 replayed the same 639 observations through the unchanged C10 core with assistance disabled. It compared 1,314-value DN and T4/T5 readouts with raw-image and action-plus-duration controls. Eight equal-capacity diagnostic heads received 256 updates each, predicting either the current scene or the next-frame change. Current-scene validation MAE was 0.08134 for T4/T5 and 0.09539 for DN, better than action-only and mean-scene controls. Repeating only the first image increased neural errors, showing that both readouts carried camera-dependent information. Next-frame results were mixed: neural gains were tiny, while raw-image RMSE improved and MAE worsened. C14 next compared the two neural readouts in live camera-only PPO with matched interaction budgets.","title_zh":"C13：视觉和DN都保留可解码图像信息，预测收益仍很弱","id":"step-111","summary_en":"Both DN and T4/T5 features carried camera-dependent scene information. I next compared their ability to steer during online learning.","summary_zh":"DN与T4/T5特征都包含随相机变化的场景信息。我接着在在线学习中比较它们的转向能力。"},{"title_en":"The main line returned to C10 for a new DN readout","zh":"C14的继承关系要从文件核对：两个条件都恢复同一份5e837开头的C10核心和输入映射，权重全部固定；没有使用C11最终核心。下行神经元条件重新初始化1314到64的动作与价值头，与T4/T5臂的初始头一致。输入817相机值，四辅助量零，只有外部头做PPO。它完成1024个新状态转移、128次头更新、27个普通离路线回合。固定权重的初末两起点测试从6.8/7.8秒到7.4/8.8秒，仍全部离开包络，末策略正向偏置。这个短比较没有可靠驾驶，但这份DN头和Adam被明确保存，SHA以4add01开头，之后C15沿此续学。","en":"Both C14 conditions loaded the same C10 core and input map, hash beginning 5e837, and kept them fixed. Neither used C11's final core. The DN condition started fresh 1,314-to-64 action and value heads, initially identical to those in the T4/T5 condition. Inputs were 817 camera values and four auxiliary zeros; PPO updated only the external heads. It completed 1,024 new transitions, 128 head updates and 27 route-departure episodes. With weights fixed for evaluation, durations changed from 6.8/7.8 seconds to 7.4/8.8 seconds. Every case still departed, with a positive steering bias. The DN head and its Adam state were saved under hash beginning 4add01, and C15 continued that exact state.","title_zh":"主线回到C10核心，新建下行神经元读出","id":"step-112","summary_en":"The DN condition trained a fresh head on the unchanged C10 core. Its saved head and optimizer became C15's actual starting point.","summary_zh":"DN条件在未改C10核心上训练新读出。保存的读出与优化器才是C15的实际起点。"},{"title_en":"Earlier visual neurons did not improve this short driving comparison","zh":"T4/T5臂只把读出位置换到较早视觉群，宽度仍1314，使用同初始头、种子、奖励、相机、起点和训练量。它也收1024个新状态转移、做128次更新，26个完整离路线回合。初始两例6.8和7.8秒，最终7.0和8.0秒，仍全部离开包络，表现没有超过这一次DN臂。两个条件上游参数都未改变，所以它测试读出位置，不是内部核心学习。读取视觉群也绕过下游生物运动电路，作为工程控制器明确说明。基于这次有限发展性结果，下一轮选择DN头继续增加经验，不把DN一般优越当既定结论。","en":"The other C14 condition read T4/T5 instead of DNs, retaining 1,314 features and matching initial heads, seed, reward, camera, starts and interaction budget. It collected 1,024 new transitions and completed 128 updates, with 26 route-departure episodes. Initial evaluation durations were 6.8 and 7.8 seconds; final durations were 7 and 8 seconds, with all cases reaching the route-distance limit. It did not beat the DN condition in this short comparison. Because upstream parameters stayed fixed, the test concerned readout location rather than core learning. I chose the DN head for the next continuation; this result did not establish a general ranking of the two populations.","title_zh":"读取早期视觉神经元没有赢得短时驾驶比较","id":"step-113","summary_en":"Reading T4/T5 did not outperform the matched DN condition in this short trial. I chose the DN head for continuation.","summary_zh":"在这次短时匹配测试中，读取T4/T5没有胜过DN条件。我选用DN读出继续训练。"},{"title_en":"Continue the same C14 DN readout and optimizer for longer","zh":"C15准确恢复C14下行神经元读出和完整Adam历史，继续用权重固定的C10核心。重新开始车辆和循环状态，不假称接续父轮同一物理轨迹。它同时改变经验预算与更新配方：每收128步，分64样本小批，重复四轮，最多8192个新动作。实际8192条全部优化，512次新更新，128个完整训练回合，没有恢复、丢弃或训练错误，约4136秒。这里每条新样本被重复使用四次，与新增经验数分开。0、2048、4096、8192新步都存检查点并固定权重评估。后来的主线来自这条C10表示加C14/C15读出训练关系，而不是C11末核心。","en":"C15 restored C14's exact DN head and saved optimizer state while keeping the C10 core fixed. The vehicle and recurrent state restarted. The new recipe collected batches of 128 steps, formed 64-sample minibatches and reused each sample over four passes, with a target of 8,192 new actions. All 8,192 were optimized, giving 512 new updates and 128 complete episodes in about 4,136 seconds. There were no interface recoveries, discarded rollouts or training errors. Checkpoints at 0, 2,048, 4,096 and 8,192 new steps received fixed-weight evaluations. Repeated sample uses were counted separately from new experience. This C10-core/C14–C15-head sequence, rather than C11's trained core, became the later main-policy ancestry.","title_zh":"C15：续C14的DN读出，更长训练先改善又退步","id":"step-114","summary_en":"C15 continued the exact C14 head and optimizer with more experience and repeated updates, keeping the C10 core fixed.","summary_zh":"C15沿用C14的确切读出与优化器，增加经验并重复更新，C10核心保持不变。"},{"title_en":"The selected intermediate checkpoint drove better than the final one","zh":"C15的完整曲线比只给最终成绩更有解释力。四个检查点各用五种已声明起点，全部20次固定权重评估都完成。平均驾驶时长依次8.16、15.96、19.32和10.90秒。4096新步时每例都用双向转向，8192步仍有四例双向，但所有评估都最终离开允许的路线范围。4096到8192，持续时间降43.58%，记录进度降51.74%，所以“训练更久就更好”在此不成立。5760到6016附近较大更新支持稳定性假设，却没有确定因果；探索也没有崩成单向。最佳中途点和最终退步都保留，后面才研究并行、效率与更新稳定性。","en":"All twenty C15 evaluations completed: four checkpoints, each with five starts. Mean duration rose from 8.16 to 15.96 to 19.32 seconds, then fell to 10.90 seconds. At 4,096 new steps all five cases used both steering signs; at 8,192, four did. Every case eventually reached the route-distance stopping limit. Between 4,096 and 8,192, duration fell by 43.58% and progress by 51.74%. Larger updates around steps 5,760–6,016 suggested update stability as a question for later work, while the saved exploration measure had not collapsed. The records did not establish a single cause of regression. I kept the strongest intermediate checkpoint as well as the final one before addressing parallelism, efficiency and stability.","title_zh":"中间检查点最好，最终版本退化","id":"step-115","summary_en":"An intermediate C15 checkpoint was strongest; further training reduced driving performance. I retained both the gain and the later regression.","summary_zh":"C15的中间检查点最好，继续训练反而降低驾驶表现。我同时保留改善与后续退化。"},{"title_zh":"先让同一模型在Roihu上使用正确的计算环境","title_en":"First, make the same model run in the right environment","zh":"这时模型和读出已经在Windows上运行过，但Roihu现有的x86计算包是CPU版。给作业分配GPU，并不会自动改变软件。我先准备同版CUDA计算环境。第一次安装器要求应用目录有24 GiB空间，而那里整个文件系统只有15 GiB，所以立即停止。随后把临时下载放到scratch，又依次修正NVIDIA下载来源和三个辅助包缺少哈希的问题。最终27个安装包都核验通过。这些是安装准备，下一步才用保存的真实输入检查两台机器算得是否一致。","en":"The model and readout already ran on Windows, but Roihu's existing x86 package was a CPU build. I first prepared matching CUDA software. The initial installer demanded 24 GiB in an application filesystem whose entire capacity was 15 GiB and stopped. I moved temporary downloads to scratch storage, corrected the NVIDIA download allowlist and supplied missing hashes for three auxiliary packages. All 27 packages were eventually verified. With that environment available, I next replayed saved inputs on the GPU to check whether the calculation agreed after migration.","sequence_zh":["初始APP24GiB守卫拒绝，未创建工作区/下载包。","scratch-aware版本24.791s完成解析，来源allowlist拒绝，未安装。","r2暴露三wheel缺hash。","r3精确版本hash核验后安装。"],"sequence_en":["The original 24-GiB application-space guard refused before workspace creation or downloads.","The scratch-aware version resolved dependencies but rejected the NVIDIA download source before installation.","The next revision exposed missing hash metadata for three auxiliary wheels.","The final revision verified exact-version hashes and completed installation."],"id":"step-116","summary_en":"Roihu's installed package could not use the GPU. I prepared and checked the matching CUDA environment before testing the migrated model.","summary_zh":"Roihu 已装的软件包不能使用 GPU。我先准备并核对匹配的 CUDA 环境，再测试迁移后的模型。"},{"title_zh":"容器里的Python路径与主机不一样","title_en":"The Python path inside the container was different","zh":"安装完成后，提交准备又在解释器身份检查处停下。原因是程序只认识通用路径，没有认识CSC容器里实际使用的Python文件。它在预算操作和提交作业之前就拒绝了。修正版明确核验实际解释器路径和文件哈希，保留原失败记录。模型公式和检查点没有因此改变。之后才进入GPU上的数值迁移检查。","en":"Submission preparation then stopped at an interpreter-identity check. It recognised a generic Python path but not the executable exposed inside CSC's container. The failure occurred before any budget change or job submission. I bound the check to the observed executable path and hash, leaving the equations and saved checkpoint unchanged. The next allocated GPU test could then check the numerical migration.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-117","summary_en":"The container exposed Python at a different path from the one the check expected. I corrected that identity check without changing the model.","summary_zh":"容器中的 Python 路径与检查程序预期不同。我修正身份检查，没有改变模型。"},{"title_zh":"同一批保存输入在Linux上能否得到相同转向","title_en":"Would the same recorded inputs produce the same steering?","zh":"先不让车重新开，也不更新权重。我把四段C15已保存的输入，从各段开头的零循环状态依次送入Linux模型。这是在检查迁移有没有改变计算含义。两个读出检查点共237个观测全部通过既定误差范围，最大转向差约为一千万分之一。作业只用了10秒。这证明这批输入的Linux计算与原结果吻合。它还没有回答完整相机、车辆和学习程序一起运行时能有多快，所以下一步测完整工作进程。","en":"I replayed four saved C15 input sequences on Linux without driving or updating weights. Every sequence began with a zero recurrent state. Across two readout checkpoints, all 237 observations passed the required tolerance; the largest steering difference was about one ten-millionth. The allocation lasted ten seconds. These sequences supported numerical agreement after migration. I next tested the complete camera, vehicle and learner loop, including its throughput rather than just saved-input arithmetic.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-118","summary_en":"The same saved inputs produced matching steering after migration to Linux. I could next test the full simulator-and-learner loop.","summary_zh":"迁到 Linux 后，同一批保存输入得到了匹配的转向。接下来才测试完整的模拟器和学习器循环。"},{"title_zh":"第一个完整工作进程在身份检查处失败","title_en":"The first complete worker failed its process-identity check","zh":"数值一致后，我准备比较一个、两个和四个完整工作进程。这里每个进程都有自己的车和独立学习器。第一组还没收集训练数据，就因为没有权限读取渲染进程的可执行文件而退出；清理也遇到了同样的问题。归档里另有一个渲染日志的实际大小与清单不符。因此这次既没有吞吐结果，也没有完整清理通过的证据。下一版把这项可执行文件信息改为可选，同时保留其他进程身份检查，并统一归档与哈希读取的字节快照。","en":"After the numerical check, I planned one-, two- and four-worker tests, with an independent car and learner in each worker. The first test stopped before collecting data because it could not inspect the renderer's executable path. Cleanup hit the same permissions problem, and a renderer log did not match its declared archive size. The attempt produced neither a throughput result nor verified complete cleanup. I made that executable metadata optional while keeping the other process-identity checks, and used one byte snapshot for both archive content and its hash.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-119","summary_en":"The first parallel test stopped because it could not inspect the renderer process. I repaired process verification and archive consistency before retrying.","summary_zh":"第一次并行测试因无法检查渲染进程而停止。我先修复进程核对和归档一致性，再重新测试。"},{"title_zh":"第二次启动跨过图形阶段，又被路径身份误判挡住","title_en":"Graphics started, but the second worker failed another identity check","zh":"第二次保留了前次失败，并只修进程检查和导出。图形与Unity这次实际启动了，归档也完整一致。但容器内的客户端把主机启动包装程序和容器解释器当成同一个文件来核验，于是连接车辆前又停下。仍然没有训练样本。全部12个受管进程已退出，但没有车辆静止收尾结果。下一版把主机包装程序和容器解释器分别核验，再进行同样的吞吐测量。","en":"The next attempt applied the process and archive repairs. Graphics and Unity started, and archive checks passed. The client then compared the host's launcher wrapper with the Python file visible inside the container and rejected the identity before connecting to the car. No training samples were collected. All twelve tracked processes exited, but stationary vehicle shutdown was not measured because the connection never completed. I separated host and container identity checks before repeating the throughput test.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-120","summary_en":"Graphics started, but another check confused the host launcher with Python inside the container. No training began; I separated those identities.","summary_zh":"图形程序启动了，另一项检查却把主机启动脚本与容器内 Python 混为一谈。训练尚未开始，我随后分开核对。"},{"title_zh":"四个独立工作进程带来约四倍有效吞吐","title_en":"Four independent workers delivered about four times the throughput","zh":"第三版终于完成一个、两个和四个工作进程的比较。每个都从C15同一检查点和优化器状态开始，只训练外部读出，核心权重保持固定。三组分别每秒优化约2.07、4.22和8.36个新样本。四个工作进程约为一个的4.04倍，但其GPU平均利用率只有3.49%。记录显示很多时间在等相机与接口。这说明并行能隐藏部分等待，下一步值得扩大规模；它还不是驾驶质量评估，也没有找到最优并发数。","en":"The third version completed the one-, two- and four-worker tests. Each worker restored the same C15 checkpoint and optimizer state, learned its own external readout and kept the neural core fixed. Useful optimization throughput was approximately 2.07, 4.22 and 8.36 new transitions per second. Four workers achieved about 4.04 times the single-worker rate, although average sampled GPU utilization was only 3.49%. Much of the measured host time involved waiting for camera or interface data. Parallel workers could overlap that waiting. I next tested capacity; this throughput result did not identify a driving-quality improvement or an optimal worker count.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-121","summary_en":"Independent copies increased throughput almost in proportion to their number. The next test explored how many copies the allocation could support.","summary_zh":"独立副本增加时，吞吐量几乎同比增加。下一次测试转向检查这份资源能支持多少副本。"},{"title_zh":"曾提出分级扩展，但没有执行这条方案","title_en":"A gradual scaling proposal remained untested","zh":"看到四个工作进程近线性提升后，最初提出过先测八个，再有条件测十六个，并保留四个作当期对照。文件中的速度是根据已有结果推算的计划值。实际没有找到这套八个、十六个比较的作业。随后我选择直接测试六十四个完整工作进程。因此这里保留这个未执行的选择，说明决策怎么转向，不能把推算速度画成实验结果。","en":"After the four-worker gain, the initial proposal was to test eight and then, conditionally, sixteen workers, with a fresh four-worker reference. Its predicted rates were estimates based on earlier measurements. I found no job that executed this comparison. I instead chose a direct test of sixty-four complete workers. The unexecuted proposal explained that change of direction, but its estimated speeds were not measured results.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-122","summary_en":"The gradual scaling proposal remained a plan. I chose a larger direct test instead, so its estimated speeds stayed separate from measured results.","summary_zh":"逐步扩容方案停留在计划阶段。我选择直接进行更大规模测试，原方案的预测速度不作为实测结果。"},{"title_zh":"六十四个完整模型没有全部成功","title_en":"Sixty-four complete workers did not all succeed","zh":"这次直接把六十四个独立模型放到一块L40上，由三十二个CPU支持。六十四个尝试中三十二个完成，三十五个曾更新读出，峰值同时达到学习就绪的有四十九个。失败包括十一个模型加载时显存不足、一个旧启动消息，以及二十个暂停后读相机队列超时。总共优化了11,520个新样本。调度器显示完成，实验本身却是部分完成。下一步把并发降到三十二，并修正已排队相机消息的读取规则。","en":"The sixty-four-worker test placed independent models on one L40 with thirty-two CPUs. Thirty-two workers completed, thirty-five updated their readouts at some point and peak learning-ready concurrency reached forty-nine. Failures included eleven GPU-memory errors during model loading, one stale startup handshake and twenty timeouts while draining paused camera queues. Together the workers optimized 11,520 new transitions. The scheduler marked the allocation complete, but the experiment only partly completed. For the next attempt I reduced concurrency to thirty-two and repaired queue draining. Because both changed, the subsequent throughput comparison did not isolate their separate effects.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-123","summary_en":"The large parallel test only partly completed, with memory and camera failures. I reduced concurrency and repaired queue handling for the next test.","summary_zh":"大规模并行测试只完成一部分，出现显存和相机故障。下一次降低并发，并修正队列处理。"},{"title_zh":"暂停后仍在队列里的相机帧需要读完","title_en":"Queued camera frames still needed to be read after pausing","zh":"六十四个进程的失败中，有二十个发生在暂停后的相机队列读取。接口把40毫秒的软空闲窗口当成了必须立即返回的硬截止，即使队列里还排着完整帧。纯模拟消息测试复现了这个问题。修正后仍保留动作、全局和读取的硬界限，也继续拒绝不完整帧。下一次三十二进程试验实际使用了新规则。不过它同时减少了并发数，所以这两种改变的效果没有被单独分开。","en":"Twenty failures in the sixty-four-worker test occurred while reading camera messages already queued after a pause. The receiver treated a forty-millisecond soft idle window as a hard return deadline even when complete frames were waiting. Message-only tests reproduced this behaviour. I changed the receiver to finish those queued frames while retaining the action, global and drain hard limits and rejection of incomplete frames. The next thirty-two-worker run tested the repair together with lower concurrency.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-124","summary_en":"Queued complete images were being rejected by an idle timer. I changed the receiver to finish reading those frames while keeping the hard deadlines.","summary_zh":"已经排队的完整图像被空闲计时规则拒绝。我让接收程序先读完这些帧，同时保留硬时限。"},{"title_zh":"三十二个工作进程全部跑完","title_en":"All thirty-two workers completed","zh":"修正读取后，三十二个独立工作进程全部完成，每个优化384个新样本、执行24次更新。合计有效优化12,288个样本，每秒约60.98个，超过先前六十四个尝试的测得速度。这次没有无效动作或运行时恢复，所有车辆和进程收尾通过。它确认了这套三十二环境负载能稳定工作。车辆仍多次触发普通偏离终止，因此这一步解决的是采集容量，下一步才把环境共享给少数策略，比较核心学习。","en":"All thirty-two independent workers completed with the revised queue handling. Each optimized 384 new transitions in twenty-four updates, totalling 12,288 transitions at about 60.98 useful transitions per second. There were no invalid intervals or runtime recoveries, and final vehicle and process cleanup passed. This configuration operated reliably under the tested load and outperformed the earlier partial sixty-four-worker run. Frequent ordinary deviation terminations remained a driving problem. The next stage let multiple cars share each policy and compared fixed with trainable neural cores.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-125","summary_en":"Every worker completed under the smaller configuration. I then moved from independent learners toward several cars sharing a policy.","summary_zh":"较小配置中的所有副本都完成了。下一步从各自学习改为多辆车共享策略。"},{"title_zh":"部署检查先误判了两个存储区的需求","title_en":"The deployment check mixed up two storage requirements","zh":"转入共享策略前，准备程序又因为存储检查停止。它要求应用目录和scratch各有25 GiB，但应用文件系统总共只有15 GiB，实际应用副本远小于这个要求。修正版把应用目录要求改为2 GiB，scratch仍保留25 GiB。第一次在创建部署、修改台账和提交作业之前退出，因此没有额外训练作业。准备通过后，才一次性提交四策略比较。","en":"Preparation for shared-policy learning stopped because a storage check demanded 25 GiB in both application storage and scratch. The application filesystem was only 15 GiB in total, although the planned application copy needed much less. I changed its requirement to 2 GiB and kept 25 GiB for scratch. The rejected preparation had created no deployment, budget change or job. After the revised check passed, I submitted the four-policy comparison once.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-126","summary_en":"A disk check demanded more application storage than the filesystem could hold. I separated the application and scratch requirements before submission.","summary_zh":"磁盘检查对程序区的要求超过了文件系统总容量。我在提交前分开设定程序区与临时区的需求。"},{"title_zh":"多辆车共享策略，比较固定核心与可学习核心","title_en":"Shared learners compared fixed-weight and trainable cores","zh":"此前三十二个工作进程各学各的。这次把它们分为四组，每组八辆车共同收集经验、更新同一套权重，这就是共享策略。两个随机种子各有一个固定权重核心和一个训练核心连接增益的条件，四个外部读出都学习。四组实际优化18,432、15,360、19,456和12,288个新样本，末期驾驶平均时长都比初始约7.9秒更长。但在共同的8,192样本检查点，每对只有四个完整匹配案例，结果略偏向固定权重核心。于是当时保留全部版本，先看回放：开得更久究竟是学会纠偏，还是只减少了单向转向偏置。","en":"C17 divided thirty-two cars into four groups of eight, with each group collecting for one shared policy. For each of two seeds, one policy kept the core fixed and another trained its existing connection gains; all four readouts learned. The groups optimized 18,432, 15,360, 19,456 and 12,288 new transitions. Final mean driving durations exceeded the initial level of about 7.9 seconds, but final training amounts differed. At the common 8,192-transition checkpoint, only four matched starts per seed pair were complete, and both pairs slightly favoured fixed cores. I kept all checkpoints and inspected behaviour before extending training. Longer survival could reflect less steering bias rather than reliable correction, so displaced-start tests became important.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-127","summary_en":"Several cars shared each learner to compare fixed and trainable cores. Budgets differed at the end, and common-checkpoint results slightly favoured fixed cores.","summary_zh":"多辆车共享学习器，用来比较固定与可训练核心。最终训练量不同，共同检查点略偏向固定核心。"},{"title_zh":"四个策略的样本总数不是一个策略的学习量","title_en":"The combined sample count covered two separate policies","zh":"这四个策略在同一个计算作业内运行。整个作业用了7,486秒，共接受78,943条记录、优化65,536个不同样本，执行4,034次更新。这个65,536是四组相加，恰好等于每组原本的上限；没有任何一组达到自己的上限。十七个不可用动作间隔被排除并恢复，三个中间评估接口失败也保留。作业正常完成，驾驶效果仍要按每个策略、每个检查点和完整案例分别判断。","en":"The four C17 policies shared one allocation lasting 7,486 seconds. Together they accepted 78,943 transitions, optimized 65,536 distinct transitions and performed 4,034 updates. The combined optimized total happened to equal each policy's individual target of 65,536; none reached that target alone. Seventeen invalid training intervals were excluded and recovered, and three intermediate evaluation interface failures were kept. The job completed normally. I assessed driving separately for each policy and checkpoint rather than treat their pooled experience as one model's training.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-128","summary_en":"One allocation trained several policies, so their combined sample total was not the experience of any one policy. Each policy needed its own comparison.","summary_zh":"一份资源里训练了多个策略，合计样本量不属于任何单个策略。结果必须按各自的模型和检查点比较。"},{"title_zh":"更长生存还没有变成可靠纠偏","title_en":"Longer driving had not become reliable correction","zh":"我从回放看到固定权重策略偏左、可训练策略偏右，明显修正仍少。我回查发现，训练开始时车辆几乎都在中心，初始化的转向脉冲只造成很小航向差；近中心的偏离代价也很弱。参数确实在更新，探索仍在进行，但最容易得到的改善可能只是减小常量转向偏置。当时因此把大量延长固定权重评估放到次要位置，优先设计真正左右偏移和朝外航向的恢复学习。","en":"The replays showed the fixed-core policies drifting left and trainable-core policies drifting right, with little clear correction. I found that most training starts were nearly centred, initialization pulses created only small heading differences and the near-centre deviation penalty was weak. Parameters and exploration still changed. A reduced constant steering bias was therefore one plausible explanation for longer survival. I made extended ordinary evaluation secondary and prioritised recovery learning from measured lateral displacements and outward headings.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-129","summary_en":"The longer drives still showed little active correction. I shifted attention from nearly centred starts to measured offsets and outward headings.","summary_zh":"驾驶虽然延长，主动纠偏仍很少。我把重点从接近中心的起点转到实测偏移和朝外朝向。"},{"title_zh":"把车放到左右偏移处，观察它能否主动回来","title_en":"Start off target and watch whether the car actively returns","zh":"C18不再靠小转向脉冲代表恢复任务，而是把停止的车辆放到左右偏移位置，部分起点再朝外偏五度。连续二十帧确认位置与静止后才计分。一个神经策略继续C17的权重和完整优化器状态；另一个普通相机循环模型从头开始。两者各优化32,768个新样本。恢复要求偏移不超过0.05、航向误差不超过三度，并连续保持两秒。最终两者四个开发起点都没有通过。神经模型在8,192样本时曾短暂通过一个案例，后来没有稳定保留。于是下一步检查奖励、表示饱和与短暂恢复过程，而不是直接宣布成功或再延长同一训练。","en":"C18 replaced small initialization pulses with measured placements on either side of the target, sometimes pointing five degrees outward. Twenty consecutive frames had to confirm pose and stationarity before scoring. The neural policy restored C17 weights and optimizer state; a compact recurrent camera model started fresh as a diagnostic. Each optimized 32,768 new transitions. Recovery required offset at most 0.05 and heading error at most three degrees for two seconds. Neither final model passed any of the four development starts. The neural model briefly passed one at 8,192 samples, but later checkpoints did not sustain that result. I next inspected reward, representation saturation and recovery traces, keeping the two models' different architectures and ancestry explicit.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-130","summary_en":"Measured outward starts gave the models real correction tasks, but neither final model recovered reliably. I next checked their representations and rewards.","summary_zh":"实测朝外起点让模型真正面对纠偏任务，但两个最终模型都未可靠恢复。我随后检查表征和奖励。"},{"title_zh":"两组完成训练目标，最终仍未可靠恢复","title_en":"Both training targets completed without final recovery","zh":"C18的计算作业跨夜完成，共分配8,370秒。两组各完成32,768个新优化样本和2,048次更新。神经组接受34,624条记录，普通相机组接受33,528条；九个接口无效间隔被排除并恢复，不能算进训练样本。车辆和进程收尾都通过。这是一次完成目标的学习作业，而最终恢复为零是另一项结果。之后的分析全部读取保存文件，不再开车或重新加载模型推理。","en":"The C18 allocation completed after 8,370 seconds. Both conditions reached 32,768 newly optimized transitions and 2,048 updates. The neural condition accepted 34,624 transitions and the compact camera condition 33,528. Nine invalid interface intervals were excluded and recovered. Final vehicle and process cleanup passed. Thus the learning targets completed even though neither final policy achieved the recovery criterion. The following analysis used saved files only, without new driving or model inference.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-131","summary_en":"Both training targets completed, but neither final policy recovered reliably. I next inspected the saved representations and rewards.","summary_zh":"两个训练目标都完成了，但最终策略都未可靠恢复。我接着检查保存的内部表征和奖励。"},{"title_zh":"普通相机模型的内部表示几乎卡在极值","title_en":"The camera diagnostic produced saturated internal features","zh":"普通相机组最后没有恢复，选中的甚至是未训练版本。为判断这个对照是否健康，我读取它已保存的循环特征。末期六十四个维度的绝对均值都超过0.99，几乎卡在正负一，而相机输入仍在变化。神经组的1,314维读出则保持变化。这给出了一个具体表示问题，也使普通相机组不适合作为健康学习基线。下一轮主比较因此改为两个同祖先神经策略，只改变偏离惩罚。","en":"The compact camera model's selection procedure kept its untrained checkpoint after the failure to recover. I inspected its saved recurrent features. Late in training, all sixty-four dimensions had absolute means above 0.99, remaining near their positive or negative limits while images changed. The neural model's 1,314-dimensional readout remained variable. This was a concrete problem in the camera diagnostic, weakening it as a healthy learning reference. The next main experiment compared two neural policies with the same ancestry and changed their deviation penalty.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-132","summary_en":"The small camera model's hidden values stayed near their limits even as images changed. I used matched neural models for the next reward comparison.","summary_zh":"小型相机模型的隐藏值在图像变化时仍贴近上下限。下一次奖励比较改用起点一致的神经模型。"},{"title_zh":"先确认奖励方向与视觉响应，再选择改动","title_en":"Check reward direction and visual response before changing training","zh":"两个模型都没形成稳定恢复，原因不能只凭最终画面判断。我先把C18的68,152条接受记录和120次评估回报重新核对。奖励没有倒置，但偏离代价相对前进奖励较弱。随后在同一次C19作业内固定权重，分别输入原相机序列和重复第一帧的序列。下行神经元读出与转向随序列改变，说明视觉路径有响应。这个检查不让模拟器开车，也不更新参数。下一步就在同一个神经祖先上比较原惩罚和十倍惩罚。","en":"I first rechecked 68,152 accepted C18 transitions and 120 evaluation returns. Reward direction was correct, but deviation cost was weak relative to progress reward. Within the C19 allocation, I then held weights fixed and replayed saved image sequences, comparing them with versions that repeated only their first image. Neural features and steering changed with the image sequence, showing a responsive visual path in this probe. It ran neither a simulator nor parameter updates. I kept neural ancestry fixed for the next comparison and tested the original deviation penalty against a tenfold increase.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-133","summary_en":"Saved records showed weak deviation costs and a working visual response. I kept the neural starting point fixed and tested a stronger penalty.","summary_zh":"已有记录显示偏离代价偏弱，视觉路径也确实有反应。我固定神经模型起点，测试更强的惩罚。"},{"title_zh":"十倍偏离惩罚没有带来稳定的双侧恢复","title_en":"A tenfold deviation penalty did not yield stable recovery on both sides","zh":"C19的两个神经策略都从C18最终检查点和完整优化器状态开始。一个保留偏离系数0.05，另一个改成0.5；相机输入、动力学、学习设置和三十秒任务都保留。这样做是因为此前偏离代价较弱，但还需要原方案作对照。共同的16,384样本检查点上，原奖励四例中两例恢复，强惩罚只有一例。原奖励两次保持3.4秒和8.6秒后仍漂出。最终原奖励零例、强惩罚一例，且最终训练量不同。当时判断是出现了短暂、偏一侧的恢复，十倍惩罚没有稳定优势。接着回查任务覆盖，发现三十秒上限让所有评估都到不了第一弯。","en":"Both C19 policies restored the same final C18 model and optimizer. One used deviation coefficient 0.05 and the other 0.5, with camera, dynamics, learning settings and the thirty-second task unchanged. At 16,384 newly optimized transitions, recovery occurred in two of four starts with the original reward and one of four with the stronger penalty. The two original-reward cases held the band for 3.4 and 8.6 seconds before drifting out. Final recovery counts were zero and one, with unequal final training totals. Recovery was limited, asymmetric and temporary; the stronger penalty had no consistent advantage. A later coverage check revealed a more immediate task problem: the thirty-second limit stopped the car before its first bend.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-134","summary_en":"A stronger deviation penalty did not produce a consistent recovery advantage. A later audit showed that short episodes never reached a bend.","summary_zh":"更强偏离惩罚没有带来一致恢复优势。后来的检查发现，短回合根本到不了弯道。"},{"title_zh":"到时限时，两组保留了不同数量的新样本","title_en":"Both policies reached the time limit at different sample counts","zh":"C19的实际作业用了12,051秒，正常结束于学习时限，没有达到每组65,536样本的上限。原奖励优化31,424个新样本，强惩罚优化30,656个。十一个不可用动作间隔都单独保存并恢复。原奖励的最后一次参数更新已完成，但时限打断了它之后的额外诊断，所以有1,926次更新、1,925条完整更新后审计。这个缺口要原样保留。比较效果时优先看共同的中间检查点，不能把不同最终训练量当成严格等量对照。","en":"The C19 job ended normally at its learning deadline after 12,051 seconds. Neither policy reached the ceiling of 65,536 new transitions. The original-reward model optimized 31,424, and the stronger-penalty model 30,656. Eleven invalid action intervals were saved and recovered. The original-reward model completed its last parameter update, but the deadline interrupted its extra post-update diagnostic, leaving 1,926 updates and 1,925 complete diagnostic records. I kept that gap explicit and prioritised shared intermediate checkpoints over unequal final models for the behavioural comparison.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-135","summary_en":"The deadline gave the two conditions unequal training totals. I compared their shared intermediate checkpoints before interpreting final scores.","summary_zh":"截止时间使两个条件完成了不同训练量。我先比较共同中间检查点，再解释最终分数。"},{"title_zh":"三十秒上限把第一弯挡在所有评估之外","title_en":"The thirty-second cap excluded the first bend","zh":"回放中一直看不到弯道，因此我重新检查任务时间线。454个训练回合中326个因为时间上限结束。39个完成的策略评估全部到时截断，另一个是接口失败。评估最远路程仍在第一弯之前。因此最终“零恢复”是没有满足中心和航向保持条件，不是四次撞车，也不表示已掌握的驾驶技能被忘掉。这个回看改变了下一步：同时延长时间、动作和循环历史上限，并从道路不同段落开始，让训练真实访问弯道。","en":"Because no bends appeared in the replays, I checked episode coverage. Of 454 completed training episodes, 326 ended at the time limit. All thirty-nine completed policy evaluations were also time-truncated; one additional case failed at the interface. Even the furthest evaluated point lay before the first bend. The final zero-recovery result described failure to meet the offset-and-heading hold criterion, not four crashes. I therefore extended time, action and recurrent-history limits together and added starts along the route so training would encounter bends.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-136","summary_en":"The episodes ended before the first bend. I extended the task and added starts along the route so the learner could encounter turns.","summary_zh":"回合在到达第一处弯道前就结束了。我延长任务，并增加沿途起点，让学习器真正接触弯道。"},{"title_zh":"让一个策略从四段道路学习更长的驾驶","title_en":"Train one policy on longer drives from four road sections","zh":"C20继续原奖励16,384样本的神经检查点，连同优化器的历史状态一起恢复。既然短任务没有提供弯道经验，这次把回合延长到180秒或900个动作，并在道路四段各设置左右两个起点。三十二辆车共同更新一个策略，减少两个学习器争用计算的情况。网络为每辆车保留自己的历史；权重改变后，要用保存的输入重新算出与当前参数一致的状态。真正向过去传递学习误差的窗口仍是十六个决策，这叫截断反向传播，或TBPTT。奖励和学习率先保持。我要观察不同方向弯道、起点与中间检查点，避免把一个晚路段的成功当成从起点完成全程。","en":"C20 restored the original-reward C19 checkpoint at 16,384 new transitions and its optimizer state. I extended episodes to 180 seconds or 900 actions and used left and right offset starts at four route locations. Thirty-two cars now supplied one shared policy while keeping separate recurrent histories. After weights changed, saved inputs rebuilt each history with current parameters; gradients covered only sixteen decisions at a time, the TBPTT learning window. Reward and learning rates initially stayed unchanged. Evaluations covered both bend directions, all starts and intermediate checkpoints. Completion from a late start meant traversing only the remaining open route; driving reliably from the beginning was still a separate goal.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-137","summary_en":"I extended driving and placed starts along the road so the shared learner would encounter bends, while keeping each car's history separate.","summary_zh":"我延长驾驶并沿路设置起点，让共享学习器真正接触弯道，同时保留每辆车的独立历史。"},{"title_zh":"长路线基线开完，第一次训练重置却没有通过","title_en":"The longer baseline finished, but the first training reset failed","zh":"C20第一次作业完成八个策略基线和八个零转向对照，确实把旧策略带到了弯道。但准备三十二个训练环境时，不计分的制动预热超过旧时长界限，整个作业在136秒后失败。没有接受任何新训练样本，也没到原定梯度一致性检查。旧策略在八个起点中六个比零转向进展更远，这属于继承策略的表现。下一步先修重置的静止边界和失败后的收尾时序，再独立继续训练。","en":"The first C20 job completed eight policy baselines and eight zero-steering controls, bringing the inherited policy into bends. It then failed while initializing thirty-two training environments because an unscored braking warmup exceeded the old action-duration limit. The allocation ended after 136 seconds with no accepted new training samples; the planned gradient comparison had not run. In the baselines, the inherited policy progressed farther than zero steering in six of eight starts. I next repaired stationary warmup acceptance and failed-child shutdown timing before a separate continuation.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-138","summary_en":"The longer baseline evaluations completed, but training initialization failed during braking warmup. I repaired that reset check before continuing.","summary_zh":"更长的基线评估完成了，但训练初始化在刹车预热时失败。我修复重置检查后再继续。"},{"title_zh":"静止预热完整可信时，给它单独的重置验收","title_en":"Give stationary warmup its own reset check","zh":"失败发生在车停止时的预热，而不是计分驾驶动作。我逐项核查完整相机帧、时间、暂停状态、执行命令回显和静止位置，只在这类不计分制动预热中采用有界的新验收。真实驾驶动作的时间规则保持原样。下一次运行里2,246段预热通过，其中76段会被旧时长规则拒绝。另一个修改让失败子程序先完成自己的收尾，再必要时终止进程。正常结束没有触发这个失败收尾分支，随后进入更长学习。","en":"I gave unscored stationary warmup its own bounded check, covering complete camera processing, clocks, pause state, command reports and stationary pose. The rules for scored driving stayed unchanged. In the following run, 2,246 warmups were accepted, including seventy-six the old duration rule would have rejected. A separate cleanup repair allowed failed child processes time to finish shutdown before forced termination. Normal completion did not exercise that failure branch. These changes allowed substantive learning to continue.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-139","summary_en":"Stationary warmup needed its own bounded rule rather than the rule for scored driving. The following run used that distinction.","summary_zh":"静止预热需要自己的有界检查，不能直接套用计分驾驶规则。后一次运行采用了这个区分。"},{"title_zh":"局部转弯明显改善，最终版本却不处处更好","title_en":"Local turning improved unevenly across starting points","zh":"修正版C20实际优化100,352个新样本。初始、65,536样本和最终版本在同八个起点评估。平均前进由7.116个单位增到约10.5至10.7；中间版本在四个起点累计通过五段定义弯道，覆盖两种转向方向。最终版本在晚路段更强，却在另一些负向弯段变弱。所有48次策略评估仍触发了距目标路线0.5的旧截止，没有评估完成剩余路线。训练中三个终点事件都从晚路段开始。因此当时保存中间与最终版本，接着调查样本分配偏向以及旧截止是否过早。","en":"The revised C20 run optimized 100,352 new transitions. Initial, 65,536-transition and final models were evaluated from the same eight starts. Mean progress increased from 7.116 to about 10.5–10.7 units. The intermediate model accumulated five defined bend passes across four starts, covering both directions. The final model improved later sections but weakened some negative-direction bend cases. All forty-eight policy evaluations crossed the old 0.5 distance-to-target-path cutoff; none finished its remaining route. Three endpoint events during exploratory training began on the late route section. I kept both intermediate and final models and next investigated unequal exposure to starts and whether the cutoff stopped drives prematurely.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-140","summary_en":"Training improved some bends but weakened others. I kept the intermediate and final models and investigated data imbalance and early stopping.","summary_zh":"训练改善部分弯道，却使另一些变差。我保留中间与最终模型，检查数据分配和过早停止问题。"},{"title_zh":"旧“越界”测的是目标路径距离，不是物理路边","title_en":"The old cutoff measured target-path distance, not the physical road edge","zh":"回放中车好像还在路上就停了，促使我回查停止条件。程序测量的是车辆参考点到计分路径的距离，超过0.5就终止；它没有测道路网格边界或整辆车的轮廓。因此旧的“离开道路”表述比原证据更宽。这个审查只改解释，没有改历史数据或已提交的C21。下一步单独注册道路参照，用固定权重实际继续开过旧阈值，看能否继续行驶或返回。","en":"In the replays, the car sometimes seemed to stop while still on the road. Source inspection showed that the rule ended an episode when the vehicle reference point exceeded distance 0.5 from the scoring path. It did not measure the physical road edge or the whole car footprint. I corrected the interpretation of those historical terminations without changing their data or the already submitted C21 run. The next test registered an independent road reference and let fixed policies drive past the old threshold.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-141","summary_en":"The stopping rule measured distance to a scoring path, not the visible road edge. I tested whether driving could continue beyond that old limit.","summary_zh":"停止规则测的是到计分路径的距离，不是画面中的路边。我随后测试超过旧阈值后能否继续行驶。"},{"title_zh":"固定起点配额，保留中间版本的转弯能力","title_en":"Fix the start allocation to retain intermediate turning ability","zh":"C20后期较长寿的起点贡献了更多训练动作，最晚路段的份额升高，而较弱弯段没有跟着增加。C21因此继续65,536样本的中间检查点，把三十二个通道固定分给八个起点，让完整批次每个起点占八分之一。同时让已准备好的车辆继续采集，另一辆重置时不必全体等待；更新前仍要等重置全部结束。奖励和学习率保持。实际最好的98,304新增样本版本在八个起点中四个完成剩余路线，都来自后路段；早起点仍卡在首个长右弯。更晚版本又退为三例。于是保存最佳中间版本，并继续追查一致性守卫失败。","en":"Longer-surviving C20 starts supplied more training actions, favouring later route sections over a weaker bend. C21 returned to the intermediate 65,536-transition model and assigned thirty-two simulators permanently to eight starts, giving each origin one eighth of every complete batch. Ready cars could collect while another reset, but all resets had to finish before weight updates. Reward and learning rates stayed unchanged. The best evaluated model, at 98,304 additional transitions, completed the remaining route from four of eight starts, all on later sections. Early starts still failed in the first long right bend; a later checkpoint fell to three completions. I selected the intermediate model and separately investigated the eventual probability-replay failure.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-142","summary_en":"Fixed start quotas balanced training exposure and improved later-route completion. Early bends still failed, and later training regressed locally.","summary_zh":"固定起点配额使训练经验更均衡，也改善后段路线完成。早期弯道仍失败，后续训练还有局部退化。"},{"title_zh":"准备脚本用了旧Python没有的哈希接口","title_en":"Preparation used a hashing API absent from the system Python","zh":"C21第一次准备停在Python兼容问题：系统Python 3.9没有脚本调用的快速文件哈希接口。它尚未创建部署目录，也没有提交计算作业。修正版用分块读取计算同样的文件哈希，同时保留原检查规则。之后源文件、父检查点和运行环境都完成核验，才提交真正的C21。这个失败属于部署工具，不是模型计算或驾驶退步。","en":"The first C21 preparation stopped because the system's Python 3.9 lacked the file-hashing API used by the helper. No deployment directory or compute job had been created. I calculated the same hashes with chunked file reads and kept the verification requirements. Source files, the parent checkpoint and runtime then passed preparation before the C21 submission. This failure concerned the deployment helper, before any model arithmetic or driving test.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-143","summary_en":"Preparation failed because the system Python lacked the chosen hashing function. I changed the helper while keeping the same file checks.","summary_zh":"系统 Python 缺少所用哈希函数，准备过程因此停止。我修改辅助程序，保留相同文件核对要求。"},{"title_zh":"重算概率略超容差，学习在118,784步停止","title_en":"A small replay discrepancy stopped learning at 118,784 samples","zh":"C21在完成118,784个新优化样本后失败。程序准备更新下一批权重时，先用收集该批数据时的相同策略重算动作概率。最大差异为约0.000010967，略高于0.00001的既定范围，因此该批没有执行任何更新，2,048条记录被舍弃。已有更新和检查点全部保留。差异有限，但原记录没有保存具体出错行与状态，原因不能定为单纯舍入。下一步应补完整量化诊断，保持守卫，而不是直接放宽阈值。","en":"C21 stopped after optimizing 118,784 new transitions. Before the next batch's updates, replayed action probabilities under the same collecting policy differed by a maximum of about 0.000010967, slightly above the 0.00001 limit. That batch made no updates and discarded 2,048 rows; earlier updates and checkpoints remained saved. The failing row and state trace were missing, so the small discrepancy could not be attributed solely to rounding. I kept the limit and improved quantitative diagnostics for the next attempt.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-144","summary_en":"Learning stopped when replayed action probabilities differed slightly beyond the limit. The missing failing-row trace made better diagnostics necessary.","summary_zh":"重算动作概率时，差异略超阈值，学习因此停止。失败行的详细轨迹没有保存，下一步需要补充诊断。"},{"title_zh":"先在静止状态下建立道路参照","title_en":"Establish the road reference while stationary","zh":"为检验旧0.5截止是否过早，C22先做单独的道路注册作业。它把上游道路样式、实际路线节点、车辆位置和五组静止相机画面互相核对，建立保守的道路参照。作业61秒完成，八组车辆静止和图形进程收尾都通过。这一步没有训练，也没有量到整辆车或车轮的连续边界。它给下一步十二次固定权重继续驾驶提供同一把观察尺。","en":"Before testing the old cutoff, C22 used a separate stationary registration job. It compared source road styles, route nodes, vehicle poses and five stationary camera records to establish a conservative road reference. The job completed in sixty-one seconds, with all eight stationary and graphics cleanups passing. It performed no learning and did not continuously measure wheels or the whole car inside the road. That reference supported the following twelve continuation drives with fixed weights.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-145","summary_en":"I registered a consistent road reference while the car was stationary, then used it to observe driving beyond the old cutoff.","summary_zh":"我在车辆静止时建立一致的道路参照，再用它观察超过旧截止条件后的驾驶。"},{"title_zh":"准备过程中的失败也逐项保留","title_en":"Keep the preparation failures alongside the completed attempts","zh":"C22准备时还遇到几次独立阻碍。上传界面报错，但文件哈希已正确；解包程序把内容数量与包括清单的总数量混淆；quota查询又用了不对应的目录键。它们都在提交前停止。评估准备后来发现scratch不足，也先停止，再对已结束作业的相同模拟器文件做逐字节核验的硬链接整理，释放重复占用。研究数据和检查点保留。完成这些准备后，才分别一次提交注册和评估。","en":"C22 preparation met several separate failures before submission. The upload interface reported an error although the remote hash matched. Extraction confused the number of payload files with total archive entries, and quota lookup used the wrong project-directory key. Later evaluation preparation also stopped for insufficient scratch space. I consolidated byte-identical simulator files from completed jobs with hard links, keeping research data and checkpoints. Registration and evaluation were each submitted once after their preparation checks passed.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-146","summary_en":"Upload, archive, quota and disk checks delayed preparation before submission. I resolved these separately and preserved the research files.","summary_zh":"上传、归档、配额和磁盘检查先后阻挡了提交。我分别处理这些问题，并保留研究文件。"},{"title_zh":"跨过旧阈值后，有的车能继续，但可靠恢复仍少","title_en":"Beyond the old threshold, some drives continued but recovery stayed limited","zh":"C22把C20的65,536中间版本和100,352最终版本放到六个相同起点，共十二次驾驶，权重始终固定。四个案例跨过旧0.5距离后又继续了约0.2至2.8秒，没有一个回到旧距离带。最终版本从晚路段负偏移起点出发，过两段弯后到达剩余计分路线终点；其余十一例因参考点持续离开保守路内区域而结束。所有案例都没有技术失败。这确认旧规则确实会截断一些可继续的驾驶，同时也显示仅移除旧停止线没有产生可靠恢复。下一步需要让训练保留有效的偏离与恢复经验，并明确路外进展怎样计分。","en":"C22 tested C20's 65,536-transition and 100,352-transition models from six matched starts, giving twelve fixed-weight drives. Four continued beyond the old 0.5 distance threshold for about 0.2–2.8 simulated seconds; none returned inside it. The final model from the late negative-offset start passed two bends and finished its remaining route. The other eleven ended after sustained departure of the reference point from the conservative road interior. No case failed technically. The old cutoff had indeed stopped some drives with room to continue, but removing it did not produce reliable recovery. The next learning design needed to keep useful departure-and-return experience and define how off-road progress contributed to reward.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-147","summary_en":"Some fixed-policy drives continued beyond the old cutoff, but none returned inside that band. Removing the cutoff alone did not solve recovery.","summary_zh":"部分固定策略超过旧截止条件后还能继续，但没有返回旧范围。单独取消截止规则并未解决恢复。"},{"title_zh":"从固定路线转向保存实际几何的生成道路池","title_en":"Evaluation shifted from Warren to saved generated roads","zh":"最初回顾C21和C22时，建议先保留Warren，继续解决首个长右弯。随后我更重视一般道路跟随和不同方向经验，又提供了课程训练代码。决定因此改变：继续C21的98,304中间检查点，但主任务转到生成道路。三十二个模拟器分别保存首次实际加载的道路，二十四条训练、四条开发、四条保留评估。每次重置仍用同一条道路，不能说每回合都重新随机生成。课程代码提供了奖励分解和检查输入的方法，课程SAC权重则没有混进神经策略。这一步先记录选择变化，再由实际道路哈希验证运行条件。","en":"After C21 and C22, the first proposal was to keep Warren and target its first long right bend. I instead prioritised general following and both turn directions, using course training code as a reference. I kept the selected C21 model at 98,304 additional transitions but moved to generated roads. Thirty-two simulators captured their roads when their scenes loaded: twenty-four for training, four for development and four held out. Each reused its captured road after resets, rather than generating another every episode. Course code informed rewards, resets and input inspection; its SAC weights were not used. Saved geometry hashes, rather than a map name or presumed seed, identified each run's road pool.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-148","summary_en":"I moved the main task to generated roads while keeping the selected earlier checkpoint. Each simulator captured and reused its own road.","summary_zh":"我保留选中的早期检查点，把主任务转到生成道路。每个模拟器保存并反复使用自己的道路。"},{"title_zh":"道路池捕获成功，接收器计数器却没有初始化","title_en":"The road pool was captured, but a receiver counter was missing","zh":"C23第一次运行实际启动了三十二个图形环境，也保存了三十二条不同道路的几何哈希。但注册道路需要先接收相机，新的手动启动过程漏掉了相机接收器使用的计数器，因此每个注册都失败。87秒后作业停止，新训练样本和更新全为零。父检查点仍是C21的中间版本。下一版把计数器初始化放到首次相机接收之前，并修正另一个提前发现的接收容量设置，再单独提交。","en":"The first C23 attempt started thirty-two graphics environments and captured thirty-two distinct road hashes. Registration failed everywhere because the new initialization path had omitted a counter needed by the inherited camera receiver. The job stopped after eighty-seven seconds with zero new training samples or updates, leaving the selected C21 model as its parent. I initialized the counter before the first camera advance and restored a separately identified receive-cap setting before making another submission.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-149","summary_en":"Roads were captured, but the receiver lacked a counter needed during setup. I initialized it before the next attempt.","summary_zh":"道路已经采集，接收程序却缺少初始化所需的计数器。我在下一次尝试前补上初始化。"},{"title_zh":"车辆朝向符合命令，却被另一段道路的方向拒绝","title_en":"Reset reached the target yaw but checked the wrong road segment","zh":"第二次道路注册全部通过，随后初始训练重置又失败。一个记录里车辆实际航向约3.21373度，几乎正好等于命令目标；验收却用偏移位置投影到的相邻路段切线，算成了负2.119度误差。位置、静止和其他条件都通过，只有这个航向定义冲突。137秒后停止，仍无新学习。下一步保持原一度容差，改为直接比较车辆航向和原命令目标，同时保留两种方向供审计。","en":"The second C23 attempt registered all roads but failed during initial training reset. In one saved case, measured yaw was about 3.21373 degrees, almost exactly the requested target. The check instead used a neighbouring projected segment's tangent and reported heading error −2.119 degrees. Position and stationarity passed; the heading references disagreed. The job stopped after 137 seconds without learning. I kept the one-degree tolerance, compared measured yaw directly with the commanded target and saved both heading references.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-150","summary_en":"The car reached the requested heading, but the check compared it with a different road segment. I corrected the reference rather than loosening tolerance.","summary_zh":"车辆已达到要求朝向，检查却拿另一段道路作参照。我修正参照，没有放宽容差。"},{"title_zh":"先用保存帧复核新验收，再修正存储单位读取","title_en":"Check the pose rule on saved frames, then fix the sample quotas","zh":"航向修复先在原数据上检查：1,846个保存的定位帧重现了十八个原通过、六个仅航向失败的情况；新规则让二十四段观察序列都具有要求的连续二十帧。原先通过的端点没有改变。同时发现quota工具输出的是二进制单位，旧解析器按十进制理解，可能误报空间不足，于是改用精确KiB读数。这些都是源代码和保存数据准备，还不算真实重置通过。完成核验后才进入第三次实际学习作业。","en":"I first tested the new heading rule on 1,846 saved placement frames. The audit reproduced eighteen original acceptances and six heading-only failures. All twenty-four sequences contained a qualifying twenty-frame ending under the revised rule, with originally accepted endpoints unchanged. Preparation also revealed that the quota tool used binary units while the parser assumed decimal units. I adopted exact KiB readings. These checks used source and saved data, not new physical reset trials. The third C23 learning submission followed after preparation passed.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-151","summary_en":"The revised pose check passed on saved frames. I also corrected quota units before the next learning attempt.","summary_zh":"修改后的姿态检查在保存帧上通过。我还修正了配额单位，再开始下一次学习尝试。"},{"title_zh":"真实学习开始后，两个模拟器进程发生原生崩溃","title_en":"Two simulator processes crashed after real learning had begun","zh":"第三次终于通过道路和重置验收，优化了7,680个新样本、执行480次更新。接着两个Unity进程发生SIGBUS：一个堆栈在相机读回，另一个在物理同步。作业651秒后失败。下一次学习后驾驶评估原定在12,288样本，因此还没有到达。日志还揭示空StreamingAssets目录在复制中丢失，以及中断重置的所有权处理缺陷。它们值得修，但SIGBUS最初原因仍未确定。下一版保留这次已学权重和完整优化器状态，修明确工程问题后继续。","en":"The third C23 attempt passed road and reset checks, then optimized 7,680 new transitions in 480 updates. Two Unity processes crashed with SIGBUS, one stack involving camera readback and the other physics synchronization. The job failed after 651 seconds, before its first learned-policy evaluation at 12,288 transitions. Logs also exposed a missing empty StreamingAssets directory and incorrect handling of an interrupted reset. Those were confirmed repair targets, while the SIGBUS trigger remained unknown. I saved the learned failure checkpoint and complete optimizer state for continuation.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-152","summary_en":"Training began, then two simulator processes crashed. I saved the learned checkpoint and investigated confirmed directory and reset-handling defects.","summary_zh":"训练已开始，随后两个模拟器进程崩溃。我保存已学习的检查点，并调查确认存在的目录和重置处理缺陷。"},{"title_zh":"补回缺失目录，并等待重置操作确实结束","title_en":"Repair the confirmed directory and reset-process errors","zh":"这次修复没有给SIGBUS补造根因。上游压缩包里本来有空目录，文件式复制把它遗漏了，因此新版明确保留。另一个源代码检查发现，等待重置被打断时，程序可能先解除所有权，却没有确认后台操作真的结束。新版保留所有权直到完成，并保留最初异常，避免后来的身份检查把它盖住。随后R4没有记录原生进程丢失，但这段健康运行本身不能确定旧SIGBUS原因。下一步继续同一学习谱系。","en":"The simulator archive contained an empty directory that file-only copying had omitted, so I restored it. Source inspection also showed that interrupted reset waiting could release a simulator before its background operation finished. I kept control until that operation ended and preserved the first exception rather than obscure it with a later identity error. R4 subsequently recorded no native process loss, but that interval did not establish the earlier SIGBUS cause. Learning continued from the saved failure checkpoint.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-153","summary_en":"I restored a missing empty directory and made interrupted resets finish before releasing the simulator. The earlier crash cause remained unknown.","summary_zh":"我补回缺失的空目录，并让中断的重置结束后才释放模拟器。此前崩溃的起因仍未查明。"},{"title_zh":"文件正在原子替换，扫描程序误把暂时消失当成失败","title_en":"An archive scanner tried to read a file during atomic replacement","zh":"R4从上次7,680样本的失败检查点继续，又优化9,216个新样本。所有道路、初始重置和梯度检查通过，但还没到学习后驾驶评估。812秒时，输出扫描器先看到一个临时JSON文件，再读取属性时该名字已被原子替换，便把正常发布过程当成文件系统失败，停止学习。这次没有新的原生进程丢失。下一版针对已核验的原子写文件路径，做有界的整次清单重扫，保留真实永久缺失仍然报错的规则。","en":"R4 restored the checkpoint saved after 7,680 transitions and optimized another 9,216. Roads, initial resets and gradient checks passed, but the learned-policy evaluation was still not reached. At 812 seconds, the output scanner found a temporary JSON name that disappeared in a normal atomic replacement before its file attributes were read. The scanner treated that publication race as a filesystem failure and stopped learning. No new native simulator loss was recorded. I added bounded whole-inventory retries for known atomic-writer paths while continuing to reject permanently missing files.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-154","summary_en":"Learning stopped because an output scan raced with a normal atomic file replacement. I made the scanner retry that bounded publication window.","summary_zh":"输出扫描恰好遇上正常的原子文件替换，学习因此停止。我让扫描程序在这个有界发布窗口内重试。"},{"title_zh":"文件扫描已修好，批量神经特征却不一致","title_en":"The scanner passed, but neural features differed with twenty-four simulators","zh":"R5先实际运行三十二个并发写文件子程序，修正后的扫描通过。道路注册和R4父检查点恢复也通过。它收集384条有效输入后，比较逐车与二十四通道一起计算的结果，神经特征超出既定范围，于是全部舍弃，没有更新权重。问题在于失败前尚未把具体维度和差异大小写出，这些量无法补回。237秒后作业停止。下一步改做固定输入数值诊断，先完整记录输出、状态、梯度和重复计算差异。","en":"R5 first passed a test with thirty-two concurrent metadata writers, confirming the scanner repair. Road registration and restoration of R4 also passed. After collecting 384 valid rows, the program compared single-simulator and twenty-four-simulator neural calculations. Feature differences exceeded tolerance, so the rows were discarded before any update. The exception was raised before saving the failing dimension and error magnitude; its message could not recover those details. The allocation stopped after 237 seconds. I next prepared fixed-input tests that saved outputs, states, gradients and repeatability results before judging them.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-155","summary_en":"The scanner worked, but batched neural features failed their consistency check before any update. I prepared fixed-input numerical tests.","summary_zh":"扫描修好后，批量神经特征在更新前未通过一致性检查。我转而准备固定输入的数值测试。"},{"title_zh":"数值诊断在错误的资源检查处就停止","title_en":"An incorrect resource check blocked the numerical test","zh":"第一次数值诊断连模型都没加载。程序要求实际分配内存必须等于请求的64 GiB，但这个L40分区实际按GPU授予187950 MiB。两秒后检查拒绝，零比较、零更新、零车辆运行。这里失败的是我新增的资源守卫，不是数值候选。修正版把请求量与平台实际授予量分别核验，保留这个失败，再运行下一次独立诊断。","en":"The first numerical diagnostic stopped before model loading. A new resource check required granted memory to equal the requested 64 GiB, but the L40 partition granted 187950 MiB per GPU. It rejected the job after two seconds, before numerical comparison, updates or vehicle operation. I separated requested resources from granted resources in the check and kept this failed setup before another allocation.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-156","summary_en":"A resource check rejected the diagnostic before model loading because granted memory differed from requested memory. I checked those quantities separately.","summary_zh":"资源检查因实际分配内存不同于请求量，在模型加载前拒绝了诊断。我随后分开检查两者。"},{"title_zh":"资源检查修好后，启动器又漏了CUDA环境","title_en":"After that repair, the launcher omitted the CUDA environment","zh":"第二次诊断通过资源检查，却在导入计算包时找不到Torch，六秒后停止。原训练程序的主启动器会提前设置项目包路径、GPU绑定和隔离环境；这个直接诊断启动器没有完整复用它。模型和父检查点仍未加载，所有数值阶段都未执行，不能把默认的“未接受”状态解释成数值失败。下一版先走原来成功的主机启动过程，再进入同一个数值诊断。","en":"The second diagnostic passed the resource check but stopped after six seconds because Torch could not be imported. The established training launcher configured packages, GPU binding and isolation before entering its wrapper; the direct diagnostic launcher had omitted that setup. No model, checkpoint or numerical phase was loaded. I reused the working host initialization and then invoked the unchanged diagnostic procedure.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-157","summary_en":"The next diagnostic could not import Torch because the launcher omitted the established CUDA setup. I reused the working launch environment.","summary_zh":"下一次诊断因启动器漏掉已验证的 CUDA 设置而无法导入 Torch。我改用已有可工作的启动环境。"},{"title_zh":"固定批次形状后，前向通过但梯度仍有差异","title_en":"A fixed batch size matched forward outputs but not every gradient","zh":"第三次数值诊断真正加载了相同父权重和完整优化器状态，没有更新或开车。十七个阶段、一百七十六项前向和循环比较通过，原先二十四通道的特征失败没有复现。但一个读出层权重梯度有54个元素超出原容差，候选因此被拒绝。相同标量计算的重复字节也会变化，固定批次形状尚未解决问题。下一步研究确定性的稀疏计算实现，同时保留原失败，不把未复现直接当成修好了。","en":"The third diagnostic loaded the same parent and optimizer without updating weights or driving. Seventeen phases and 176 forward/state comparisons passed, and the earlier live feature failure did not recur. However, fifty-four readout-weight gradient elements exceeded the original tolerance, so the candidate failed. Repeated scalar calculations also produced different byte hashes. A fixed batch shape alone had not resolved numerical consistency. I next investigated deterministic sparse arithmetic, keeping both the gradient failure and the unreproduced live-feature failure in the record.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-158","summary_en":"Forward calculations passed, but some gradients still differed too much. Fixed batch shape alone had not solved numerical consistency.","summary_zh":"前向计算通过了，但部分梯度差异仍过大。只固定批量形状还未解决数值一致性。"},{"title_zh":"新计算可以重复，但与旧实现仍有差异","title_en":"The revised calculation was repeatable but differed from the original","zh":"下一次把稀疏乘法换成确定性的COO计算，图、权重、公式和精度保持。新实现内部的48次标量与批量比较、八组梯度和48次重复计算都通过。但连续状态与旧实现比较时，部分特征和122个梯度元素仍超出原范围。因此按当时声明的兼容标准，候选仍被拒绝。下一步没有改写这项结果，而是单独声明算术迁移：用确定性标量作参照，再增加独立的解析与有限差分梯度检查。","en":"The next test used deterministic COO sparse arithmetic with the same graph, weights, equation and precision. Within that implementation, forty-eight scalar-versus-batch comparisons, eight gradient sets and forty-eight repeat pairs passed. Against the old implementation, some continuous features and 122 gradient elements still exceeded the existing bounds. The candidate therefore failed the compatibility requirement. I proposed an explicit arithmetic migration next: adopt a deterministic scalar reference and add independent analytic and finite-difference gradient checks rather than claim exact compatibility with the old backend.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-159","summary_en":"The deterministic calculation repeated reliably but did not match the old implementation closely enough. I kept that result and tested a new reference explicitly.","summary_zh":"确定性计算能稳定重复，却与旧实现不够接近。我保留这个结果，再明确测试采用新数值参照。"},{"title_zh":"先检查重复性和梯度，再采用新算术","title_en":"Check repeatability and gradients before adopting new arithmetic","zh":"这一轮正式把确定性算法作为新计算参照，旧兼容失败继续归档。图、权重、单精度和比较阈值仍保留。208项同实现前向比较与208对重复计算完全一致，八组梯度通过，另外的小型有符号矩阵也通过解析与有限差分检查。父权重和优化器状态不变，没有执行更新或车辆。由此通过的是版本化的算术迁移准备。接下来R7还必须用真实采集数据完成更新、保存、重读、驾驶评估和重置，再进行长学习。","en":"I tested the deterministic implementation as a new, versioned arithmetic reference while keeping the failed old-backend comparisons. Graph, weights, precision and comparison thresholds stayed unchanged. All 208 forward comparisons and 208 repeat pairs within the new backend were exactly equal. Eight gradient sets passed, and a separate small signed matrix passed analytic and finite-difference checks. No parameters or optimizer state changed, and no vehicle ran. These results supported adopting the new arithmetic. R7 still had to complete live learning, save and reload, driving evaluation and reset before sustained training could be accepted.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-160","summary_en":"The new arithmetic passed repeatability and independent gradient checks without changing the saved weights. It was ready for a real learning-cycle test.","summary_zh":"新算术通过重复性和独立梯度检查，保存权重未变。接下来可以检查真实学习循环。"},{"title_zh":"学习闭环跑完，四条开发路的改善小而不均","title_en":"Training completed with small, uneven driving changes","zh":"R7直接继续R4的9,216样本失败检查点和优化器；中间数值诊断没有产生新训练祖先。采用已验证的新算术后，它完成22,528个新优化样本、1,351次更新，并通过实际保存、评估和重置闭环。四条开发道路平均合格前进由9.7676增到9.9659个单位，约增2.03%；两条退、两条升，没有终点。留出道路上有局部转弯，但没有同路初始父策略可算提升。更关键的是道路约250单位，观测速率下全程约需730秒，旧180秒回合不匹配。下一步转为原起点长时间驾驶，同时继续降低循环历史重算成本。","en":"R7 resumed the R4 failure checkpoint, saved after 9,216 new transitions, and its optimizer state. The intervening diagnostics had trained no new parent model. With the accepted arithmetic, R7 optimized 22,528 new transitions in 1,351 updates and completed learning, saving, evaluation and reset. Mean qualified progress across four development roads rose from 9.7676 to 9.9659 units, about 2.03%; two roads improved and two worsened, with no endpoint. Held-out recordings showed local bends but lacked same-road parent baselines for measuring improvement. Roads were about 250 units long and would take roughly 730 seconds at the observed rate, against a 180-second cap. I next extended original-start driving and separately tested cheaper history reconstruction.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-161","summary_en":"The repaired learning cycle completed with small, uneven gains. Long road lengths then motivated longer original-start tasks.","summary_zh":"修复后的学习循环完成了，但改善小且不均衡。较长道路随后促使我延长从原起点出发的任务。"},{"title_zh":"训练结束后，打包程序因文件名中间的点而停止","title_en":"After training, archive packaging rejected dots in a filename","zh":"R7训练和一次结算已经完成后，终态材料打包又失败。验证器只接受过窄的文件名形式，误拒绝包含中间点号的合法任务文件名。这个失败不涉及权重或驾驶。修正版只打包已有证据，不再次查询作业或结算，最终十七项元数据全部通过核验。这里保留原打包异常，避免让归档问题被误读成另一次训练失败，也避免重复计费。之后进入C24长路线任务。","en":"R7 training and its one-time resource settlement were complete when final metadata packaging failed. A filename check rejected a valid task filename containing intermediate dots. Weights and driving results were unaffected. I changed the helper to package the existing evidence without querying the scheduler or repeating settlement. All seventeen final metadata files were verified. This was an archival failure after training, before moving to C24's longer task.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-162","summary_en":"Training was complete; only metadata packaging failed on a filename. I repaired the packaging helper without repeating training or settlement.","summary_zh":"训练已经完成，失败的只是元数据打包对文件名的检查。我修复打包程序，没有重复训练或结算。"},{"title_zh":"从原起点开始，允许更长驾驶","title_en":"Allow longer drives from the original start","zh":"C24继续C23最终22,528样本的权重和完整优化器状态。此前道路长度与速度显示180秒不足以走完，因此这次从道路原起点开始，允许1,200秒或6,000个动作，循环历史容量也一起延长。仍是二十四个训练环境、四个开发和四个保留环境，每个环境重置后重复自己的真实道路。新优化样本目标65,536，并在同一条本轮道路上比较父策略和后续版本。不同作业会捕获不同生成道路，原始驾驶时长不能直接横向当作改善。这套设计先要跨过恢复父检查点、数值检查和真实学习闭环。实际前两次未学，第三次才开始；更长上限也没有自动解决后续偏离失败。","en":"C24 restored the final C23 checkpoint at 22,528 new transitions and its complete optimizer state. To allow enough time for the measured road lengths, I set 1,200 seconds or 6,000 actions per episode and extended recurrent-history capacity accordingly. The configuration kept twenty-four training, four development and four held-out simulators, each reusing its captured road after reset. The target was 65,536 newly optimized transitions, with parent and later policies tested on the same run's roads. Different allocations captured different roads, so durations across jobs were not matched gains. Startup and numerical checks still had to pass: the first two attempts learned nothing, and the third reached training.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-163","summary_en":"I allowed enough time and history for long roads from their original starts. Startup failures still had to be resolved before learning.","summary_zh":"我为从原起点出发的长路增加了时间和历史容量，但仍需先解决启动失败才能学习。"},{"title_zh":"图数据没变，保存的文件路径却让恢复失败","title_en":"Identical graph bytes could not load because the saved path differed","zh":"第一次C24在66秒后停止，模型构造还没完成。保存的父检查点把连接组文件的实际路径也写进了严格合同。新任务把相同字节的图放到另一个目录，路径不同就被拒绝。没有训练样本或更新。这是来源元数据兼容问题。下一版先核验新旧文件哈希、尺寸、结构和其他合同，再只在调用原恢复器期间桥接这个路径字段，随后恢复实际新路径；图与检查点文件不改。","en":"The first C24 job stopped after sixty-six seconds during model construction. Restoration checked the graph's physical source path as well as its contents. The new task had placed byte-identical graph data in a different directory, causing rejection before any training samples or updates. I checked both files, dimensions, graph structure and the other required fields, then translated only the source-path metadata during the original loader call. The current path was restored afterwards; neither graph nor checkpoint files were rewritten.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-164","summary_en":"The graph bytes matched, but restoration rejected its new file path. I verified the graph and bridged only that path metadata.","summary_zh":"图数据相同，恢复程序却拒绝新路径。我核对图结构，只转换这项路径元数据。"},{"title_zh":"秒级申请被Slurm向上取整，启动检查又拒绝了","title_en":"Slurm rounded the time request, and startup rejected it","zh":"第二次修了图路径，但作业只运行三秒又退出。申请时间是11小时58分48秒，调度器按分钟向上取成11小时59分，检查程序却要求秒数完全相等。它在创建运行目录、加载模型和启动车辆前就停止了，图路径修复也还没有真实GPU恢复结果。下一版改成整分钟申请，并把依赖的阶段时限一起对齐，再执行同一长路线任务。","en":"The second attempt contained the graph-path repair but stopped after three seconds. The requested duration was 11 hours, 58 minutes and 48 seconds. Slurm rounded it up to 11 hours and 59 minutes, while startup demanded an exact match in seconds. No run directory, model or vehicle was created, so the GPU had not yet exercised the graph-path repair. I used a whole-minute request and aligned the dependent phase clocks for the next attempt at the same task.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-165","summary_en":"The scheduler rounded the requested duration, and an exact-equality check rejected it. I used a whole-minute request for the next attempt.","summary_zh":"调度器把请求时长向上取整，严格相等检查因此拒绝启动。我在下一次使用整分钟请求。"},{"title_zh":"学习完成47,936步后，日志容量使运行停止","title_en":"Training reached 47,936 samples before a recording limit stopped it","zh":"第三次C24开始实际学习，共接受52,302条新记录、优化47,936个不同样本，执行2,996次更新。随后重置姿态反复写进单个审计日志，达到16 MiB上限，作业在7,629秒后失败。名字中有“numeric audit”，但实际是日志容量错误，记录没有指向数值爆炸。32,768样本的四条开发道路只有小幅改善，没有终点，47,936失败权重没有后续驾驶评估。下一版把完整姿态无损压缩成独立哈希文件，摘要只保留引用，并从失败权重继续新的学习量。","en":"The third C24 attempt accepted 52,302 transitions, optimized 47,936 distinct transitions and completed 2,996 updates. Repeated full reset poses then filled a sixteen-MiB audit log, stopping the job after 7,629 seconds. Despite the exception's numeric-audit name, the recorded failure was log capacity, not numerical divergence. The 32,768-transition checkpoint had shown small development-road gains and no endpoint; the 47,936-transition failure checkpoint had no later driving evaluation. I moved complete poses to lossless compressed files with hashes and compact summary references, then continued from that saved model.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-166","summary_en":"Learning stopped because repeated reset records filled a log limit. I moved complete poses into compressed files before continuing from the saved checkpoint.","summary_zh":"重复的重置记录填满日志上限，学习因此停止。我把完整姿态移入压缩文件，再从保存检查点继续。"},{"title_zh":"学习时只算需要的列，先核验状态与梯度是否相同","title_en":"Test states and gradients before reducing learner computation","zh":"这项工程检查发生在C24 R3内部、首次更新之前，后续R6又重新验收。此前大部分时间在重算循环历史，学习阶段许多固定计算列却没使用。候选让学习使用较窄形状，仍用当前权重重放完整保存历史，再与原固定三十二列计算比较。R3的896项数值比较、十六项梯度记录和二十四条实际采集概率重放都通过；父参数和优化器未变，检查本身不驾车。随后才采用新形状学习，保留失败时退回原实现的路径，没有从这项验收直接声称整体加速。","en":"History reconstruction dominated learning time, while many columns in the fixed arithmetic batch were unused. Before R3's first update, I tested a narrower learner calculation against the thirty-two-column reference, still rebuilding full saved histories with current weights. R3 passed 896 numerical comparisons, sixteen gradient checks and twenty-four replays of collected action probabilities. The check itself changed neither parent parameters nor optimizer state and ran no vehicle. The narrower calculation was then used for learning, with the reference retained as a fallback, and checked again in R6. End-to-end speed still required its own measurement.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-167","summary_en":"History reconstruction wasted work on unused batch columns. I checked states and gradients before using a narrower learner calculation.","summary_zh":"重建历史时，未使用的批量列也在耗费计算。我先检查状态和梯度，再采用更窄的学习计算。"},{"title_zh":"车辆已在目标处，最近投影却跳到远处回环","title_en":"Reset reached the target, but route projection selected a distant branch","zh":"R4成功恢复R3的权重和完整优化器，也完成初始评估。但训练重置时，车辆虽然静止在命令起点，整个道路的最近投影却选中空间相邻、路线编号很远的另一段。保存的240帧都被旧偏移检查拒绝；按命令锚点检查，末帧偏移误差只有约0.00000394。397秒后停止，没有新训练。下一步用命令锚点附近的局部关联验收重置，同时保留全局投影作诊断，避免把错误路线关联当作放宽物理位置容差的理由。","en":"R4 restored the R3 model and optimizer and completed its initial evaluations. During training reset, the car was stationary at the requested start, but unrestricted nearest-route matching selected a nearby branch much farther along the road. All 240 saved frames failed the old offset check. Relative to the commanded start, the final offset error was only about 0.00000394. The job stopped after 397 seconds without learning. I changed reset acceptance to match locally around the commanded anchor, keeping global projection for diagnosis and leaving physical placement tolerance unchanged.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-168","summary_en":"The car was correctly placed, but route matching jumped to a distant branch. I matched reset positions locally around the requested start.","summary_zh":"车辆放置正确，路线匹配却跳到远处支路。我改为在要求起点附近做局部匹配。"},{"title_zh":"训练32,768个新驾驶步后变化很小，预热又超限","title_en":"More training barely changed driving; reset then exceeded its limit","zh":"R5继续R3失败检查点，采用局部锚点重置。它优化32,768个新样本，开发道路的合格弯道仍是0、0、2、8，驾驶进展一例略升、三例略降。无损姿态文件展开后超过旧16 MiB限制，说明日志修复确实发挥作用。随后从评估返回训练，半秒不计分预热收到约0.8秒、十六个窗口，比允许量多一个窗口，于是拒绝。额外窗口原因未查明。下一步保留此失败，建立新的已核验静止边界，并根据梯度证据选择一个学习路径改动。","en":"R5 resumed the R3 failure checkpoint with local-anchor reset checks and optimized 32,768 new transitions. Development bend counts stayed at 0, 0, 2 and 8. Progress rose slightly on one road and fell slightly on three. The new lossless pose files exceeded the former sixteen-MiB ceiling without the logging failure. After evaluation, however, a requested half-second unscored warmup lasted about 0.8 seconds and sixteen windows, one beyond its accepted bound. The extra window's cause remained unknown. I saved the failure, required a fresh verified stationary boundary and used gradient evidence to choose a focused learning-path change.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-169","summary_en":"The logging fix held during training, but a later warmup exceeded its bound by a frame. Driving had changed little, so I next examined the learning signals.","summary_zh":"日志修复经受了训练，但随后预热多出一帧而超限。驾驶变化很小，我接着检查学习信号。"},{"title_zh":"让转向误差继续训练核心，把回报预测误差挡在核心之外","title_en":"Let steering train the core while limiting where value errors propagate","zh":"R5的策略和内部参数都在变化，驾驶却近乎不变。少量分项检查显示，预测未来回报的误差有时比动作选择的误差更大，而且方向相反。于是R6只改一条学习路径：动作选择仍把误差传回神经核心；回报预测读取同样的下行神经元数值，但在核心边界截断它的误差。这叫梯度路由。外部共享读出仍由两种目标学习，旧优化器历史也保留。实际48次分项检查确认目标路径实施。65,536新样本后，两条开发路明显增加路内时间和弯道，另两条近乎不变，保留路提升很小、无终点。结论是实现生效、结果混合；接着优先修新批次首动作回显问题。","en":"R5 changed parameters and actions but barely changed driving. Component probes showed that return-prediction errors sometimes generated larger core gradients in the opposite direction to action-selection gradients. R6 therefore stopped return-prediction gradients at the core boundary while continuing to train the core from action selection. The shared external head still learned from both objectives, and saved optimizer history was restored. Forty-eight component probes checked this gradient routing. After 65,536 new transitions, two development roads gained substantial inside-road time and bend passes, while two changed little. Held-out gains were small and no endpoint was reached. I next investigated recurring old-command reports on the first action after an update barrier.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-170","summary_en":"Stopping value-error gradients at the core boundary improved some roads, but not all. Command-report failures became the next engineering priority.","summary_zh":"在核心边界停止价值误差梯度，改善了部分道路，却没有全面改善。命令回传故障随后成为工程重点。"},{"title_zh":"样本目标完成，二十九次旧命令回显被排除","title_en":"The sample target completed, with twenty-nine stale-command echoes excluded","zh":"R6正常完成65,536个新优化样本和4,096次更新，实际接受70,336条记录。二十九次无效间隔都发生在新采集批次的首动作，端点转向回显与上一批最后的动作吻合，而不是新请求。这些间隔被排除、车辆恢复，未生成奖励或训练行。其余4,800条未优化记录来自明确的批次裁切，属于另一类。作业用12,137秒，终态材料确认完成与一次结算。下一步调查更新后控制恢复的时序，保持原回显容差。","en":"R6 completed 65,536 newly optimized transitions and 4,096 updates from 70,336 accepted transitions. Twenty-nine invalid intervals occurred on the first action of a new collection batch: endpoint steering reports matched the preceding batch's last accepted command instead of the new request. Those intervals received no reward or training row and triggered recovery. Separately, ordinary batch trimming left 4,800 accepted transitions unoptimized. The allocation lasted 12,137 seconds; terminal records confirmed completion and one resource settlement. The next work examined resuming control after updates while keeping the steering-report tolerance.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-171","summary_en":"Training completed, while stale command reports were excluded and reset separately. I investigated why they occurred just after learner updates.","summary_zh":"训练完成了，旧命令回传区间被单独排除并重置。我调查它们为何集中在学习更新后的首个动作。"},{"title_zh":"首动作修复尚未测试，重置先被陈旧检查挡住","title_en":"Reset failed before the first-action repair could be tested","zh":"R7从R6最终检查点开始，准备在恢复采集前确认新动作已经生效。但初始训练重置先失败：接收函数还没读取已排队的数据，就发现距上次接收超过一秒并拒绝。保存日志显示请求的回复后来在收尾时被读到了。作业1,032秒停止，新的接收交接与学习计数全为零，所以首动作修复没有被验收。下一版只针对不计分锚点查询，先建立有界、完整表示和静止的新接收边界。","en":"R7 restored the final R6 model to test fresh command acceptance after updates, but initial training reset failed first. The receiver rejected its last vehicle-data timestamp as more than one second old before reading the queued reply. Saved logs showed that the reply was read later during cleanup. The job stopped after 1,032 seconds with no new command handoffs or learning, leaving the intended first-action repair untested. I next introduced a bounded fresh-receive procedure around the unscored anchor query, with complete image processing and verified stationarity.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-172","summary_en":"Reset rejected old telemetry before reading the queued reply, so the intended action fix was never tested. I repaired the receive boundary first.","summary_zh":"重置在读取队列中的回复前就拒绝了旧遥测，原动作修复尚未测到。我先修正接收边界。"},{"title_zh":"能读取消息后，回复预算又包含了主机处理时间","title_en":"Receiving worked, but the reply timer included host processing","zh":"R8实际进入接收和表示过程，不再只在旧时间戳前停止。但三十二个重置预检中十个仍失败，预算把相机表示、主机审计和生产者已经暂停的工作都算进原两秒回复窗口。131秒后停止，没有初始驾驶评估或新学习。另有一个环境的单次原始失败随后重试成功，不能与十个最终预检失败混为一谈。下一版记录真正接收活动和已核验暂停时间，保留完整帧与硬截止，再检验。","en":"R8 reached reception and image processing rather than reject only the old timestamp, but ten of thirty-two reset prechecks failed. Their reply timer included camera processing, host auditing and work done while the producer was verified paused. The job stopped after 131 seconds, before initial driving evaluation or learning. Another raw failure in one environment later retried successfully; it was separate from the ten final failures. I next recorded active receiving and paused host work separately, keeping complete frames and the hard deadlines.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-173","summary_en":"The reply timer included image processing while the simulator was paused. I separated active receiving time from paused host work.","summary_zh":"回复计时把模拟器暂停时的图像处理也算了进去。我分开记录实际接收与暂停期间的主机工作。"},{"title_zh":"同一状态切换用了两个时钟读数，记账出现重叠","title_en":"Two clock reads made an interval appear to overlap itself","zh":"R9增加了定量时间记录，却在核验中发现“运行中工作被计入暂停”。源代码与原日志显示，同一次恢复先记录一次真实时刻，随后记账又读一次；两者相差几微秒，就把运行事件放进旧暂停区间。二十六个标成接受的原始重置都没通过最终时序核验，另有六个真实截止失败，整个预检未发布，学习为零。下一步让同一切换共用一个实际捕获时刻；另外把同时重置限制为八个，保留严格的原进程身份检查，处理真实主机开销。","en":"R9's timing records exposed an overlap between running work and a supposedly paused interval. The resume transition used two clock readings: one for verification and a later one for accounting. A few microseconds therefore placed a running event inside the preceding paused span. All twenty-six resets initially labelled accepted failed timing validation, and six other resets hit deadlines. The aggregate startup check never completed and learning stayed at zero. I changed the transition to use one captured timestamp and limited reset concurrency to eight, retaining full process verification.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-174","summary_en":"Two clock reads gave contradictory running and paused intervals. I used one transition timestamp and reduced reset concurrency.","summary_zh":"同一次切换读取两次时钟，造成运行与暂停区间重叠。我改用单一切换时刻，并降低重置并发。"},{"title_zh":"更快身份检查曾写成候选，但没有投入运行","title_en":"A faster identity check was prepared but remained unused","zh":"时间分析发现，大部分活动预算与完整进程身份核验重叠。于是曾准备一个候选：在独占阶段两端做完整文件哈希，中间只核查进程和文件身份。它通过了纯测试，却没有被整合、部署或实际计时。最终选择先保留每次完整核验，把不计分重置分批，最多八个同时进行。这条未采用方案保留在时间线，说明我考虑过什么，也避免把源代码候选讲成已经验证的加速。","en":"Timing analysis showed substantial overhead from complete process-identity checks. One candidate proposed full file hashes only at exclusive-control boundaries, with lighter process and file checks between them. It passed code-only tests but was never integrated, deployed or timed. I instead kept full verification and limited unscored resets to groups of at most eight. The unused candidate remained a proposed optimization, not a measured speed improvement.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-175","summary_en":"A faster process-check design passed code tests but was not deployed. I kept full checks and chose smaller reset groups instead.","summary_zh":"更快的进程检查方案通过了代码测试，但没有部署。我保留完整检查，改选较小的重置分组。"},{"title_zh":"八个一批重置后训练完成，驾驶改善仍很小","title_en":"Resetting eight cars at a time enabled training with little driving change","zh":"R10仍从R6最终65,536样本检查点继续；R7到R9都没有新优化。它把同一状态切换统一用一个真实时间戳，不计分重置最多八个一批，学习采集仍有二十四辆车。实际重置、动作交接、更新、保存、评估后返回训练的检查全部通过。最终优化49,152个新样本。开发道路弯道数仍为5、6、0、0，驾驶只小幅变化，选择器保留32,768中间检查点，而不是最新最终版本。留出道路上选中策略略有增加但无终点。下一步不再把参数更新当成驾驶进步，改用真实画面、转向变化、偏移和奖励分量寻找具体行为问题。","en":"R10 again restored the final R6 checkpoint at 65,536 transitions; R7–R9 had made no updates. It used one timestamp per transition and reset at most eight simulators at once, retaining twenty-four training collectors. Reset, command handoff, update, save, evaluation and return-to-training checks all passed. It optimized 49,152 new transitions, but development bend counts stayed at 5, 6, 0 and 0, with small driving changes. Selection kept the 32,768-transition intermediate checkpoint. That model had small held-out duration gains and no endpoint. With the execution cycle working, I next examined images, steering, deviation and reward components for a behavioural intervention.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-176","summary_en":"Batched resets let the full learning cycle complete, but driving changed little. I kept the selected intermediate model and inspected the recordings.","summary_zh":"分组重置让完整学习循环跑通，但驾驶改善很小。我保留选中的中间模型，继续检查回放。"},{"title_zh":"明显偏离时仍获得较大前进奖励","title_en":"The reward still credited progress during visible deviation","zh":"回放显示转向并非常量，核心状态也在变化，但失败位置差不多，最终转向跳变反而增大。把同一动作的奖励拆开看，某个偏移0.509、航向误差负17.26度的时刻，仍有正0.04365奖励。前进项常比偏离项大，而动作变化代价很小。这不是看到正奖励就判定程序错误，而是给下一轮系数选择具体尺度。随后只在保存行为上重新计分检查，不能预测新策略轨迹，再制定R11的新奖励目标。","en":"The saved drives showed changing steering and core state, similar failure locations and larger final steering changes. Reward decomposition supplied a concrete example: at offset 0.509 and heading error −17.26 degrees, one step still received positive reward 0.04365. Progress often outweighed deviation cost, and steering-change cost was very small. That balance motivated a revised objective rather than establish a coding error. I checked the new reward on existing actions offline, leaving its effect on newly trained driving for the next experiment.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-177","summary_en":"Saved reward components showed that progress could outweigh substantial tracking errors. I used that measurement to design the next reward change.","summary_zh":"保存的奖励分解显示，明显偏离时前进奖励仍可能占优。我据此设计下一次奖励修改。"},{"title_zh":"提高偏离和平滑代价，再加入航向误差","title_en":"Increase deviation and smoothness costs, then add heading error","zh":"R11从R10选中的32,768样本检查点和完整优化器开始。根据回放里的奖励尺度，把偏离系数从0.05提高到0.20，转向变化系数从0.001提高到0.05，再加入随航向误差增大的代价。几何量只用于算奖励，策略仍只看相机输入。学习率、核心结构、动作、起点和控制验收保持。24,576个新样本完成后，四条开发路平均每步转向变化在选中的16,384版本减少约25.5%，最终减少约21.9%。驾驶和恢复只有小变，终点仍为零。因此当时结论是更平滑但还没有稳定解决大偏离；下一步检查未返回的具体轨迹，而不是继续只增加惩罚。","en":"R11 restored R10's selected 32,768-transition checkpoint and optimizer. I increased the deviation coefficient from 0.05 to 0.20 and steering-change coefficient from 0.001 to 0.05, and added heading-error cost. Geometry supplied reward, while the policy still saw camera-derived input. Learning rates, core, actions, starts and physical checks stayed unchanged. The run completed 24,576 new transitions. Across four development roads, mean consecutive steering change fell about 25.5% at the selected 16,384-transition checkpoint and 21.9% at the final checkpoint. Driving and recovery changed little, with no endpoints. Steering became smoother, but large departures persisted. I next inspected unrecovered trajectories and steering–heading response.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-178","summary_en":"Stronger tracking and steering-change costs made commands smoother, but did not solve large departures.","summary_zh":"更强的跟踪和转向变化代价让命令更平滑，却没有解决大偏离。"},{"title_zh":"修改当前导入时误动了历史声明","title_en":"An import rename also changed a historical declaration","zh":"R11第一次源代码部署在历史清单检查处拒绝。为了切换当前策略而做的导入改名范围过大，也改到了必须原样保留的R7声明。它没有分配GPU或提交训练。修正版只恢复正确历史声明，并增加旧读取器和所有权清单的精确相等检查，放到新的部署目录。实际源代码入口核验通过后才提交一次R11。这个准备错误与后面的奖励实验结果分开记录。","en":"The first R11 deployment failed a check of historical source files. An import rename intended to select the active policy had also changed a protected R7 declaration. No GPU was allocated and no training submitted. I restored the historical declaration, checked the old reader and process-control inventory explicitly, and prepared a new deployment directory. The real source entry then passed before one R11 submission. This preparation failure preceded the reward experiment.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-179","summary_en":"An import edit also changed a historical declaration and stopped preparation. I narrowed the edit before submitting the actual experiment.","summary_zh":"一次导入修改连带改到了历史声明，准备过程因此停止。我缩小修改范围后才提交实际实验。"},{"title_zh":"运行时恢复一次，与画面里的返回道路分别计数","title_en":"Distinguish software recovery from returning to the road","zh":"R11作业正常完成，接受27,968条记录，优化24,576个新样本，执行1,536次更新。只有一次接口命令回显不符，记录被排除后恢复运行；20条审计记录描述普通批次保留和裁切；已接受但未用于优化的转移共有3,392条。作业用了5,322秒。选中的16,384样本版本在四条留出道路上时长略增，所有终点仍为零。这里的“一次恢复”指接口恢复，不是车辆从偏离中开回来。后者要用相机、位置和时间单独测，下一项就是这次行为复核。","en":"R11 completed in 5,322 seconds, accepting 27,968 transitions, optimizing 24,576 and performing 1,536 updates. One steering-report mismatch was excluded and followed by interface recovery. Twenty other audit entries described ordinary batch retention; separately from the rejected interval, 3,392 accepted transitions were not optimized. The selected 16,384-transition policy lasted slightly longer on four held-out roads but reached no endpoint. I distinguished interface recovery, which restored a usable connection, from the vehicle steering back into its target band. The next audit measured the latter from saved images, poses and times.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-180","summary_en":"The run completed. I counted interface restarts separately from a car steering back to the road, since they measure different kinds of recovery.","summary_zh":"本次运行完成。我把接口恢复与车辆主动回路分别统计，因为两者测量的是不同事情。"},{"title_zh":"跨过中间参照后有返回，但这个能力原先就存在","title_en":"One return after a reference crossing already occurred in the parent policy","zh":"我观察到越过中线后容易失败，因此我复核二十次完整固定权重驾驶。这里先区分目标车道路径、道路中间参照和相机里实际油漆线。按明确的持续越侧与返回规则，找到二十一次越侧、三次稳定返回；三次其实是同一条开发道路上初始、选中、最终策略重复的一次早期偏移。返回延迟由7.20秒变成6.05或6.20秒，选中版本之后还开了118.55秒。其他十八次没有稳定返回。由此看到有限恢复原先就有，改善很小；这些相关重复不能当独立成功率。下一步继续看未恢复的大偏离过程。","en":"I inspected twenty complete drives with fixed weights after noticing failures around middle-line crossings. The target-lane route, source-supported road midpoint and visible paint line were treated separately. Explicit crossing-and-return rules identified twenty-one crossings and three stable returns. All three were the same early excursion on one development road, repeated with the initial, selected and final policies. Return delay changed from 7.20 seconds to 6.05 or 6.20; the selected model then drove for another 118.55 seconds. The other eighteen crossings had no stable return. Limited recovery already existed before R11, with only a small timing change. I next focused on the larger unrecovered departures.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-181","summary_en":"A few returns already existed in the parent policy and recurred on the same road. I examined the many larger departures that still had no stable return.","summary_zh":"父策略原先就有少量返回，并在同一道路重复出现。我接着检查那些仍未稳定返回的大偏离。"},{"title_en":"Teach correction from disturbed starts","zh":"到这里，系统已经能从普通起点驾驶，但“偏出去后回到中心”与“回去后保持住”还是两个问题。我选用R11在新增16,384个优化样本时保存的版本，同时恢复权重和优化器的记忆，不用它的最后版本。新增的选择是训练起点：每台车第一次仍从原处开始，之后按一半普通、四分之一向负侧外偏、四分之一向正侧外偏循环。偏移为0.20，朝外角度为5度。\n\n优先改起点，是为了让控制器实际遇到需要纠偏的状态。相机、动作、奖励和学习设置保持原样。我预先把结果分成进入目标带、连续保持五秒、再稳定十秒。这样，短暂经过中心就不会被写成稳定恢复。R12先完成了实现和检查，真正的学习却在启动预检前停住；同一科学问题随后由R13继续。","en":"I selected the R11 intermediate checkpoint at 16,384 newly optimized transitions and restored its weights and optimizer state. To teach correction directly, each car first used its original start, then reset through a cycle containing half ordinary starts, one quarter negative-outward starts and one quarter positive-outward starts. Disturbed starts used offset 0.20 and an outward heading of five degrees. Camera, actions, reward and learning settings stayed unchanged. I scored entry into the target band, a five-second hold and another ten seconds of stability separately. R12 implemented this experiment but stopped at startup; R13 later executed the same scientific comparison.","title_zh":"把离开中心且朝外的起点纳入学习","id":"step-182","summary_en":"I mixed ordinary starts with measured outward starts to teach correction. Entering the band and remaining stable were scored separately.","summary_zh":"我把普通起点与实测朝外起点混合，用来训练纠偏。进入目标带和持续稳定分别计分。"},{"title_en":"Make room for the next experiment","zh":"开始前，磁盘余量和文件条目都不满足原有启动检查。直接提交只会把问题推到运行中。我先找出已结束作业里字节完全相同的模拟器静态文件，把重复副本改成指向同一内容的硬链接。实际完成41,299个链接，释放约8.46GB分配块下界，重新读取的磁盘余量和63,154个空闲条目通过检查。研究数据、权重和失败记录保留。这一步解决的是运行空间，随后才准备R12入口。","en":"Disk space and free file entries were below the startup limits. I found byte-identical simulator assets in completed jobs and replaced duplicate storage with hard links. The operation made 41,299 links and released a measured lower bound of about 8.46 billion allocated bytes. Fresh quota readings passed, including 63,154 free entries. Research data, weights and failure records were retained. This restored room for the planned experiment without changing its model or producing a new driving result.","title_zh":"先解决磁盘和文件数量不足","id":"step-183","summary_en":"Disk and file-entry limits blocked startup. Sharing verified duplicate simulator files restored capacity while preserving research records.","summary_zh":"磁盘和文件数限制阻挡启动。我让已核对的重复模拟器文件共享存储，在保留研究记录的同时腾出容量。"},{"title_en":"The submission entry could not import its new policy","zh":"准备阶段先修了部署端提前导入、旧训练量检查和恢复报告边界，形成最终A4。它部署成功后，提交端重建配置却又在设置导入目录前使用新策略，所以仍找不到模块。此时尚未调用Slurm，没有作业编号或GPU消耗。我保留A4，另加先核验文件、再建立11个真实导入根的外层入口。真实verify-only通过后，才产生唯一的2304927作业。部署端能运行，没有覆盖提交端这条实际路径。","en":"Preparation repaired premature imports, an old training-count check and recovery-reporting boundaries, producing package A4. Deployment passed, but the separate submission script imported the new policy before setting up its module paths. It failed before calling Slurm, so no job or GPU allocation existed. I retained A4 and added an outer launcher that checked the files before establishing the eleven import roots. A verification-only execution then passed, followed by the single job 2304927. The failure showed that the submission path needed testing separately from deployment.","title_zh":"提交脚本过早导入新策略","id":"step-184","summary_en":"Deployment passed, but the separate submission script imported the new policy too early. I fixed and checked that entry before submitting once.","summary_zh":"部署检查通过，独立提交脚本却过早导入新策略。我修复并检查这个入口后，才进行一次正式提交。"},{"title_en":"A metadata preflight stopped before any model was built","zh":"真正的R12作业只运行了22秒。它先让32个子进程检查并发写记录，31个正常退出，第29号写者在停止信号原子发布附近读取控制文件时失败。此时还没有图形、神经模型、父权重恢复或学习。记录支持文件发布交界的身份竞态，但失败瞬间的链接数没有保存，具体旧inode原因仍是推断。下一步因此修文件读取协议，训练起点的科学设置不变。","en":"R12 lasted 22 seconds. Its first test ran 32 metadata writers: thirty-one exited normally, while writer 29 failed reading the control file near publication of the stop signal. Graphics, model construction, parent restoration and learning had not started. The record placed the failure at a concurrent file-publication boundary, but did not save the failing inode's link count, leaving that particular low-level explanation uncertain. I repaired the reader for the next attempt without changing the planned training-start experiment.","title_zh":"R12在元数据写入预检结束时停止","id":"step-185","summary_en":"A metadata reader raced with a file replacement before graphics or learning started. I changed it to read one consistent file version.","summary_zh":"图形和学习启动前，元数据读取遇到文件替换冲突。我改为读取同一份一致的文件版本。"},{"title_en":"Read a consistent version of the control file","zh":"我没有取消文件身份检查，而是让一次读取绑定到一个完整、仍有效的文件版本。新读取器在读前后核对同一文件描述符的九项身份，要求链接数仍为一；遇到已失效描述符，只能在原截止时间内有限重开。R13的实际32个I/O子进程全部正常结束，系统终于到达模型恢复和学习。历史失败的底层状态仍保留未知，但这个运行边界已经有了实测通过的版本。","en":"The revised reader checked nine identity fields on the same open file descriptor before and after reading, and required its link count to stay one. If replacement invalidated the descriptor, it could reopen the file only a bounded number of times within the original deadline. In R13, all 32 I/O child processes exited normally, allowing restoration and learning. The historical inode state remained unknown; the revised reading procedure now had a measured pass.","title_zh":"在原子替换时读取一个完整且仍有效的控制文件","id":"step-186","summary_en":"The revised reader verified one file descriptor throughout each read. The next run passed that check and reached learning.","summary_zh":"修改后的读取器在整次读取中核对同一文件描述符。下一次运行通过了检查，进入学习。"},{"title_en":"More recovery starts did not produce more stable recovery","zh":"R13重新从R11选中的16,384样本检查点开始，恢复完整优化器，再执行前面设计的双侧外偏起点训练。它接受17,280条新转移，其中16,384条进入优化，完成1,024次更新；每条优化样本被使用四次，合计65,536次样本使用。训练和52个评估案例都保留下来。\n\n结果把“能回去”和“能待住”分开了。父策略和新策略都在16个外偏起点进入目标带，但五秒确认从10例降到4例，随后十秒稳定从2例降到0例。普通道路有个别弯道改善，仍没有路线完成。因此，单靠增加外偏经历没有解决稳定纠偏。接下来我先查动作是否正确传到车上，再查奖励和更新怎样影响对齐。","en":"R13 restarted from the selected R11 checkpoint and full optimizer state. Outward-start training accepted 17,280 new transitions, optimized 16,384 distinct transitions four times each and completed 1,024 updates, giving 65,536 sample uses. All 52 evaluation cases were saved. Both parent and trained model entered the band in all sixteen disturbed starts, but five-second confirmations fell from ten cases to four, and subsequent ten-second stability fell from two to zero. Some ordinary-road bend results improved, but no normal drive completed its route. Adding recovery starts had not solved stable correction. I next checked command delivery, reward and update behaviour.","title_zh":"向外起点训练完成，但稳定恢复下降","id":"step-187","summary_en":"More disturbed-start experience did not improve stable recovery: both policies entered the band, but the trained one held it less often.","summary_zh":"增加扰动起点经验没有改善稳定恢复：两版都能进入目标带，训练后反而更少保持住。"},{"title_en":"Check command delivery before changing the learning objective","zh":"R13再次偏航，首先要排除动作传递错误。我核对23,565个评估动作，要求转向与保存的执行回显只差浮点误差，没有发现新增缩放或整步延迟。再看原奖励：在偏移0.1、朝向5度、步长0.2秒时，两项误差代价合计约0.00198，典型进度奖励约0.07。坏动作的优势多数仍为负，所以没有直接发现PPO或GAE坏了。下一轮只检验更重视对齐的目标。","en":"I checked all 23,565 R13 evaluation actions to see whether requested steering reached the reported endpoint. Requests and reports agreed at floating-point precision, with no new scaling error or whole-step delay observed. I then examined reward: at offset 0.1, heading error five degrees and a 0.2-second step, distance and heading costs totalled about 0.00198 against typical progress reward around 0.07. Most recoverable poor-action advantages—the estimates used by PPO to favour or discourage actions—were still negative. The analysis did not identify broken PPO or its GAE advantage calculation. It motivated a focused test of stronger alignment costs.","title_zh":"先排查转向传递，再检查奖励是否重视对齐","id":"step-188","summary_en":"Steering requests matched the car's reported commands. Reward inspection then motivated testing a stronger alignment objective.","summary_zh":"转向请求与车辆报告的命令一致。随后的奖励检查促使我测试更强的对齐目标。"},{"title_en":"A stronger alignment objective helped briefly, then relapsed","zh":"R14仍从同一R11选中检查点开始，避免把R13已经变化的权重也带进比较。它只替换距离和朝向代价：小误差按平方增长，大误差按线性增长；参考尺度分别是0.1距离单位和5度。在0.2秒步长的联合边界，两项代价合计变为0.04。动作、进度奖励、学习率和PPO保留。\n\n这次也完成16,384条新优化转移和1,024次更新。五秒确认由13/16升到15/16，随后十秒稳定由1/16升到4/16。不过，这四例后来全部再次离开窄带；一条普通保留路的驾驶时间从约562秒降到152秒。我得到的是有限时间窗的恢复收益与普通驾驶损失。下一步转向更新过程，检查共同裁剪是否把不同参数的学习绑在一起。","en":"R14 restarted from the same selected R11 model, rather than inherit R13's trained weights. It changed only distance and heading costs: quadratic near zero, with linear tails at larger errors, using reference scales 0.1 units and five degrees. At the joint boundary for a 0.2-second step, the two costs totalled 0.04. Other steering, progress and learning settings stayed fixed. After 16,384 new optimized transitions and 1,024 updates, five-second confirmations rose from 13/16 to 15/16 and subsequent ten-second stability from one case to four. All four later left the band again. One ordinary held-out drive fell from about 562 to 152 seconds. I next examined the shared gradient limit behind this mixed result.","title_zh":"加重小偏离的代价，短期稳定有改善但随后仍离开","id":"step-189","summary_en":"Stronger alignment costs improved short recovery holds, but the gains were temporary and one ordinary drive became much shorter.","summary_zh":"更强对齐代价改善了短时恢复保持，但改善短暂，一次普通驾驶还明显缩短。"},{"title_en":"The common gradient limit was active almost every update","zh":"共同裁剪会把一次更新的全部梯度一起缩小。R14的1,024次更新中，它触发了1,023次。我再看13个分量探针：核心收到了动作目标的梯度，价值目标在核心为零；外部读出却有动作与价值共享的中间层。共同限制确实把这些更新耦合起来，但记录没有显示每次都由价值梯度主导或更新爆炸。因此下一步只分开核心和读出的裁剪预算，检验这个具体选择。","en":"Gradient clipping scales update signals together when their combined norm exceeds a limit. The common clip activated in 1,023 of R14's 1,024 updates. Thirteen component probes showed action gradients reaching the core and zero value gradients there, while the external readout still shared a trunk between action selection and value prediction. The common limit therefore coupled these updates. The probes did not show value gradients dominating every time or an exploding optimizer. I next tested separate clipping budgets for core and readout.","title_zh":"共同梯度限制几乎每次更新都触发","id":"step-190","summary_en":"The common gradient limit acted almost every update and coupled the core and readout. I tested separate limits in the next experiment.","summary_zh":"共同梯度限制几乎每次更新都会触发，把核心和读出绑在一起。下一次实验分别限制两者。"},{"title_en":"Give the readout and core separate gradient limits","zh":"下一项选择是分开限制核心和读出的更新信号。核心范数上限设为0.05，读出上限约0.4975；两个上限合在一起，原来0.5的总界限仍保留。我继续选R11的同一检查点和完整优化器，同时使用R14奖励与双侧起点。这样，改变的是当前梯度预算分配，学习率、损失和模型结构都没有一起换。\n\n这是为共同裁剪耦合提出的一次实验，数值不是已经找出的最优值。R15虽然准备并提交了这套配置，实际却在图形启动前失败，尚未训练。后面R16到R18依次解决图形、证明重放和路径边界，直到R19才完成这项科学配置的完整学习。源码版本前进，与权重父节点前进是两回事。","en":"I set separate gradient-norm caps of 0.05 for the core and about 0.4975 for the readout, retaining the original combined bound of 0.5. The experiment again restored the selected R11 weights and full optimizer state and used R14's reward and two-sided starts. Learning rates, losses and architecture stayed unchanged. These caps were a chosen test, not an established optimum. R15 prepared the configuration but failed before graphics or training. R16–R18 addressed graphics, numerical validation and a path-handling error; R19 completed the scientific run. Throughout those revisions, the intended parent stayed R11 rather than weights from a failed intervening attempt.","title_zh":"分别限制核心和读出更新的梯度幅度","id":"step-191","summary_en":"I tested separate gradient limits for the core and readout. Several engineering attempts failed before R19 completed that experiment.","summary_zh":"我分别限制核心和读出的梯度。在R19完成实验之前，多次工程尝试先后失败。"},{"title_en":"A missing graphics-device directory stopped startup","zh":"这次作业运行27秒后结束。32个图形模拟器都在把已分配GPU的PCI身份映射到DRM路径时遇到文件不存在：实际上下文里没有/dev/dri。Xvfb、VirtualGL、Unity和神经模型都没有启动，裁剪实验也没有开始。我只确定了缺失的前提，没有足够历史状态把原因归到驱动升级或命名空间变化。下一步是在真实分配里做一次只读元数据检查。","en":"The R15 job ended after 27 seconds. All 32 graphics startups failed while locating the allocated GPU's device path because the environment had no /dev/dri directory. Xvfb, VirtualGL, Unity, the model and clipping experiment had not started. I had located a missing prerequisite but lacked comparable earlier device state to attribute it to a driver or namespace change. I next inspected the device metadata inside a short real allocation.","title_zh":"图形设备目录缺失，尚未开始测试裁剪","id":"step-192","summary_en":"Graphics startup stopped because a required device directory was missing. The learning experiment had not begun; I inspected the allocated environment.","summary_zh":"必要设备目录缺失，图形启动因此停止。学习实验尚未开始，我先检查实际分配环境。"},{"title_en":"Inspect the missing graphics prerequisite in an allocated job","zh":"这次只读固定的设备、模块和运行上下文，没有建立图形或模型。真实分配中再次没有/dev/dri，记录中有NVIDIA模块，但没有nvidia_drm项。探针本身极短，Slurm主行的计时为零秒。这个结果说明缺失在容器之前就可见，仍没有测试EGL是否可用，也没有重建R15失败时的底层原因。于是我研究能直接按硬件身份选择EGL的普通账户可用的路径。","en":"The inspection read device, module and environment metadata without starting graphics or a model. The allocated job again lacked /dev/dri. NVIDIA modules were listed, but nvidia_drm was absent. The probe was so short that Slurm's main row reported zero elapsed seconds. The missing directory was visible before entering the container. I next investigated direct EGL selection using the allocated hardware's identity; the diagnostic had not yet tested EGL or established the historical cause of R15's failure.","title_zh":"检查实际分配环境中的图形设备目录","id":"step-193","summary_en":"The same device directory was absent before entering the container. I investigated direct hardware rendering through the available account.","summary_zh":"进入容器前就已缺少同一设备目录。我转而检查当前账户能否直接使用硬件渲染。"},{"title_en":"The hardware context worked, but the pixel test failed","zh":"直接EGL试验先核对实际GPU的UUID和PCI，再建硬件图形上下文。初始化成功，渲染器确为L40；但2×2像素读回得到16个零，原颜色门失败。默认读写缓冲状态当时没有保存，因此不能把原因直接归给驱动。我保留这个一秒失败作业，下一版改用明确的RGBA8帧缓冲、明确读写目标和完整性检查，颜色容差保持原值。","en":"The direct-EGL test selected the GPU by UUID and PCI identity. Initialization worked and the renderer was L40, but the 2×2 pixel readback returned sixteen zeros and failed the original colour check. Default read and draw buffer settings were not saved, so this did not identify a driver cause. I retained the one-second failure and tested an explicit RGBA8 framebuffer with specified read/draw targets and completeness checks, using the same colour tolerance.","title_zh":"硬件渲染初始化成功，像素读回检查失败","id":"step-194","summary_en":"The hardware renderer initialized, but the pixel test returned zeros. I made the framebuffer and its readback settings explicit.","summary_zh":"硬件渲染器初始化成功，像素测试却读回全零。我明确指定帧缓冲及读回设置。"},{"title_en":"An explicit framebuffer passed the color check","zh":"改动只针对测量中的缓冲状态。四个像素实际都读回[32,127,223,255]，与目标[32,128,223,255]相差一，落在原容差内；当前图形上下文的UUID和PCI也匹配实际L40。这个一秒作业正常完成并清理退出。它为直接EGL路径提供了实测通过，但还没有启动VirtualGL或车辆。下一步把同样的身份和像素检查接到真实应用启动链。","en":"With the framebuffer explicitly configured, all four pixels returned [32,127,223,255], within the tolerance of one from the expected [32,128,223,255]. UUID and PCI checks matched the allocated L40. The one-second job completed and cleaned up. Direct EGL worked in that process; VirtualGL and the car had not yet started. I next carried the identity and pixel checks into the complete graphics startup sequence.","title_zh":"显式帧缓冲的像素读回通过","id":"step-195","summary_en":"The explicit framebuffer returned the expected colours. I next carried those hardware checks into the application startup path.","summary_zh":"明确帧缓冲后，读回颜色符合预期。我接着把这些硬件检查接入应用启动流程。"},{"title_en":"Slurm rejected Windows line endings before allocating a job","zh":"R16第一次提交在Slurm入口被拒：脚本还是Windows换行。没有作业编号，也没有运行训练，但原reservation仍在。我保留原脚本和拒绝记录，只在新的执行封套中转换为LF，再做bash语法与真实verify-only检查。修正后才产生2318469，而且沿用同一reservation。这是提交格式问题，不该算作两个GPU训练作业。","en":"Slurm rejected the first R16 submission because its script used Windows line endings. It created no job ID and ran no training, while the existing reservation remained. I saved the rejection, converted a separate execution script to LF and checked Bash syntax and the real verification-only entry. The corrected submission created job 2318469 under the same reservation. It was one allocated GPU attempt after a rejected submission, not two training allocations.","title_zh":"提交脚本的Windows换行在Slurm入口被拒","id":"step-196","summary_en":"The scheduler rejected Windows line endings before creating a job. I converted the submission script and checked its real entry point.","summary_zh":"调度器在创建作业前就拒绝了 Windows 换行。我转换提交脚本，并检查真实入口。"},{"title_en":"The first X server crashed before the vehicle started","zh":"真正分配后的R16运行29秒。第一台模拟器的Xvfb在初始化扩展时崩溃，堆栈同时经过软件渲染和NVIDIA EGL相关库。第一模拟器门因此阻止另外31个启动。直接EGL、VirtualGL、Unity、模型和裁剪都未到达。我知道崩溃位置，却没有唯一底层原因。下一项选择是只给私有X显示服务器软件Mesa环境，让独立硬件渲染子进程保留干净的NVIDIA环境。","en":"The allocated R16 job lasted 29 seconds. Its first Xvfb process crashed during extension initialization, with software-rendering and NVIDIA EGL-related libraries in the stack. Startup stopped before the other 31 simulators were launched. Direct EGL, VirtualGL, Unity, the model and clipping were not reached. The crash location was known, but its unique cause was not. I next isolated the private X server in a software-Mesa environment and kept hardware-rendering child processes in separate NVIDIA environments.","title_zh":"第一台Xvfb在扩展初始化中崩溃","id":"step-197","summary_en":"The private X server crashed before the vehicle or model started. I isolated software display setup from hardware-rendering processes.","summary_zh":"专用 X 服务器在车辆和模型启动前崩溃。我把软件显示环境与硬件渲染进程隔离。"},{"title_en":"Separate the X display server from hardware rendering","zh":"这个三秒诊断只启动私有Xvfb及图形客户端。X显示服务器使用llvmpipe软件渲染，其库映射没有NVIDIA EGL/GBM；独立EGL和VirtualGL子进程则在实际L40上通过UUID、PCI和原像素门。九个拥有的进程记录都正常退出。这样得到的是图形启动链的有限通过，还没有Unity或学习结果。下一轮必须重新把真实车辆、32个模拟器和原科学短检查一起跑通。","en":"The three-second diagnostic started only the private display server and graphics clients. Xvfb used llvmpipe software rendering, with no NVIDIA EGL or GBM libraries in its mapped library set. Separate EGL and VirtualGL children passed UUID, PCI and the original pixel checks on the allocated L40. All nine tracked processes exited cleanly. This verified the limited graphics sequence. The next run still needed to combine the vehicle, 32 simulators and the original short learning checks.","title_zh":"把软件显示服务与硬件渲染进程分开","id":"step-198","summary_en":"The isolated display and hardware clients passed the graphics checks. The full simulator-and-learning test still had to follow.","summary_zh":"隔离后的显示服务和硬件客户端通过了图形检查。随后仍需测试完整模拟器和学习流程。"},{"title_en":"Recover file capacity using already-backed-up camera copies","zh":"图形修复期间还遇到文件条目不足。我只选择已完整下载、逐张核验的R13和R14远程相机副本，研究记录与权重另列保护。第一清理入口因login架构不同而安全拒绝，第二版只修文件操作的架构门，随后一次清理9,005张重复JPEG。新quota显示38,321个空闲条目。本地原档和所有回放素材仍在，接下来才能在原余量门下启动R17。","en":"File-entry capacity also blocked startup. I selected only remote R13 and R14 camera copies with verified complete local backups, protecting research records and weights separately. The first cleanup entry rejected the login architecture. The second changed only that file-operation architecture check and removed 9,005 duplicate JPEGs. Fresh quota showed 38,321 free entries. Local archives and replay material remained available, restoring capacity for R17 under the existing limits.","title_zh":"清理已经完整备份的远程相机副本以恢复文件余量","id":"step-199","summary_en":"Backed-up camera duplicates were using needed file entries. Removing only those verified copies made room for the next run.","summary_zh":"已有备份的相机副本占用了所需文件数。我只清理核对过的副本，为下一次运行腾出空间。"},{"title_en":"Short training passed, but a floating-point check stopped the long run","zh":"R17终于经过图形与学习短周期，接受并优化1,920条新转移，完成120次Adam更新，八个短检查文件都已发布通过。但主控在接受长训练屏障前，重新核算裁剪证明时要求浮点数完全相同，因而拒绝。实际返回的24次裁剪最大总范数仍小于0.5，记录没有显示越界。我保留这段真实学习，也把主控未接纳长训练写清，接下来专查两个运行环境的标量重算。","en":"R17 reached graphics and completed short learning: 1,920 accepted and optimized new transitions and 120 Adam updates. All eight short-check files reported passes. Before allowing sustained training, the coordinator recomputed the gradient-clipping checks and required exact floating-point equality. It rejected that equality, although every saved total gradient norm after clipping was below 0.5. The record showed a validation failure, not a clipping-cap violation. I kept the completed short learning separately from the blocked long run and next compared the scalar recomputation under the two Python runtimes.","title_zh":"短时训练通过，浮点检查却挡住长训","id":"step-200","summary_en":"Short training completed, but the coordinator stopped the long run on an overly strict floating-point equality check. Recorded gradient norms stayed within the limit.","summary_zh":"短时训练完成，但协调程序因过严的浮点相等检查阻止长时训练。保存的梯度范数都在限制以内。"},{"title_en":"Exact gradient-norm comparisons differed across Python runtimes","zh":"我用同一份120次回调记录重算720个范数字段。本地Python3.12与保存值逐位一致，而login的Python3.9有203项不同，最大只差两个浮点末位单位；所有裁剪后范数仍在上限内。主控和学习端解释器不同，旧测试却只在同一解释器里回转JSON。下一版因此用已固定的客户端解释器执行原严格验证器，不改容差。原compute主控那次具体浮点值没保存，这一点保留为缺口。","en":"I recomputed 720 norm fields from the same 120 saved callbacks. Local Python 3.12 matched the saved values exactly, while the login host's Python 3.9 differed in 203 fields by at most two units in the last floating-point place. Every post-clipping norm remained within its limit. The learner and coordinator had used different interpreters; earlier tests had serialized and read JSON within one interpreter. I changed the coordinator to run the original strict validator through the pinned client interpreter, keeping its tolerance. The failed coordinator's exact recomputed values had not been saved.","title_zh":"不同Python版本重算同一梯度范数，出现微小差异","id":"step-201","summary_en":"Recomputing the same gradient norms differed slightly between Python versions. I ran the validator with the learner's pinned interpreter.","summary_zh":"不同 Python 版本重算同一批梯度范数时出现微小差异。我改用学习器指定的解释器执行验证。"},{"title_en":"Free space for file entries using backed-up data","zh":"R17保留之后，空闲文件条目再次低于30,000的原门。我另建计划，只处理已经本地备份的R10、R11和R17相机副本，保护469条研究、源和检查点路径。一次执行移除8,001张远程重复图像，新quota为33,513个空闲条目。删除数与净quota变化分别记录，旧素材没有丢。下一步才继续R18的真实入口检查。","en":"After R17 was archived, free file entries again fell below the original 30,000-entry limit. I selected backed-up R10, R11 and R17 camera copies for removal while protecting 469 research, source and checkpoint paths. One operation removed 8,001 remote duplicate images. Fresh quota then showed 33,513 free entries. Removed-file count and net quota change were recorded separately, and local material remained intact. R18 proceeded only after capacity checks passed.","title_zh":"下一次运行前，再次恢复可用文件数","id":"step-202","summary_en":"File capacity fell below the startup limit again. I removed verified remote image duplicates while protecting the retained local material.","summary_zh":"可用文件数再次低于启动要求。我清理已核对的远程图像副本，保留本地材料。"},{"title_en":"A relative task path was rejected before the replay child ran","zh":"R18把严格重放安排在图形和昂贵父评估之前，但运行22秒就停住。原shell传入相对task路径，调用者虽然已读取该task，却又把相对字符串交给要求绝对路径的证明构建器。32个I/O子进程正常结束；重放子进程、图形、模型都未启动。这是调用边界错误，原路径门本身应保留。R19接着在真实load_task之后统一路径，并把原recipe的实际参数纳入预检。","en":"R18 moved strict numerical replay ahead of graphics and expensive parent evaluations, but stopped after 22 seconds. The shell recipe passed a relative task path to a validation helper that required an absolute path, even though the caller had already read the task. All 32 I/O children exited normally; the replay child, graphics and model never started. I kept the absolute-path requirement and changed R19 to normalize the verified task path after loading it. Preparation then tested the argument used by the real recipe.","title_zh":"相对路径被要求绝对路径的检查拒绝","id":"step-203","summary_en":"A relative task path reached a helper that required an absolute path. I corrected the caller before trying the same experiment again.","summary_zh":"辅助程序要求绝对路径，调用方却传入相对任务路径。我修正调用方后，再尝试同一实验。"},{"title_en":"Separate gradient limits still reduced normal-road progress","zh":"R19修好调用边界后，终于完整执行分开裁剪预算的配置。它从R11选中版本恢复，不接R14或R17的权重。新接受17,280条转移，优化16,384条，完成1,024次更新；所有短检查和同客户端严格重放通过。\n\n这次恢复的五秒确认从11/16降到8/16，严格十秒稳定两边都没有观察到成功；其中候选四例确认后的跟踪不足，按删失保留。普通八路合格进度由513.15降到492.35，合格弯道47降到46，四路好、四路差，没有路线完成。保存的更新探针显示共同读出里价值与动作梯度可能相互干扰，但还不是失败的唯一原因。我先用现成的中间检查点做固定权重评估，判断局部收益是否曾出现再丢失，而不立即再训。","en":"R19 completed the separate-clipping experiment after the caller repair. It restored the selected R11 model, not R14 or the short R17 weights, and accepted 17,280 new transitions, optimized 16,384 and completed 1,024 updates. The short checks and both strict client-runtime replays passed. Five-second confirmations fell from 11/16 to 8/16. Neither policy had an observed strict ten-second stable recovery, and four trained-policy confirmations had insufficient follow-up. Across eight normal roads, qualified progress fell from 513.15 to 492.35 and bends from 47 to 46; four roads improved, four worsened and none finished. Probes suggested possible interference in the shared readout, so I next evaluated intermediate checkpoints before training again.","title_zh":"独立裁剪预算完整训练后，普通路和恢复总体未改善","id":"step-204","summary_en":"The completed clipping experiment lost normal-road progress and did not yield observed ten-second stable recovery. I next checked intermediate models.","summary_zh":"分开梯度限制的完整实验降低了普通道路进度，也未观察到十秒稳定恢复。我接着检查中间模型。"},{"title_en":"Intermediate gains were brief and confined to one recovery case","zh":"R20没有继续学习。它把R11参考与R19的6,144、12,288、16,384三个检查点，依次放到同四条新开发道路和三个起点上，共48次固定权重驾驶。这样比较的是同一批路，而不是用不同随机道路拼出学习曲线。\n\n正常驾驶合格进度依次约131.62、65.80、64.23、63.72。两个中间版本各有1/8恢复通过十秒稳定，且是同一条路的同一负向外偏案例；分别在规定窗口结束约1.85秒和1.20秒后又破带。最后版本连这个有限收益也失去。所有检查点都没有全尾段稳定。我因此保留普通驾驶更强的R11作下轮父节点，只针对读出共享层的梯度路由提出新实验。","en":"R20 did no learning. It evaluated the R11 reference and R19 checkpoints at 6,144, 12,288 and 16,384 optimized transitions on the same four newly captured development roads and three starts, giving 48 fixed-weight drives. Normal qualified progress was about 131.62, 65.80, 64.23 and 63.72. Both intermediate models passed the ten-second recovery test in one of eight cases—the same road and negative-outward start—but left the band again about 1.85 and 1.20 seconds after follow-up ended. The final model lost that gain, and no checkpoint stayed stable through its full saved tail. I retained R11's stronger ordinary-driving model as the next parent and tested one change to readout gradient routing.","title_zh":"检查学习中段：少数短暂恢复，没有找回普通路能力","id":"step-205","summary_en":"Intermediate recovery gains appeared only in the same single case and later disappeared. I returned to R11 for the next training change.","summary_zh":"中间恢复改善只出现在同一个案例，随后又消失。我回到R11，测试下一项训练修改。"},{"title_en":"Keep value-loss gradients out of the shared driving layers","zh":"R21再次从R11选中版本开始。动作和值预测共用的读出中间层，此前会同时收到两项目标的更新。现在只把这两个共享参数的当前梯度换成动作与探索项的导数；价值输出仍学习，其他梯度、前向计算和完整Adam历史保留。优先改这里，是为了单独检验已有探针指出的干扰可能。\n\n本轮完成16,384条新优化样本和1,024次更新。普通八路合格进度342.02变343.47，弯道26变25，结果混合。开发集十秒稳定仍为零，保留集从零变两例，恰是同一28号路的两个起点。它们更早确认、保持更久；后来一度只因朝向略超5度破带，约0.2秒后重入，不能说那一刻已离路。接下来我只用开发记录研究较长振荡，选择R21最后版本继续。","en":"R21 restarted from the selected R11 model. Its shared readout trunk had received both action-selection and value-prediction gradients. I replaced the current gradients of its two shared parameters with action-and-entropy gradients, while the value output continued learning. Other gradients, forward calculation and saved Adam state stayed unchanged. The run completed 16,384 new optimized transitions and 1,024 updates. Normal qualified progress changed from 342.02 to 343.47 and bends from 26 to 25. Ten-second stability stayed at zero on development roads and rose from zero to two held-out cases, both starts on road 28. Those cases confirmed earlier and held longer; later small heading breaches reentered in about 0.2 seconds. I selected the final R21 model and studied the longer oscillations.","title_zh":"让价值预测的当前梯度不再改动共同驾驶读出","id":"step-206","summary_en":"Keeping value gradients out of the shared driving trunk gave small normal-road changes and two stable held-out recoveries on one road.","summary_zh":"把价值梯度挡在共享驾驶读出之外，带来很小的普通驾驶变化，并在同一道路得到两次稳定留出恢复。"},{"title_en":"Measure the real time between correction and renewed drift","zh":"要把一次纠偏与几秒后的后果联系起来，先要知道真实步长。我只看开发道路：R21十次首次破带里九次是朝向先超限，八个完整摆动周期中位数6.20秒；训练步长平均约0.233秒。将GAE的lambda从0.95改到0.99，按这个时钟，较早误差影响后续回报的衰减会更慢。它不是把循环记忆硬加长，而是一次更长信用分配的假说。下一轮只改这一项。","en":"I measured timing before deciding how to connect earlier actions with drift several seconds later. On development roads, nine of R21's ten first alignment-band breaches began with heading error. Eight complete oscillation cycles had median duration 6.20 seconds; training steps averaged about 0.233 seconds. Increasing GAE lambda from 0.95 to 0.99 would give earlier errors more weight across that interval when estimating advantages for learning. It would not set a new hard recurrent-memory length. The next run changed that factor alone.","title_zh":"从真实时钟判断纠偏后果跨越多少步","id":"step-207","summary_en":"The saved drives showed several seconds between correction and renewed drift. I tested giving earlier actions more weight over that timescale.","summary_zh":"保存驾驶显示，纠偏与再次偏离之间相隔数秒。我据此测试在这段时间尺度上增加早先动作的权重。"},{"title_en":"An outdated interface check blocked continuation","zh":"R22选择R21最终检查点，计划只把lambda改为0.99。但实际客户端仍导入旧group19的执行合约，而任务配置已经要求新策略的R21完整恢复。作业69秒后在这个重复入口检查被拒。32个真实图形模拟器已经通过GPU和Unity门，模型、优化器和学习尚未构建。这个结果属于整合错误，长信用分配没有得到科学检验。R23接着统一新合约，让准备期和真实客户端使用同一个验证函数。","en":"R22 selected the final R21 checkpoint and planned only to raise lambda to 0.99. The client still imported an old execution check from group 19, although the task required complete R21 restoration. That duplicated check rejected the job after 69 seconds. All 32 graphics environments had passed GPU and Unity startup, but no model or optimizer had been constructed and no learning occurred. R23 made preparation and the real client use the same restoration requirements and validator.","title_zh":"旧接口检查阻挡续训","id":"step-208","summary_en":"A duplicated old interface check rejected the continuation before model construction. I made preparation and execution use the same check.","summary_zh":"重复保留的旧接口检查在模型构建前拒绝续训。我让准备和执行使用同一套检查。"},{"title_en":"Longer credit weighting slightly improved normal-road progress","zh":"R23修正入口后，从R21最终权重和完整优化器继续，实际检验lambda0.99。其他设置保留。它接受17,280条新转移，优化16,384条，1,024次更新完成；52个评估案例和真实图像都保存。\n\n在这批实际配对道路上，普通合格进度由864.24升到886.27，约增加2.55%，弯道78变84，但两边都没有路线完成。恢复方面，16个起点两边都能五秒确认，随后十秒稳定却从8例变6例；全部尾段稳定从1例变0例。新策略16次首次破带都是朝向超限，其中13次一秒内重入。判断因此是普通路局部小增，持续纠偏没有总体改善。下一步先固定权重，检验执行端平滑是否有帮助。","en":"R23 continued the final R21 model and optimizer with lambda 0.99, leaving other settings unchanged. It accepted 17,280 new transitions, optimized 16,384 and completed 1,024 updates; all 52 evaluations and their camera material were saved. On the matched roads, normal qualified progress rose from 864.24 to 886.27, about 2.55%, and bends from 78 to 84, without route completion. Both policies confirmed recovery in all sixteen starts. Subsequent ten-second stability fell from eight to six cases and full-tail stability from one to zero. All sixteen first trained-policy breaches involved heading alone; thirteen reentered within one second. I kept the small normal-road gain distinct from sustained recovery and next tested steering smoothing with fixed models.","title_zh":"更长回报权重略增普通路进度，整体稳定恢复仍未改善","id":"step-209","summary_en":"Longer credit weighting slightly improved normal-road progress, but did not improve sustained recovery overall. I next tested steering smoothing.","summary_zh":"让较早误差保留更多权重，略微改善普通道路进度，却未总体改善持续恢复。我随后测试转向平滑。"},{"title_en":"The fixed-node restriction came from graphics startup checks","zh":"R24排队时，另一台L40节点有空位。但旧图形探针把主机名固定为远程计算机，直接改队列节点会在启动检查失败。我只读检查后确认，这个限制来自图形实现，不是神经模型。我选择保留当前作业等待，下一次提交再实现按真实Slurm主机和GPU身份校验的可移植版本。这里没有取消、替换或多提交一次训练。","en":"Another L40 node had capacity while R24 queued, but the graphics probe required a hardcoded hostname. Moving the existing job there would have failed startup. Read-only inspection located this restriction in graphics setup, not the neural model. I kept the queued job and waited. For the next submission, I planned to identify the host and GPU actually assigned by Slurm. No job was cancelled, replaced or duplicated during this inspection.","title_zh":"发现等待固定节点并非模型限制","id":"step-210","summary_en":"A hardcoded graphics host prevented using another available GPU node. I kept the queued job and made the next graphics setup portable.","summary_zh":"图形程序写死了主机，无法使用另一空闲 GPU 节点。我保留排队作业，在下一版修复可移植性。"},{"title_en":"An extra EGL entry blocked the smoothing comparison","zh":"R24真正启动后仅12秒就停止。实际L40对应的EGL条目已经初始化，UUID和PCI也匹配；另一个条目不能初始化，也没有CUDA身份扩展，旧探针仍要求它具备映射，因而整体拒绝。四臂平滑比较尚无任何案例、模型加载或驾驶数据。这个失败不能回答平滑有没有用。R25接着严格核验被选中的实际GPU，同时记录其他不可用条目，不让它们代替或误伤正确设备。","en":"R24 stopped after twelve seconds. The EGL entry for the allocated L40 initialized and matched its UUID and PCI identity. A second entry could not initialize and lacked the CUDA identity extension, yet the old probe required it too and rejected startup. None of the four smoothing conditions loaded a checkpoint or drove. R25 retained strict checks for the selected allocated GPU while logging unusable extra entries without letting them select or block the working device.","title_zh":"额外不可用图形条目挡住了平滑比较","id":"step-211","summary_en":"The correct GPU passed, but an unusable extra graphics entry blocked startup. I changed how the allocated device was selected.","summary_zh":"正确 GPU 已通过检查，不可用的额外图形条目却阻挡启动。我修正了所分配设备的选择方式。"},{"title_en":"Smoother commands did not consistently improve driving","zh":"R25先修好可移植图形入口，再让R21和R23两个固定权重检查点各用原始转向与alpha0.5平滑，在同四条开发路、三个起点上完成48次驾驶。没有新训练。平滑执行每次只接收一半新命令，另一半来自上次执行值。\n\n转向变化确实下降约16%到17%，但平均绝对朝向误差上升。四臂十秒稳定依次为2/8、2/8、3/8、2/8；R23普通合格进度从217.05降到175.42，约少19.2%。26号路有些案例获益，27号路两策略都恶化，所有普通驾驶仍未完成路线。因此没有采用这项平滑作默认。下一阶段保留R23原始转向，另问：让核心知道刚才的动作、速度和转动，是否更有帮助？","en":"R25 repaired portable graphics startup, then tested the fixed R21 and R23 models with raw steering and alpha-0.5 smoothing. Four matched development roads and three starts gave 48 drives, with no learning. The filter used half the new command and half the previous executed command. Steering variation fell about 16–17%, but mean absolute heading error increased. Ten-second stability across the four conditions was 2, 2, 3 and 2 cases out of eight. For R23, normal qualified progress fell from 217.05 to 175.42, about 19.2%. Some road-26 cases benefited; road 27 worsened for both models. No normal route finished. I kept raw R23 steering and next tested movement information instead.","title_zh":"转向更平滑，普通路进度反而下降","id":"step-212","summary_en":"Smoothing reduced command changes but increased heading error and often hurt progress. I kept the raw controller for the next input experiment.","summary_zh":"平滑减少了命令变化，却增加朝向误差，且常损害进度。下一次输入实验保留原始转向。"},{"title_en":"Smoothing reduced the action penalty but increased tracking penalties","zh":"平滑让动作变化小了，为何总效果更差？我按原公式重算48次保存驾驶的奖励，连终止代价也保留。动作变化代价确实减少，朝向和距离代价却增加。原奖励本来已经惩罚动作变化，所以再盲加同一项缺少依据。这个纯数据检查帮助我把下一步留给新的信息输入，而不是同时再改奖励。","en":"I reconstructed the original reward, including terminal costs, for all 48 saved smoothing drives. The filter reduced steering-change costs but increased heading and distance costs. Reward already penalized changing the steering, so these results gave no reason to add another such penalty at the same time. I kept the next experiment focused on providing movement information rather than also changing its reward.","title_zh":"检查平滑省下的动作代价是否抵消误差","id":"step-213","summary_en":"Smoothing saved steering-change cost but increased heading and distance costs. I kept the next experiment focused on movement information.","summary_zh":"平滑降低了转向变化代价，却增加朝向和距离代价。我让下一次实验专门测试运动信息。"},{"title_en":"Feed recent movement into the recurrent core","zh":"新的问题是：只看相机的控制器，能否从自身近期动作和运动得到帮助？我加入三项因果输入：上一次已接受的执行转向、测得车速，以及前后两个已接受端点算出的转动速度。它们不含道路偏移、道路朝向或正确转向答案。\n\n三项数值通过一个初始全零的映射送到3,324个R1–R6细胞，再经过原循环核心影响动作；没有直接接到动作头。映射共有9,972个权重，使用独立的新Adam状态。两条件都从同一R23最终检查点和完整旧Adam开始，同架构、同道路和训练量；一边收真实三项，另一边收零。零初始化让开始时仍等同原策略。真正比较之前，必须先核对在线采集、历史重算和更新看到的是同一段输入。","en":"I asked whether the camera-only controller could use its recent actions and motion. Three added values came only from earlier accepted data: previous executed steering, measured speed and yaw rate estimated from preceding endpoints. They supplied no road offset, route heading or correct action. A new linear map with 9,972 weights sent them to 3,324 R1–R6 cells through tanh and the recurrent core, without a shortcut to the steering head. The map began at zero and used a fresh separate Adam optimizer. Both conditions restored the same final R23 model and inherited optimizer state; one received real movement values, the other zeros. Before comparing driving, I checked consistency between live collection, history replay and learning inputs.","title_zh":"把刚才如何转向、车速和转动送进神经核心","id":"step-214","summary_en":"I added recent steering and motion through the neural core, then compared real movement inputs with zeros from the same R23 starting model.","summary_zh":"我把近期转向和运动信息送入神经核心，再从同一R23模型比较真实运动输入与零输入。"},{"title_en":"The first gradient test used actions with zero policy-score derivative","zh":"R26运行173秒，两个正式训练条件都未开始。短诊断先用策略均值动作，再要求同策略重放时动作分数梯度非零；对正态策略，固定动作恰等于均值时，这个导数就是零。于是诊断本身退化，不能据此说核心不响应。失败前的64段body物理动作和相机有部分记录，但完整案例行与分量计数在门后才发布，已来不及保存。下一版改用真正抽样的诊断动作，并在判断之前先写出数据和各分量。","en":"R26 lasted 173 seconds and started neither formal training condition. Its diagnostic chose the policy's mean action, then demanded a nonzero action-score gradient when replaying that fixed action under the unchanged Normal policy. The derivative was zero at the mean by construction, so the probe was unsuitable; it did not demonstrate an unresponsive core. Some vehicle-step and camera evidence survived, but complete case rows and component counts were only published after the failing check. I changed the diagnostic to sample actions and save its rows and counts before deciding pass or fail.","title_zh":"诊断动作选在均值，要求检查的导数本来就是零","id":"step-215","summary_en":"The probe chose a mean action whose required derivative was zero by construction. I replaced it with sampled diagnostic actions.","summary_zh":"诊断选用了均值动作，其要求检查的导数按公式就是零。我改用抽样诊断动作。"},{"title_en":"Gradient checks passed, then a permission flag blocked execution","zh":"R27改用抽样诊断动作后，实际核心、动作与价值输出路径都得到非零梯度证据，18项比较通过，参数和两个优化器也精确回滚。64条body诊断行先保存下来。随后新parity检查切入候选模式，却没取得旧R8包装器的门内许可，175秒后停止。零条件和正式学习仍未开始。下轮因此只修新增九参数叶的许可生命周期，旧八参数叶证明仍保留待定，不伪造为已通过。","en":"With sampled diagnostic actions, R27 found the required nonzero core, action and value-output gradients. Eighteen comparisons passed, parameters and both optimizers rolled back exactly, and sixty-four movement-feedback diagnostic rows were saved. The next consistency check selected the new calculation without setting the permission flag required by the older R8 wrapper. The job stopped after 175 seconds, before zero-feedback checks or formal learning. I next gave the expanded check, covering nine parameter tensors, its own execution-permission procedure. The older eight-tensor check remained pending rather than being relabelled passed.","title_zh":"梯度路径通过，下一项检查却缺少执行许可","id":"step-216","summary_en":"The required gradient paths worked, but a permission flag blocked the next consistency test. I gave the new input map its own checked execution state.","summary_zh":"所需梯度路径正常，但许可标记阻挡了下一项一致性测试。我为新输入映射建立独立的执行检查状态。"},{"title_en":"Check the new feedback map independently","zh":"新增反馈参数后，不能借用旧模型的通过标记。R28给新的九参数叶证明单独管理临时许可：只在真实检查期间允许候选执行，成功才授予新运行许可，失败就清除并回到参考模式。重复的非零探针和零映射检查也要正常工作。源检查完成并封存后，CSC登录服务因安全事件中断，此时还没有R28 GPU作业。下一步换到官方仍可用的计算应用控制入口，科学源保持原样。","en":"R28 handled the new feedback map's validation state separately from the old model's pass flag. It permitted the candidate calculation only during its check, enabled normal use after success and cleared permission on failure before returning to the reference. Repeated nonzero-input and zero-map tests were also required. After source checks and sealing, a security event interrupted CSC login access. No R28 GPU job existed then. I used an available official compute application for control while keeping the scientific source unchanged.","title_zh":"为新增反馈映射建立独立检查状态","id":"step-217","summary_en":"The new feedback map needed its own checks rather than reusing an older model's pass flag. Access interruption then delayed deployment.","summary_zh":"新反馈映射需要自己的检查，不能借用旧模型的通过标记。随后访问中断又推迟了部署。"},{"title_en":"The first official compute-shell application was unusable","zh":"登录节点关闭后，官方计算应用仍可用。第一次申请的是独立的一CPU、2GiB控制作业，不是训练GPU。应用缺少tmux，处理程序又尝试了已关闭的登录SSH路径，所以没有可用终端。我通过官方界面取消这个已有作业；实际326秒和0.067917 CPU BU保留。下一次是单独保留预算、经过诊断的官方VS Code应用，不把这次管理失败藏进科学实验。","en":"The first alternative was an official CPU control application with one CPU and two GiB, not a training GPU. It lacked tmux, and its handler attempted the unavailable login SSH route, leaving no usable terminal. I cancelled that application through the official interface and kept its measured 326 seconds and 0.067917 CPU BU. I then requested a separately reserved official VS Code application. This was a failed control-access attempt, before the feedback comparison ran.","title_zh":"首个官方终端应用不可用，另试编辑器应用","id":"step-218","summary_en":"The first official CPU control application provided no usable terminal. I stopped that application and tried the official editor application separately.","summary_zh":"第一个官方 CPU 控制应用没有提供可用终端。我停止该应用，再单独尝试官方编辑器应用。"},{"title_en":"A fresh control terminal could submit the independent GPU job","zh":"第二个官方应用提供了可用VS Code终端。我核对账户身份、进程、作业cgroup与Slurm身份，只允许这个控制作业存在时提交独立GPU子作业。它分配一CPU、2GiB，不训练模型；GPU也不依赖终端一直在线。后来实际CPU主行是7,209秒，比原上限多九秒，真实费用1.501875 CPU BU如实保留。接下来用独立控制程序包部署原R28科学源。","en":"The VS Code application supplied a working terminal. I verified its user, process, job cgroup and Slurm identity before permitting GPU submission from it. It used one CPU and two GiB, with no model training; the submitted GPU job could run independently of the terminal. Its eventual CPU record showed 7,209 seconds, nine beyond the requested limit, and 1.501875 CPU BU. I retained the overrun and used this validated control context to deploy the unchanged R28 scientific program through a separate control package.","title_zh":"VS Code计算应用提供可用控制终端","id":"step-219","summary_en":"The editor application provided a valid control terminal. The GPU job could run independently after submission.","summary_zh":"编辑器应用提供了有效控制终端。提交后，GPU 作业可以独立运行。"},{"title_en":"Change the control software without changing the scientific comparison","zh":"R29是控制层版本，不是另一个训练条件。它负责核验CPU上下文、部署、一次提交、资金与结果检查；GPU主控仍调用封存的R28图形和学习程序。提交子进程清理继承的Slurm变量，让新分配拥有自己的真实身份。我也修了排序JSON导致上下文摘要不一致的问题。真实准备核验和verify-only通过后，只创建一个GPU作业2355497。这样访问方式变了，科学问题没有一起改变。","en":"R29 changed control access, deployment and submission, not the feedback condition. It validated the CPU job and handled one GPU submission, funding and inspection while the GPU coordinator still invoked the sealed R28 programs. The submission child cleared inherited Slurm variables so the new allocation would have its own identity. I also repaired a context-hash mismatch caused by JSON key ordering. Verified preparation and verification-only execution then produced GPU job 2355497. The scientific question and runtime remained unchanged.","title_zh":"更换部署控制途径，科学程序保持不变","id":"step-220","summary_en":"I changed the deployment and submission route while keeping the scientific program fixed. This was a control-layer revision, not a new feedback condition.","summary_zh":"我改变部署和提交途径，保持科学程序不变。这是控制流程修订，没有增加反馈实验条件。"},{"title_en":"The movement-feedback run stopped at 7,680 optimized transitions","zh":"R28这次真正进入学习，body臂接受9,543条新转移，优化7,680条，完成480次更新。零反馈臂还没有开始，所以等量比较尚未完成。故障发生在20号环境：请求转向约−0.4861，回显却是−0.6152，物理时间已经前进；该步被拒，没有奖励或学习行。\n\n接着暴露第二个错误。已接受的数据和反馈历史还停在旧端点，更新前bootstrap却去查询新物理端点；普通重置又排在优化完成之后。旧历史检查正确地拒绝了这种拼接。我因此能定位bootstrap、反馈历史和reset的顺序问题，却仍不知道最初echo为何不匹配。保存的28个评估只是父基线与早期技术检查，没有7,680样本版本的最终驾驶结果。下一版先保护旧prefix，再重置，再允许更新。","en":"R28 entered learning and accepted 9,543 movement-feedback transitions, optimized 7,680 and completed 480 updates. Zero feedback had not started. In environment 20, steering about −0.4861 was requested, but the later vehicle message reported −0.6152 after the car had advanced. The interval was rejected before reward or learning. A second error then appeared: accepted data and feedback history ended earlier, while pre-update value estimation queried the later physical state; reset was scheduled after optimization. The stale-history check rejected that mismatch. The original command-report fault remained unexplained. The 28 saved evaluations were parent baselines and early technical tests, not final evaluations of the 7,680-transition model. I next preserved the valid earlier data and required reset before updates.","title_zh":"反馈条件训练7,680步后，保存历史与车辆状态冲突","id":"step-221","summary_en":"The first feedback training stopped after real learning when command reporting and saved history diverged. The matched zero-feedback condition had not started.","summary_zh":"首次反馈训练已完成部分真实学习，随后命令回传与保存历史不一致而停止。匹配的零反馈条件尚未开始。"},{"title_en":"Keep valid earlier steps before resetting a failed simulator","zh":"R30针对已定位的顺序错误修复。拒绝动作之前，先缓存与同一车道、策略版本、相机、循环状态和反馈历史绑定的价值；异常车道用它给旧prefix做bootstrap，不向新端点继续前向。重置必须真正完成并join后，才允许裁剪数据或Adam更新，旧历史保护仍开启。这一阶段先完成源与纯数据检查，远程维护尚未恢复。两条件真实短检查和完整比较留到后续实际运行时验证。","en":"R30 repaired that ordering. Before an action that might be rejected, it cached a value estimate tied to the same simulator, policy version, image, recurrent state and feedback history. If the action failed, this cached value completed the return estimate for earlier accepted steps instead of evaluating the later physical endpoint. Reset had to finish before trimming data or running Adam, and the stale-history check stayed active. I prepared source and saved-data checks during remote maintenance. Both-condition recovery and the integrated driving comparison still needed a later run.","title_zh":"重置故障模拟器前，先保留此前有效步骤","id":"step-222","summary_en":"A rejected action had moved the physical car beyond its saved history. I cached the earlier value estimate and completed reset before learning could resume.","summary_zh":"被拒绝动作已把真实车辆带到保存历史之后。我缓存此前的价值估计，并要求重置结束后才继续学习。"},{"title_en":"Use a fresh official control job after service restoration","zh":"服务恢复后，旧VS Code作业已经结束，不能复用同一页面冒充有效计算上下文。新的2384782仍是一CPU、2GiB官方控制应用，用来取得旧作业真实主行、结算并部署R30/R31。GPU子作业在它生存期内独立提交。它后来实际运行7,219秒，十九秒超限和1.503959 CPU BU单独保留。R31只是控制程序包，接下来科学结果看R30的2386994。","en":"After service returned, the earlier VS Code job had expired, so its old page was no longer a valid compute context. Official CPU job 2384782 provided one CPU and two GiB for retrieving old accounting records, settling existing work and deploying R30 with the R31 control program. It submitted its independent GPU child while valid. The CPU later recorded 7,219 seconds, a nineteen-second overrun, and 1.503959 CPU BU. R31 was the control revision; the scientific result belonged to R30 GPU job 2386994.","title_zh":"服务恢复后，新的官方CPU控制应用","id":"step-223","summary_en":"The old control terminal had expired. A new CPU application supplied a valid context for deploying and submitting the independent GPU job.","summary_zh":"旧控制终端已到期。新的 CPU 应用为部署和提交独立 GPU 作业提供了有效环境。"},{"title_en":"A command-echo failure stopped the parent baseline before learning","zh":"R30的两个全局短检查都通过了，包括成功物理步之后人为标记拒绝的恢复检查。但body臂进入真正的父策略普通驾驶基线时，26号开发路在2,615次已接受决策之后出现了真实异常：新的极小负转向发出并刷新后，连续四个真实帧仍回显旧的正转向。差值超过原1e−5门，该步被拒并刹车。\n\n完整八路父基线门因此中止，body新学习和零臂学习都为零。这也揭示了短检查范围：成功step后的人为拒绝，没有覆盖env.step本身抛错的分支。另一条正指数格式小命令能正常反映，所以不能把根因直接归给科学记数法。下一步做有限、无模型的命令矩阵，并补上生产采集与评估中的真实异常恢复检查。","en":"Both short R30 system checks passed, including recovery after a rejection deliberately added after a successful physical step. The real parent normal-driving baseline then failed on development road 26 after 2,615 accepted decisions. A tiny negative command was sent and refreshed, but four vehicle-data frames still reported the previous positive steering value, beyond the original 1e-5 tolerance. The action was rejected and braking followed. Since all eight parent roads had to complete, the run stopped before movement-feedback learning; zero feedback never started. The short test had not exercised an exception thrown inside env.step itself. Another positive exponent-form command had worked, so scientific notation alone did not explain the failure. I next used finite model-free command probes and added tests of the real collection and evaluation exception branches.","title_zh":"父策略评估中的真实命令回传故障打断运行","id":"step-224","summary_en":"A real command-report failure interrupted the parent baseline before either feedback condition learned. It exposed an exception path the earlier short test had missed.","summary_zh":"真实命令回传故障在父策略基线阶段打断运行，两反馈条件都未学习。它暴露了短时测试漏掉的异常分支。"},{"title_en":"Trace command delivery while the intermittent cause remained unknown","zh":"我回看原始事件，而不是先改动作门。165个成功动作也曾出现一到三个旧echo帧，其中11次到第四帧才匹配；失败例四帧仍旧。静态代码里没有找到接近零时特殊截断的分支，另有PID写者虽在代码中存在，实际是否激活没有记录。命令处理、采集和遥测时序因此值得检查，但echo本身只是请求字段，不是机械轮角。下一项有限诊断保留这些未定原因，不预先宣布修好了哪一种故障。","en":"I inspected the saved messages before changing the command check. Even 165 successful actions had one to three initial frames reporting old steering; eleven matched only on the fourth frame. The failed action reported the old value in all four. Static code inspection found no special near-zero truncation rule. Another PID command writer existed in the source, but the records did not show it active. The echo field reported a control value, not measured mechanical wheel angle. I kept the root cause open and used the next diagnostic to investigate command handling and message timing.","title_zh":"从原始消息检查旧报告与新命令的边界","id":"step-225","summary_en":"The saved messages showed delayed command reports, but did not establish their cause. I kept the command check and designed a finite diagnostic.","summary_zh":"保存消息显示命令回传存在延迟，却没有查明起因。我保留命令检查，设计有限次诊断。"},{"title_en":"A fresh control job enabled the limited diagnosis","zh":"旧控制作业自然超时后，继续诊断需要新的真实上下文。2393329是一次另行授权的官方CPU应用，一CPU、2GiB、两小时，无GPU；旧账本的超限和阻塞状态都没有清除。它支持后面的R32到R35有限诊断，自身在7,218秒后自然结束，十八秒超限和1.503750 CPU BU保留。下一次生产修复使用另一个已核验的新上下文，不能延长或复用这个过期终端。","en":"When the previous control application timed out, official CPU job 2393329 supplied a new valid terminal: one CPU, two GiB and two hours, with no GPU. Existing overrun records and the accounting sidecar's blocked status were retained. The job supported R32–R35 diagnostics and ended naturally after 7,218 seconds. Its eighteen-second overrun and 1.503750 CPU BU were recorded. Production integration later used another validated control context rather than extend or reuse the expired one.","title_zh":"命令诊断改用新的官方CPU控制应用","id":"step-226","summary_en":"The control terminal expired before diagnosis finished. I used a fresh CPU application and recorded its resource use separately.","summary_zh":"诊断完成前控制终端到期。我使用新的 CPU 应用，并单独记录其资源用量。"},{"title_en":"The model-free test checked the wrong legacy launcher","zh":"R32原本只想测试命令和接收过程，不建神经模型。但新入口沿用了旧上下文的默认CUDA启动器核验，检查了一个与当前无模型协议不相干的启动器。作业四秒就被拒，还没有运行目录、模拟器进程或驾驶。我把它作为入口整合遗漏保留。R33只显式选择无模型上下文，同时独立核验真正使用的官方解释器，不删除源身份检查。","en":"R32 was a command-and-reception diagnostic that did not need a neural model. Its new entry point nevertheless inherited a default check for an unrelated old CUDA launcher. The allocation stopped after four seconds, before a run directory, simulator or drive existed. I saved that entry failure. R33 explicitly selected the model-free source context while separately verifying the official interpreter it would use; source-identity checks remained active.","title_zh":"无模型诊断误检查了无关旧启动器","id":"step-227","summary_en":"A command-only diagnostic stopped because its launcher checked an unrelated model program. I selected the correct diagnostic environment.","summary_zh":"纯命令诊断因启动器检查了无关模型程序而停止。我修正为该诊断自己的运行环境。"},{"title_en":"The same path named different files across the container boundary","zh":"R33接着在两秒内被解释器身份门拒绝。原因是同一路径在宿主机上是2,432字节shell启动器，在官方容器内却是约31MB的Python3.12.13二进制；旧检查把两个命名空间里的对象当成同一个文件。随后同CPU的纯标准库检查实际确认了这个边界，没有运行模型或车辆。R34因此分别固定外层启动器和内层二进制，并在真实容器里先做API预检。","en":"R33 stopped at its interpreter check after two seconds. The same path referred to a 2,432-byte shell launcher on the host and an approximately 31-MB Python 3.12.13 binary inside the official container. The check had incorrectly treated those different objects as one file. A standard-library inspection on the same CPU confirmed the distinction without model or vehicle execution. R34 verified the outer launcher and inner binary separately and checked the API inside the real container before allocating the diagnostic.","title_zh":"同一路径在主机与容器中指向不同程序","id":"step-228","summary_en":"The same path referred to different files on the host and in the container. I verified the launcher and interpreter separately.","summary_zh":"同一路径在主机和容器内指向不同文件。我分别核对启动脚本和解释器。"},{"title_en":"The real environment expected one steering value","zh":"R34已经过真实容器预检，也启动了一个通过GPU、帧缓冲、VirtualGL、Unity和道路重置的模拟器。但第一段诊断前缀就传错了动作形状：旧环境要一个策略转向值，诊断却给了两个数。原C15转换器本来负责再加固定油门。作业65秒后停止，未完成命令探测。这次失败于是只修三个step调用点的单值适配，并让真实转换器同时进入预检。","en":"R34 passed container checks and started one simulator with GPU, framebuffer, VirtualGL, Unity, road registration and neutral reset. The first diagnostic then supplied two action values, although the inherited policy interface expected steering alone. The existing C15 converter already added fixed throttle. The job stopped after 65 seconds without completing a command probe. I added one scalar adapter at the three step call sites and tested the real converter during preparation.","title_zh":"第一个真实诊断步传入了错误的动作形状","id":"step-229","summary_en":"The diagnostic sent two action values to an interface expecting steering alone. I fixed the adapter before testing command delivery.","summary_zh":"诊断向只接受转向值的接口发送了两个动作值。我先修正适配器，再测命令传递。"},{"title_en":"All 36 command probes matched, without reproducing the intermittent fault","zh":"R35把六种字面命令各重复三次，分别走原env.step和新的连续采集加查询路径，共36次。全部端点匹配请求的float32值；35次首帧就匹配，一次普通小数命令到第二帧才匹配。原失败的极小指数值六次都首帧匹配，所以没有复现原间歇故障。\n\n记录范围也要说清：144个探测遥测帧保存了数值，新路径保存72张JPEG和注册图；旧通用回调被C10接收函数绕过，未达到最初“全部相机帧”的声明。下一版因此在真正解码wire的位置保存图像，并测试多模拟器和真实异常分支。","en":"R35 tested six literal commands three times in each of two modes: the original env.step route and continuous capture with queries. All 36 endpoint reports matched the requested float32 values. Thirty-five matched on the first frame; one fixed-decimal command matched on the second. The original tiny exponent-form value matched on the first frame in all six tests, so the intermittent fault did not recur. All 144 numeric frames survived, and the new path saved 72 JPEGs plus registration data. The original general callback had been bypassed by C10 receiving, leaving its promised image coverage incomplete. I next recorded at message decoding and tested exceptions with multiple simulators.","title_zh":"36个命令对比都匹配，间歇故障没有复现","id":"step-230","summary_en":"Every command probe matched its requested endpoint, so the intermittent fault did not recur. Missing image capture led to a change in recording location.","summary_zh":"所有命令探针的终点都与请求匹配，间歇故障未再出现。图像采集缺失促使我改变记录位置。"},{"title_en":"Capture all messages and test recovery through real exception paths","zh":"生产修复不再借用失效回调。新接收节奏一次连续取得四个真实源帧，再暂停、排空和按原时钟处理，保留原截止时间与1e−5端点门。图像在真正wire解码边界保存。采集分支遇到真实typed echo异常时，用缓存bootstrap、先join重置再Adam；固定权重评估则保留失败attempt，只允许同路同起点完整重做一次。评审又补齐超时、清标记和次要异常处理。源码通过仍不是实际车辆通过，下一步在多模拟器短检查里验证。","en":"The production repair captured four real source frames continuously, then paused the producer, drained the queue and processed those frames with their original clocks, deadlines and 1e-5 endpoint check. Images were saved as the network messages were decoded, instead of through the inactive callback. Collection handled a real steering-report exception using the cached value estimate and completed reset before Adam updates. Fixed-weight evaluation kept the failed attempt and allowed at most one complete replacement on the same road and start. I also repaired deadline, flag-cleanup and secondary-error handling. The next step validated this code under multi-simulator load.","title_zh":"连续取四帧，并补上真正拒绝动作的两条恢复路径","id":"step-231","summary_en":"I recorded images where messages were decoded and tested the real command-error branches. Reset had to finish before updates or replacement evaluation.","summary_zh":"我在消息解码位置记录图像，并测试真实命令异常分支。更新或替代评估前都必须先完成重置。"},{"title_en":"The GPU experiment continued after its control session ended","zh":"2393329自然结束后，生产集成使用新的2397480官方CPU应用。一CPU、2GiB的控制上下文重新核验，重排队关闭，旧超限全部保留。它支持R36与R38的准备和提交；到7,218秒自然超时后，R38 GPU监督器仍独立运行。十八秒超限和1.503750 CPU BU单独记录。这让我能把控制终端寿命与真正的训练寿命分开，不把终端结束误写成训练中断。","en":"After CPU job 2393329 expired, official application 2397480 provided a new one-CPU, two-GiB control context. Its identity was rechecked, requeue was disabled and earlier overruns remained recorded. It supported R36 and R38 preparation and submission. When it timed out after 7,218 seconds, the independent R38 GPU supervisor continued. Its eighteen-second overrun and 1.503750 CPU BU were accounted separately. Expiry of the control terminal therefore did not interrupt GPU training.","title_zh":"生产修复与最终比较使用独立CPU控制应用","id":"step-232","summary_en":"The GPU supervisor continued after the CPU control application expired. Control access and training therefore had separate lifetimes.","summary_zh":"CPU 控制应用到期后，GPU 管理程序继续运行。控制访问和训练因此有各自的生命周期。"},{"title_en":"Resetting all 32 simulators at once exceeded the time limit","zh":"R36先做32owner负载与恢复检查，却在任何评分动作之前运行164秒后失败。新增诊断直接让32台一起重置，绕过了原来每批最多八台并等待完成的调度器，耗尽原两秒有效接收预算。所有原始重置结果和图像仍被保存。这是我新增门的接线错误，没有复现R30的转向故障。R38只恢复原分批重置路径，评分负载仍保留32台同时运行，科学条件和时间门不改。","en":"R36 was intended to check load and recovery across 32 simulators before training. It failed after 164 seconds, before any scored action. My added diagnostic reset all 32 at once, bypassing the original dispatcher, which reset at most eight and waited for each group to finish. That exhausted the unchanged two-second active-receive limit. Raw reset outcomes and images were saved. This was a mistake in the added startup test, separate from R30's unexplained steering-report failure. R38 restored the original grouped resets while keeping 32 simultaneous simulators for the scored load test and the same scientific settings.","title_zh":"同时重置32个模拟器，耗尽接收时限","id":"step-233","summary_en":"My load test reset every simulator at once and exceeded the receive-time limit. I restored the original batched resets for the next run.","summary_zh":"我的负载测试同时重置全部模拟器，超过了接收时限。我在下一次运行恢复原来的分组重置。"},{"title_en":"Both conditions passed load and command-error recovery checks","zh":"R38恢复分批重置后，两个条件各完成32台乘16步的负载检查，再完成各64步全局短检查。还各自在采集和固定权重评估中，用明确的错误wire命令制造真实typed拒绝。旧prefix保留，拒绝步没有奖励或PPO行，重置完成后才接受下一步；评估失败attempt保留，整例重做而不拼接。合计1,162个已接受诊断动作、四个受控拒绝，参数与两个优化器不变。这次门真正覆盖生产异常分支，然后才允许正式学习。","en":"With grouped resets restored, both R38 conditions completed the 32-simulator-by-16-step load test and their 64-step short checks. Each also deliberately sent a wrong wire command to trigger the real rejection exception in collection and fixed-weight evaluation. Valid earlier steps survived, the rejected interval produced no reward or PPO row, and reset finished before the next accepted step. Evaluation kept the failed attempt and repeated the whole case. Across startup checks there were 1,162 accepted diagnostic actions and four controlled rejections, with parameters and both optimizers unchanged. The production exception paths were now exercised before formal learning.","title_zh":"两个条件通过负载和命令异常恢复检查","id":"step-234","summary_en":"Both feedback conditions passed load and deliberately triggered command-error checks. Valid earlier steps survived, rejected actions stayed out of learning, and resets finished first.","summary_zh":"两个反馈条件都通过负载和人为触发的命令异常检查。此前有效步骤得到保留，拒绝动作不进入学习，重置先行完成。"},{"title_en":"The completed feedback comparison stayed close to its parent","zh":"最后，R38的两个条件都完成了预定学习。它们各自从同一个R23最终检查点和完整旧Adam开始，另建独立的零映射和新Adam。真实反馈与零输入是预定差别；道路、起点、奖励、原始转向、学习率和更新设置一致。两边的旧连接增益和读出都继续训练，固定参数与图结构保持。每边接受17,280条新转移，优化16,384条，1,024次更新使用65,536个样本；896条接受数据未优化。\n\n每边13批评估首次完成，没有技术替换。最后普通驾驶合格进度为440.69和444.90，真实反馈在八条配对路都略低。双方各通过175个可用弯道中的32个，路线完成都是0/8，全部最终普通驾驶止于大偏离门。\n\n恢复结果混合。五秒确认是15/16对16/16；随后十秒稳定是3/16对2/16。零条件24号开发路负向起点在60秒上限前没有足够后续窗口，结局未知；真实反馈26号路正向起点约36.4秒结束，未五秒确认。同一父策略重复评估已经出现0对1例稳定差。我因此说，在这次预算和单次续训下没有清楚的总体收益，保留全部案例供检查。","en":"R38 completed both feedback conditions. Each restored the same final R23 model and inherited Adam state, then added its own zero-initialized input map and fresh optimizer. Roads, starts, reward, raw steering and learning settings were matched; real movement values versus zeros were the intended input difference. Both conditions continued learning existing connection gains, readout and exploration scale while fixed parameters and topology stayed unchanged. Each accepted 17,280 new transitions, optimized 16,384 in 1,024 updates and used them 65,536 times; 896 accepted transitions were not optimized. All thirteen evaluation batches per condition completed on the first attempt. Final normal qualified progress was 440.69 with movement feedback and 444.90 with zeros, with movement feedback lower on all eight roads. Both passed 32/175 bends and finished 0/8 routes. Recovery confirmation was 15/16 versus 16/16; ten-second stability was 3/16 versus 2/16. One zero-feedback follow-up ended at the sixty-second cap before stability could be judged. Parent repeats already differed by one stable case. With one continuation per condition, the comparison showed no clear overall benefit.","title_zh":"两个反馈条件都完成，未显示明确总体收益","id":"step-235","summary_en":"R38 completed equal training and matched evaluation for both inputs. Movement feedback gave slightly less normal-road progress and mixed recovery, with no clear overall benefit.","summary_zh":"R38完成两个输入条件的同量训练和匹配评估。运动反馈的普通道路进度略低，恢复结果混合，没有明确总体收益。"},{"title_en":"Both conditions ended with the same one-sided driving pattern","zh":"汇总表之后，我检查全部16个开发路普通驾驶，而不是挑一段。把父与最终、两个条件的四条路都放进分析，共27次进入较大正偏移且反向朝向误差的区域，没有镜像区域案例，也没有随后回到窄对齐带。每条最后一次访问在记录结束处截尾。相机采样、下行神经元特征和转向仍在变化，失败并非所有输入输出都停住。它们共同呈现迟迟不结束转弯的模式；保存特征不等同完整内部神经活动。","en":"I inspected all sixteen development-road normal drives, covering both parent and final checkpoints in both conditions. They made 27 visits to the defined region of large positive offset and oppositely signed heading error, with no visits to its mirrored region and no later observed return to the narrow alignment band. Each final visit continued until the recording ended. Camera samples, descending-neuron features and steering still changed, so the late-turning pattern was not a completely frozen input or output. These saved features described the available measurements, rather than every internal neural state.","title_zh":"最终两条件都保留同一侧转弯过久的失败模式","id":"step-236","summary_en":"The final recordings retained the same prolonged-turn failure pattern. The recorded images and output features were still changing throughout it.","summary_zh":"最终记录仍保留转弯过久的失败模式。在这个过程中，图像和输出特征仍在变化。"},{"title_en":"One final CPU application supported accounting and archiving","zh":"完整MAIN下载和核验之后，旧控制终端已经结束。我在真实队列为空、另行预留CPU预算后，只启动一个新官方控制应用2404865，用于终端核算与封存。它仍是一CPU、2GiB，无GPU；R38科学运行已经结束，这个新上下文支持它的一次结算。所读记录只给出这个CPU的有效上下文和计划结束时间，自身最终会计仍待核，不能据两小时预约猜实际费用。这个行政缺口与已经完成的双臂科学结果分开。","en":"After the complete main archive was downloaded and verified, the previous control terminal had expired. With an empty owned queue and a separate CPU reservation, official application 2404865 supplied one CPU and two GiB, without a GPU, for final accounting and archiving. The scientific run was already complete and its resource settlement was performed once. The retained record showed this application's valid context and scheduled ending but lacked its own final accounting. I left that charge pending rather than calculate it from the requested two hours. This administrative gap was separate from R38's completed comparison.","title_zh":"完整主档案核验后，再用CPU作业完成归档与核算","id":"step-237","summary_en":"One final CPU application supported archiving and accounting after the scientific run was complete. Its own final charge was not present in the retained record.","summary_zh":"科学运行完成后，最后一个 CPU 应用用于归档和结算。保留记录中仍缺少它自身的最终费用。"},{"title_en":"The 0.080% ratio describes the final model's input amplitudes","zh":"这里的0.080%回答的是输入有多强。我使用R38真实反馈最终检查点的映射权重和24个最终评估里10,671次已接受决策，按保存输入重算注入公式，没有再运行网络或车辆。运动与相机输入都用全部176,422个神经元作共同分母计算均方根幅度，分别约0.00002095和0.02625；前者是后者的约0.080%。八次普通驾驶单独计算约0.078%。\n\n映射的9,972个权重全部非零，但均方根仅0.000433。它说明这个从零开始、在本预算内学出的额外驱动很弱，为表现接近父策略提供一种合理解释。它测量最终检查点的输入幅度，没有直接测量循环核心放大多少、下降输出改变多少，或最终行为改变百分之几。","en":"I used the final R38 movement-feedback map and 10,671 accepted decisions from its 24 final evaluation cases to compare input amplitudes. Saved values were substituted into the injection formulas; neither model nor vehicle ran again. Movement and camera drives used all 176,422 neurons as the common denominator for pooled root-mean-square amplitude. Their amplitudes were about 0.00002095 and 0.02625, giving a movement-to-camera ratio of about 0.080%. The eight normal drives alone gave about 0.078%. All 9,972 map weights were nonzero, with RMS size only 0.000433. The final map produced a weak added drive, one plausible explanation for near-parent performance. This calculation measured input amplitude at the final checkpoint, not its evolution during training, downstream amplification or a percentage effect on steering.","title_zh":"最终运动输入的幅度约为相机输入的0.080%","id":"step-238","summary_en":"I compared the final model's two input amplitudes using saved decisions. Movement input was very small at entry; the separate driving comparison measured the resulting behaviour.","summary_zh":"我用保存决策比较最终模型的两路输入幅度。运动信号在进入网络时很小；两条件的驾驶表现由单独的评估比较。"}];
